(105629, 4489, 3360, '<td valign="top">the composition is good. I would not have shown the words "eye pencil" as it is not necessary and somehow detracts a little. Nonetheless yours was the best of the bunch in my opinion.</td>', 'the composition is good. I would not have shown the words "eye pencil" as it is not necessary and somehow detracts a little. Nonetheless yours was the best of the bunch in my opinion.', '2002-08-19 01:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105630, 4489, 1880, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this photo... The layout lets the pencil lead to you to the eye ... Good Luck ...  RLS</td>', 'I like the composition of this photo... The layout lets the pencil lead to you to the eye ... Good Luck ...  RLS', '2002-08-19 02:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105631, 4489, 51167, '<td valign="top">that is an awesome drawing of the eye.</td>', 'that is an awesome drawing of the eye.', '2002-08-19 02:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105632, 4489, 1827, '<td valign="top">Something about this eye just looks off to me.  Was it printed and the liner is being applied to the paper?  I can''t quite put my finger on what bugs me here.  5</td>', 'Something about this eye just looks off to me.  Was it printed and the liner is being applied to the paper?  I can''t quite put my finger on what bugs me here.  5', '2002-08-19 02:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105633, 4489, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  I feel that the reflections in the eye detract from an otherwise super photo.</td>', 'Very nice composition.  I feel that the reflections in the eye detract from an otherwise super photo.', '2002-08-19 11:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105634, 4489, 2350, '<td valign="top">Great, great photo.</td>', 'Great, great photo.', '2002-08-19 13:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105635, 4489, 1779, '<td valign="top">it look interesting but IMOwhat attracts more is the "other" photo rather than this one...</td>', 'it look interesting but IMOwhat attracts more is the "other" photo rather than this one...', '2002-08-19 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105636, 4489, 2000, '<td valign="top">The glare on the eye, mainly the disc right by the pupil, is distracting here.  I like the level of detail shown otherwise, and it''s a good effort.</td>', 'The glare on the eye, mainly the disc right by the pupil, is distracting here.  I like the level of detail shown otherwise, and it''s a good effort.', '2002-08-19 18:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105637, 4489, 3373, '<td valign="top">I love the subtle accent of the "daisy" in the iris. This photo gets 4 stars and 2 thumbs up.</td>', 'I love the subtle accent of the "daisy" in the iris. This photo gets 4 stars and 2 thumbs up.', '2002-08-19 18:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105638, 4489, 2586, '<td valign="top">Nice touch how you actually used an eye pencil to draw on a drawing. Clever! Good clarity and good composition. Original too. What I don''t like is the finger on the foreground. Because it is so close to the lens it is badly distorted and it reads as a very ugly shape. Because it is in the foreground it attracts quite a bit of attention, too. Otherwise great. 6 Journey</td>', 'Nice touch how you actually used an eye pencil to draw on a drawing. Clever! Good clarity and good composition. Original too. What I don''t like is the finger on the foreground. Because it is so close to the lens it is badly distorted and it reads as a very ugly shape. Because it is in the foreground it attracts quite a bit of attention, too. Otherwise great. 6 Journey', '2002-08-20 00:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105639, 4489, 1143, '<td valign="top">Nice job getting this together. It''s growing on me so I''m bumping it up  :o)  ~nancy</td>', 'Nice job getting this together. It''s growing on me so I''m bumping it up  :o)  ~nancy', '2002-08-20 01:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105640, 4489, 2204, '<td valign="top">At first I thought this was a photograph of a an eye but, on closer examination I think it''s a macro of a real eye.  It''s very good, you will have to clarify this for us when the voting is over. =8 syamjonimi ;''-D</td>', 'At first I thought this was a photograph of a an eye but, on closer examination I think it''s a macro of a real eye.  It''s very good, you will have to clarify this for us when the voting is over. =8 syamjonimi ;''-D', '2002-08-21 15:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105641, 4489, 3087, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this is a photo of an eye coz it looks strangely flat and yet not... because of that I find myself staring at it in a way I wouldn''t necessarily do if it were a straight shot... it just makes it more interesting. <br/>Of course, if it is a real eye, I am talking out of my you know what, but then am left wondering about the angles!<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'I''m guessing this is a photo of an eye coz it looks strangely flat and yet not... because of that I find myself staring at it in a way I wouldn''t necessarily do if it were a straight shot... it just makes it more interesting. Of course, if it is a real eye, I am talking out of my you know what, but then am left wondering about the angles!6, Kavey', '2002-08-21 19:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105642, 4489, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot. I''m guessing that it is a real pencil on a picture of an eye.</td>', 'Very interesting shot. I''m guessing that it is a real pencil on a picture of an eye.', '2002-08-21 20:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105643, 4489, 205, '<td valign="top">is that an eye or a picture of an eye?<br/></td>', 'is that an eye or a picture of an eye?', '2002-08-22 08:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
