(105645, 4489, 1209, '<td valign="top">Clever use of an advertising picture. Certainly makes a person look more than once!  Different take on the  Pencil  theme. Good focus, but in my opinion, it''s cropped a bit tight.</td>', 'Clever use of an advertising picture. Certainly makes a person look more than once!  Different take on the  Pencil  theme. Good focus, but in my opinion, it''s cropped a bit tight.', '2002-08-23 01:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105646, 4489, 2991, '<td valign="top">Great composition and very creative!</td>', 'Great composition and very creative!', '2002-08-24 14:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105647, 4489, 554, '<td valign="top">WOW</td>', 'WOW', '2002-08-24 22:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105648, 4489, 1808, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection in the eye.</td>', 'Nice reflection in the eye.', '2002-08-25 18:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105649, 4489, 2427, '<td valign="top">Clever!</td>', 'Clever!', '2002-08-25 21:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105650, 4489, 3383, '<td valign="top">amazing concept!!!  I loved it</td>', 'amazing concept!!!  I loved it', '2002-08-26 01:45:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(105651, 4489, 472, '<td valign="top">very cool pic :)</td>', 'very cool pic :)', '2002-08-26 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(105652, 4491, 2223, '<td valign="top">thats how my grandpa used to do it..</td>', 'thats how my grandpa used to do it..', '2002-08-19 01:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105653, 4491, 1827, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have see more of the hands, less of the wood.  7</td>', 'I would have liked to have see more of the hands, less of the wood.  7', '2002-08-19 03:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105654, 4491, 3360, '<td valign="top">great content. Well balanced.</td>', 'great content. Well balanced.', '2002-08-19 04:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105655, 4491, 3080, '<td valign="top">My grandpa used to sharpen his pencils with a pocket knife.  I like this photo a lot.  Not afraid to tell you it''s 1 of 6 10''s this week.  The lighting is great, angle is beautiful and it gives a high emotional impact for me as well as pleasing to look at.  I could hang this on my wall.    Great shot and good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'My grandpa used to sharpen his pencils with a pocket knife.  I like this photo a lot.  Not afraid to tell you it''s 1 of 6 10''s this week.  The lighting is great, angle is beautiful and it gives a high emotional impact for me as well as pleasing to look at.  I could hang this on my wall.    Great shot and good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-19 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105656, 4491, 2204, '<td valign="top">Very comforting photo.</td>', 'Very comforting photo.', '2002-08-19 14:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105657, 4491, 2466, '<td valign="top">My papa sharpens pencils like this.  Great hands, too 9</td>', 'My papa sharpens pencils like this.  Great hands, too 9', '2002-08-19 15:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105658, 4491, 327, '<td valign="top">Great idea and an art not everyone can do anymore.  Wish you''d of been closer to the hands..focused on them and less of the distracting background objects. Nice work all the same. Score 7 ~Kee</td>', 'Great idea and an art not everyone can do anymore.  Wish you''d of been closer to the hands..focused on them and less of the distracting background objects. Nice work all the same. Score 7 ~Kee', '2002-08-19 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105659, 4491, 806, '<td valign="top">i''m thinking the old hands need to be a bit further into the shot. good idea tho.</td>', 'i''m thinking the old hands need to be a bit further into the shot. good idea tho.', '2002-08-19 18:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105660, 4491, 2279, '<td valign="top">Looks like a lot of work to sharpen that pencil. He seems up to to task. I really like this picture, especially the composition. 8.</td>', 'Looks like a lot of work to sharpen that pencil. He seems up to to task. I really like this picture, especially the composition. 8.', '2002-08-20 01:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105661, 4491, 2553, '<td valign="top">I love your interpretation for the "Pencil" challenge!  Good composition, lighting and DOF. Nice photo! lhall</td>', 'I love your interpretation for the "Pencil" challenge!  Good composition, lighting and DOF. Nice photo! lhall', '2002-08-20 07:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105662, 4491, 2928, '<td valign="top">Technically unfaultable  I think.  It''s a great shot, not cluttered and really well composed.  The hands look old; but, they also look dependable, hardworking and experienced - like they could do a good job (10)</td>', 'Technically unfaultable  I think.  It''s a great shot, not cluttered and really well composed.  The hands look old; but, they also look dependable, hardworking and experienced - like they could do a good job (10)', '2002-08-20 10:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105663, 4491, 2427, '<td valign="top">Very nostalgic.  Good subject</td>', 'Very nostalgic.  Good subject', '2002-08-20 18:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105664, 4491, 3087, '<td valign="top">Those are fantastic hands, they''d make a great study in their own right, with nothing else, just them on a really plain background. Like this, would like to see it with the wooden plan at more of a diagonal angle from top right to bottom left.<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'Those are fantastic hands, they''d make a great study in their own right, with nothing else, just them on a really plain background. Like this, would like to see it with the wooden plan at more of a diagonal angle from top right to bottom left.5, Kavey', '2002-08-20 18:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105665, 4491, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background8,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,<br/>Total Averaged Rating8.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background8,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,Total Averaged Rating8.   Autool', '2002-08-20 20:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105666, 4491, 3198, '<td valign="top">very nostalgic. reminds me of my grandfather. He had these non-round pencils, so they wouldn''t fit a pencil-sharpener. He worked in construction. thanks</td>', 'very nostalgic. reminds me of my grandfather. He had these non-round pencils, so they wouldn''t fit a pencil-sharpener. He worked in construction. thanks', '2002-08-21 05:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105667, 4491, 2909, '<td valign="top">brings back memories.................. good lighting and texture</td>', 'brings back memories.................. good lighting and texture', '2002-08-21 13:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105668, 4491, 3306, '<td valign="top">excellent. 10</td>', 'excellent. 10', '2002-08-21 21:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105669, 4491, 1759, '<td valign="top">This is very good. The detail is excellent, lighting is perfect, DOF is great, and the arrangement does a nice job of storytelling. (10)</td>', 'This is very good. The detail is excellent, lighting is perfect, DOF is great, and the arrangement does a nice job of storytelling. (10)', '2002-08-21 21:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105670, 4491, 3294, '<td valign="top">I think this "time" piece would be better illustrated in black and white.   Nice shot tho!</td>', 'I think this "time" piece would be better illustrated in black and white.   Nice shot tho!', '2002-08-23 12:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105671, 4491, 1209, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of my Grandpa''s hands. Thought provoking picture. Fine job!</td>', 'Reminds me of my Grandpa''s hands. Thought provoking picture. Fine job!', '2002-08-24 16:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105672, 4492, 1658, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject.  It really stands out because it is such a weathered pencil.  It kind of reminds me of one those really old tortoises.  I really like this shot.</td>', 'Interesting subject.  It really stands out because it is such a weathered pencil.  It kind of reminds me of one those really old tortoises.  I really like this shot.', '2002-08-19 18:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105673, 4492, 2334, '<td valign="top">that''s a scary lookin pencil.</td>', 'that''s a scary lookin pencil.', '2002-08-19 19:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105674, 4492, 2279, '<td valign="top">Looks like you found this pencil on the side of the freeway.</td>', 'Looks like you found this pencil on the side of the freeway.', '2002-08-19 19:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105675, 4492, 1826, '<td valign="top">Lots of texture here.</td>', 'Lots of texture here.', '2002-08-20 07:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105676, 4492, 1041, '<td valign="top">it sure looks like this pencil has a lot of history.  i''m not too sold on the background, maybe paper or cardboard would''ve been more fitting for a pencil.  also, if you could have rotated it a bit rather than photographing onto the flat side you could maybe highlight the colors and the shape a bit more.  just a thought, would have to try it to see if it works. -- gr8photos (4)</td>', 'it sure looks like this pencil has a lot of history.  i''m not too sold on the background, maybe paper or cardboard would''ve been more fitting for a pencil.  also, if you could have rotated it a bit rather than photographing onto the flat side you could maybe highlight the colors and the shape a bit more.  just a thought, would have to try it to see if it works. -- gr8photos (4)', '2002-08-20 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105677, 4492, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love the foreground, sooo battered and it reminds me of a womble. I don''t know why it just does. Not keen on carpet background.<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'Love the foreground, sooo battered and it reminds me of a womble. I don''t know why it just does. Not keen on carpet background.5, Kavey', '2002-08-20 18:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105678, 4492, 2204, '<td valign="top">Good ''ol blue collar pencil has lived a hard life.  Refreshing after looking at all the new shiny pencils this week. Your photo really tells a story.  The background not being stark black adds to the feeling rather than distracting.   The brightness of the flash on the green is a little distracting and I see a few errant white pixels in the dark background but, overall I like this very much.  =8 syamjonimi ;''-D</td>', 'Good ''ol blue collar pencil has lived a hard life.  Refreshing after looking at all the new shiny pencils this week. Your photo really tells a story.  The background not being stark black adds to the feeling rather than distracting.   The brightness of the flash on the green is a little distracting and I see a few errant white pixels in the dark background but, overall I like this very much.  =8 syamjonimi ;''-D', '2002-08-21 15:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105679, 4492, 2427, '<td valign="top">apt name</td>', 'apt name', '2002-08-21 17:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105680, 4492, 3080, '<td valign="top">I have to smile at this.  I used to work in a lumber yard and had to carry one of these around all day to mark lumber, trim and pipe for cutting.  I was the only girl that worked there and I was the only one that ever remembered to take my pencil with me to the yard, so it seemed like I did all the marking.  Anyway, great photo.  The focus is great and so is the lighting.  The bottom right corner gets a bit dark, but it doesn''t take anything away from the photo.  Kind of adds even more mystery.  Great idea and good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I have to smile at this.  I used to work in a lumber yard and had to carry one of these around all day to mark lumber, trim and pipe for cutting.  I was the only girl that worked there and I was the only one that ever remembered to take my pencil with me to the yard, so it seemed like I did all the marking.  Anyway, great photo.  The focus is great and so is the lighting.  The bottom right corner gets a bit dark, but it doesn''t take anything away from the photo.  Kind of adds even more mystery.  Great idea and good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-22 12:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105681, 4492, 472, '<td valign="top">beautiful macro</td>', 'beautiful macro', '2002-08-22 12:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105682, 4492, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing9,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 8,<br/>Total Averaged Rating9.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing9,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 8,Total Averaged Rating9.   Autool', '2002-08-22 21:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105683, 4492, 1379, '<td valign="top">So textured!</td>', 'So textured!', '2002-08-22 23:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105684, 4492, 2352, '<td valign="top">That`s an oldie but goodie!  Did you pull that out of a tool box?<br/>The DOF on the carpet is interesting. NIce touch...</td>', 'That`s an oldie but goodie!  Did you pull that out of a tool box?The DOF on the carpet is interesting. NIce touch...', '2002-08-23 21:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105685, 4499, 2295, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting photo.  I like the lighting, but the focus seems too soft.</td>', 'This is an interesting photo.  I like the lighting, but the focus seems too soft.', '2002-08-19 14:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105686, 4499, 1360, '<td valign="top">This picture needs some auxiliary lighting; the light from the candle isnt enough. 5 -lennier</td>', 'This picture needs some auxiliary lighting; the light from the candle isnt enough. 5 -lennier', '2002-08-19 19:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105687, 4499, 3087, '<td valign="top">I am a sucker for flame but not keen on composition of this one. But looking again perhaps it''s meant to symbolise a cross?<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'I am a sucker for flame but not keen on composition of this one. But looking again perhaps it''s meant to symbolise a cross?5, Kavey', '2002-08-20 14:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105688, 4499, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing4,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,<br/>Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing4,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool', '2002-08-20 20:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105689, 4499, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice concept... I think the concept would be even better if the candle was moved over a little closer to the right side of the frame and just the tip of gthe pencil held in the flame... good shot :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a nice concept... I think the concept would be even better if the candle was moved over a little closer to the right side of the frame and just the tip of gthe pencil held in the flame... good shot :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-21 11:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105690, 4499, 2427, '<td valign="top">Ouch!</td>', 'Ouch!', '2002-08-21 17:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105691, 4499, 82, '<td valign="top">Picture frame draws attention, and for some reason I''d rather see just one flame than two.  Nice color, though.</td>', 'Picture frame draws attention, and for some reason I''d rather see just one flame than two.  Nice color, though.', '2002-08-22 11:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105692, 4499, 3080, '<td valign="top">very nice lighting I love the orange glow.  There are only 2 things that I would have done a bit differently in this photo.  The angle is great, but the leaning candle would look better if it were standing straight up.  And the background is great all except for the upper left corner where there is what looks like the bottom of a picture frame.  Other than that, nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'very nice lighting I love the orange glow.  There are only 2 things that I would have done a bit differently in this photo.  The angle is great, but the leaning candle would look better if it were standing straight up.  And the background is great all except for the upper left corner where there is what looks like the bottom of a picture frame.  Other than that, nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-23 14:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105693, 4507, 327, '<td valign="top">LOL Great idea, well done. Score 7 ~Kee</td>', 'LOL Great idea, well done. Score 7 ~Kee', '2002-08-19 20:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105694, 4507, 3087, '<td valign="top">Too dark for me though the pencil certainly stands out well. Interesting composition with the soldier half cropped. Like that element the most.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'Too dark for me though the pencil certainly stands out well. Interesting composition with the soldier half cropped. Like that element the most.Kavey', '2002-08-20 07:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105695, 4507, 509, '<td valign="top">Very creative! nice job</td>', 'Very creative! nice job', '2002-08-20 09:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105696, 4507, 806, '<td valign="top">A bit too dark.</td>', 'A bit too dark.', '2002-08-20 12:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105697, 4507, 2752, '<td valign="top">Great idea and composition</td>', 'Great idea and composition', '2002-08-20 19:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105698, 4507, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen lots of people comment about cropped heads in the past, but no complaints from me.  It works here.  Have to admit, the title adds to the humor factor.  I can not help but wonder if you stopped this person somewhere on a base or something and said "excuse me, but  can I put this pencil on you and take your photo?"  LMAO.  Anyway,  not much I can say.  Lighting, angle, and focus are good.  The only thing I can see that isn''t perfect is the background.  It''s kind of discolored down by his arm, but then again, that''s just me being picky.  Love the red white and blue touch in the pencil.  Great shot and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''ve seen lots of people comment about cropped heads in the past, but no complaints from me.  It works here.  Have to admit, the title adds to the humor factor.  I can not help but wonder if you stopped this person somewhere on a base or something and said "excuse me, but  can I put this pencil on you and take your photo?"  LMAO.  Anyway,  not much I can say.  Lighting, angle, and focus are good.  The only thing I can see that isn''t perfect is the background.  It''s kind of discolored down by his arm, but then again, that''s just me being picky.  Love the red white and blue touch in the pencil.  Great shot and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-21 01:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105699, 4507, 2000, '<td valign="top">It''s a little dark, and the pencil isn''t necessary in the pic.  I''m scaling on necessity of the pencil to make the shot, and this one seems only to be there to meet the challenge.</td>', 'It''s a little dark, and the pencil isn''t necessary in the pic.  I''m scaling on necessity of the pencil to make the shot, and this one seems only to be there to meet the challenge.', '2002-08-21 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105700, 4507, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the framing on this one.  It is a touch dark, and I think that causes you to lose some details, but it may be this monitor. karmat</td>', 'I really like the framing on this one.  It is a touch dark, and I think that causes you to lose some details, but it may be this monitor. karmat', '2002-08-21 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105701, 4507, 2172, '<td valign="top">Funny. I get the humor and I think I understand that the intent was to make the white pencil stand out.  IMO (NOT to offend) I this does not work - too dark.  I''m sorry, I don''t have much more to say.<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Funny. I get the humor and I think I understand that the intent was to make the white pencil stand out.  IMO (NOT to offend) I this does not work - too dark.  I''m sorry, I don''t have much more to say.Ruthann', '2002-08-21 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
