(105727, 4513, 3087, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why but this makes me think of Buffy the Vampire Slayer?! Love the blue and red colour theme, the weird reflections and light and the stepped lines.<br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'I don''t know why but this makes me think of Buffy the Vampire Slayer?! Love the blue and red colour theme, the weird reflections and light and the stepped lines.7, Kavey', '2002-08-23 08:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105728, 4513, 3513, '<td valign="top">very awesome shot.  i''m new to the digital world of photography but you got my vote on this one way to go on capturing such an usual photo</td>', 'very awesome shot.  i''m new to the digital world of photography but you got my vote on this one way to go on capturing such an usual photo', '2002-08-25 09:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105729, 4513, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is pretty neat.  I love how the pencils bend and how you positioned them in a way that the colors are spread out.  I lie the reds. There is a blue glare/reflection in the glass to the left, just over half way up.  Don''t know if that had something to do with the glass, the background  or the lighting.  You might have not been able to avoid it, but if it were possible to avoid, it might have been a little better without it.  Overall very nice photo. Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is pretty neat.  I love how the pencils bend and how you positioned them in a way that the colors are spread out.  I lie the reds. There is a blue glare/reflection in the glass to the left, just over half way up.  Don''t know if that had something to do with the glass, the background  or the lighting.  You might have not been able to avoid it, but if it were possible to avoid, it might have been a little better without it.  Overall very nice photo. Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-25 12:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105730, 4517, 2256, '<td valign="top">why is there a roll of toilet paper on top of the fridge? ha ha</td>', 'why is there a roll of toilet paper on top of the fridge? ha ha', '2002-08-19 10:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105731, 4517, 3239, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea, but I don''t really see a clear subject that stands out from the rest... perhaps it would work better if you cropped some of the foreground to focus more on the list....</td>', 'This is a good idea, but I don''t really see a clear subject that stands out from the rest... perhaps it would work better if you cropped some of the foreground to focus more on the list....', '2002-08-19 23:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105732, 4517, 3087, '<td valign="top">The pencil feels like an add-on just to get it into the photograph. <br/>I am not keen on the composition, I''d be interested in knowing how you made your decisions about what to include (the toilet/ kitchen roll on top) and what to exclude (the rest of the photo at the bottom).<br/>On a visual level this photo just doesn''t attract me, but I do applaud everyone for entering, and hope I am not too discouraging. <br/>Feel free to PM me for discussion of my comment if you want to.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'The pencil feels like an add-on just to get it into the photograph. I am not keen on the composition, I''d be interested in knowing how you made your decisions about what to include (the toilet/ kitchen roll on top) and what to exclude (the rest of the photo at the bottom).On a visual level this photo just doesn''t attract me, but I do applaud everyone for entering, and hope I am not too discouraging. Feel free to PM me for discussion of my comment if you want to.Kavey', '2002-08-20 07:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105733, 4517, 2466, '<td valign="top">it''s cool how you stuck the pencil on the fidge, but I might have cleaned off the top of the fridge and arranged the stuff on it a little bit more.  Also try a second light, even a flashlight, from the side and you might be surprised by the change it makes.</td>', 'it''s cool how you stuck the pencil on the fidge, but I might have cleaned off the top of the fridge and arranged the stuff on it a little bit more.  Also try a second light, even a flashlight, from the side and you might be surprised by the change it makes.', '2002-08-20 09:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105734, 4517, 3127, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but angling the camera down farther to get just the refrigerator door and not the top of it may have made for a better shot.</td>', 'Great idea, but angling the camera down farther to get just the refrigerator door and not the top of it may have made for a better shot.', '2002-08-20 16:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
