(105737, 4517, 2634, '<td valign="top">Would be better with a different angle, and a tighter crop to remove items(tp?) on top of the fridge and the picture at the bottom which is cut off. Picture is too busy the way it is. Lighting could also be improved.<br/></td>', 'Would be better with a different angle, and a tighter crop to remove items(tp?) on top of the fridge and the picture at the bottom which is cut off. Picture is too busy the way it is. Lighting could also be improved.', '2002-08-22 09:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
