(105746, 4517, 51167, '<td valign="top">Well, this was my first entry.  Haha, It didn''t do that well.  Only one way to go is up.  As for how I got the pencil to stick, I took a paperclip and poked it through the end of the pencil and then through the paper and taped it on the other side so it would hang there.</td>', 'Well, this was my first entry.  Haha, It didn''t do that well.  Only one way to go is up.  As for how I got the pencil to stick, I took a paperclip and poked it through the end of the pencil and then through the paper and taped it on the other side so it would hang there.', '2002-08-26 01:35:00.000000', NULL, 0),
