(105774, 4519, 1041, '<td valign="top">wow, we do have a lot of admin notes this week.  i just totally love your photo.  the composition is awesome, although i can see why some people think it''s a border, i''m sure you will enlighten us on monday as to how you achieved the effect.  very nice selective DOF, and placement of the pencils, but i probably would''ve chosen a 640x427 format to just slightly reduce the negative space w/out loosing the concept.  also, your paper is ever so slightly wavy under the diagonal pencil.  but i''m just nitpicking here.  my top 5 this week. -- gr8photos (10)</td>', 'wow, we do have a lot of admin notes this week.  i just totally love your photo.  the composition is awesome, although i can see why some people think it''s a border, i''m sure you will enlighten us on monday as to how you achieved the effect.  very nice selective DOF, and placement of the pencils, but i probably would''ve chosen a 640x427 format to just slightly reduce the negative space w/out loosing the concept.  also, your paper is ever so slightly wavy under the diagonal pencil.  but i''m just nitpicking here.  my top 5 this week. -- gr8photos (10)', '2002-08-20 16:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
