(105776, 4519, 3044, '<td valign="top">great image. strong composition with strong impact. i fear you might get slammed for this though. not everyone appreciates this style. i''m sure you will get many simple critiques on what you did wrong. stylistically i love this. i really like the blown out background. i hope you do well in the challenge. if not, hang in there. you have achieved a pretty unique style which is a rarity on this site. 9</td>', 'great image. strong composition with strong impact. i fear you might get slammed for this though. not everyone appreciates this style. i''m sure you will get many simple critiques on what you did wrong. stylistically i love this. i really like the blown out background. i hope you do well in the challenge. if not, hang in there. you have achieved a pretty unique style which is a rarity on this site. 9', '2002-08-20 17:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
