(105800, 4521, 3080, '<td valign="top">Wow, at the clarity of the sushi.  Makes me want to eat the stuff even less now. LOL.  Great placement and excelent angle for this photo.  Looks like a sushi ad.  Lighting is great and I like how the foreground is crisp in focus and the background has a soft focus.  I also like the adition of color on your part, with the placement of the objects in the background.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wow, at the clarity of the sushi.  Makes me want to eat the stuff even less now. LOL.  Great placement and excelent angle for this photo.  Looks like a sushi ad.  Lighting is great and I like how the foreground is crisp in focus and the background has a soft focus.  I also like the adition of color on your part, with the placement of the objects in the background.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-23 18:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105801, 4521, 835, '<td valign="top">the pencils really stand out in the picture due to color and composition yet I can''t clearly read the writing on them, this is really distracting to me.  Love the colors and compostition.</td>', 'the pencils really stand out in the picture due to color and composition yet I can''t clearly read the writing on them, this is really distracting to me.  Love the colors and compostition.', '2002-08-24 00:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
