(105852, 4527, 2553, '<td valign="top">Interesting all the way around.  Nice lighting and composition, and the "idea" is very unique - and portrayed very well.  The more I look at it, the more I like it.  lhall</td>', 'Interesting all the way around.  Nice lighting and composition, and the "idea" is very unique - and portrayed very well.  The more I look at it, the more I like it.  lhall', '2002-08-23 07:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105853, 4527, 2204, '<td valign="top">Nicole, age 6, chose this as her favorite photo this week.  She says "It''s my favorite because the penil is in her mouth."</td>', 'Nicole, age 6, chose this as her favorite photo this week.  She says "It''s my favorite because the penil is in her mouth."', '2002-08-23 21:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105854, 4527, 3080, '<td valign="top">The lighting for this is a bit dark for me, however it fits the "theme" of this photo.  There is definately a pencil in the photo.  Focus is good and the angle is ok.  I might have backed it up a bit to include the rest of the hair, other than that, pretty good photo.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'The lighting for this is a bit dark for me, however it fits the "theme" of this photo.  There is definately a pencil in the photo.  Focus is good and the angle is ok.  I might have backed it up a bit to include the rest of the hair, other than that, pretty good photo.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-25 14:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105855, 4527, 2221, '<td valign="top">Wow! Sexy! Excellent use of light. Composition and focus are good, too. Nice approach to the challege. If I would be a pencil producer I would use your photo for my advertising ;-)<br/>-stephan</td>', 'Wow! Sexy! Excellent use of light. Composition and focus are good, too. Nice approach to the challege. If I would be a pencil producer I would use your photo for my advertising ;-)-stephan', '2002-08-25 20:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
