(105873, 4528, 3239, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  I like the use of the Mongol/Ticonderoga text. The spider on the "wall" is a good touch too.  Technically, the lighting is a bit harsh in my opinion.</td>', 'Very creative.  I like the use of the Mongol/Ticonderoga text. The spider on the "wall" is a good touch too.  Technically, the lighting is a bit harsh in my opinion.', '2002-08-19 22:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
