(105977, 4534, 3102, '<td valign="top">To those who "didn''t get it..." I live in Pennsylvania, so these are pencils shaped like our fine state.  I didn''t realize there were so many people who had no idea what the state looked like (or perhaps didn''t take a moment to look at the title?).  :)</td>', 'To those who "didn''t get it..." I live in Pennsylvania, so these are pencils shaped like our fine state.  I didn''t realize there were so many people who had no idea what the state looked like (or perhaps didn''t take a moment to look at the title?).  :)', '2002-08-26 10:33:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(105978, 4534, 2221, '<td valign="top">Oops. Actually I thought that it was a wordplay on Transylvania and the pencils resemble lots of peg''s (these things which are used to kill vampires). The framing by green wood somehow backed that up (in my weird mind).<br/>I think a lot of people had problems recognizing this as the state Pennsylvania because they aren''t from the US.</td>', 'Oops. Actually I thought that it was a wordplay on Transylvania and the pencils resemble lots of peg''s (these things which are used to kill vampires). The framing by green wood somehow backed that up (in my weird mind).I think a lot of people had problems recognizing this as the state Pennsylvania because they aren''t from the US.', '2002-08-28 12:57:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(105979, 4534, 4049, '<td valign="top">LOL, really cute =D</td>', 'LOL, really cute =D', '2002-09-20 20:09:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(105980, 4535, 2344, '<td valign="top">Is that a pumpkin plant? a zucchini? squash maybe? Good idea! Those things grab hold of ANYTHING in their path and hold on for dear life!</td>', 'Is that a pumpkin plant? a zucchini? squash maybe? Good idea! Those things grab hold of ANYTHING in their path and hold on for dear life!', '2002-08-19 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105981, 4535, 656, '<td valign="top">the brey fence washes out the tree too much.  A different angle might have helped things stand out more ?</td>', 'the brey fence washes out the tree too much.  A different angle might have helped things stand out more ?', '2002-08-19 22:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105982, 4535, 2204, '<td valign="top">You did good.  The gray, brown, green and yellow are very complimentary.....=8<br/>;-D</td>', 'You did good.  The gray, brown, green and yellow are very complimentary.....=8;-D', '2002-08-20 02:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105983, 4535, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and foreground, background somewhat disappointing. <br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'Lovely colours and foreground, background somewhat disappointing. 5, Kavey', '2002-08-20 18:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
