(105985, 4535, 3198, '<td valign="top">strange. flat light. and no contrast because of the fence in the background. a little too ''doctered''</td>', 'strange. flat light. and no contrast because of the fence in the background. a little too ''doctered''', '2002-08-21 05:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105986, 4535, 2173, '<td valign="top">I just dont got it, would u explain me this plizzzzzzz!!!!!!! u got 6</td>', 'I just dont got it, would u explain me this plizzzzzzz!!!!!!! u got 6', '2002-08-21 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105987, 4535, 1005, '<td valign="top">Pumkin or swash?  Very nice idea.  Good focus, lighting and I like the framing.   Too bad the background is almost the same as the tree trunk, but I''m not going to lower your score for that.  I would just remind you to watch your backgrounds in the future.  8 Swash</td>', 'Pumkin or swash?  Very nice idea.  Good focus, lighting and I like the framing.   Too bad the background is almost the same as the tree trunk, but I''m not going to lower your score for that.  I would just remind you to watch your backgrounds in the future.  8 Swash', '2002-08-21 19:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105988, 4535, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background8,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,<br/>Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background8,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool', '2002-08-22 10:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105989, 4535, 2798, '<td valign="top">I like everything except the fence - which is a little bland. Good idea though.</td>', 'I like everything except the fence - which is a little bland. Good idea though.', '2002-08-22 17:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105990, 4535, 2221, '<td valign="top">I don''t really understand this photo ;-) The background could be better because it almost merges with the tree.<br/>-stephan</td>', 'I don''t really understand this photo ;-) The background could be better because it almost merges with the tree.-stephan', '2002-08-25 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105991, 4535, 3080, '<td valign="top">really pretty cool.  the color in this is simple, but very nice.  Lighting was great for this photo.  I like the curly little plant accents.  Great angle and frame filling.  good job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'really pretty cool.  the color in this is simple, but very nice.  Lighting was great for this photo.  I like the curly little plant accents.  Great angle and frame filling.  good job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-25 22:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105992, 4536, 51167, '<td valign="top">Oh yum!!!  I want some of that Sashimi.  You forgot to pile on some of that Wasabi.  Now I''m hungry,  I''ve gotta make some for dinner tomorrow:)  <br/>8/19- We made sushi for dinner tonight:)</td>', 'Oh yum!!!  I want some of that Sashimi.  You forgot to pile on some of that Wasabi.  Now I''m hungry,  I''ve gotta make some for dinner tomorrow:)  8/19- We made sushi for dinner tonight:)', '2002-08-19 02:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105993, 4536, 2467, '<td valign="top">Wow...that''s the first time I''ve ever seen some call them "Sushi Sticks".</td>', 'Wow...that''s the first time I''ve ever seen some call them "Sushi Sticks".', '2002-08-19 02:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105994, 4536, 3127, '<td valign="top">I had thought about this as a possible approach for this subject and I love the way it came out!</td>', 'I had thought about this as a possible approach for this subject and I love the way it came out!', '2002-08-19 09:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105995, 4536, 2344, '<td valign="top">Sushi is very interestng looking. Never had the chance to see/taste it because alot of asian food has seafood in it in some form. Oh well... This pencil shot is great if you like having graphite in with your meal hehe. The only complaint I really feel the need to make is that cup of coffee sitting by itself in the corner doesn''t seem to belong there.</td>', 'Sushi is very interestng looking. Never had the chance to see/taste it because alot of asian food has seafood in it in some form. Oh well... This pencil shot is great if you like having graphite in with your meal hehe. The only complaint I really feel the need to make is that cup of coffee sitting by itself in the corner doesn''t seem to belong there.', '2002-08-19 10:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105996, 4536, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice color, could use a little more DOF.  I love Sushi, it looks delicious!!</td>', 'Nice color, could use a little more DOF.  I love Sushi, it looks delicious!!', '2002-08-19 13:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105997, 4536, 2353, '<td valign="top">What a terrific idea!  Very original!  Good composition as well.  I like the angle in which this was shot. Having the sushi tray pointed to the upper left in the background gives the picutre a quarky look and makes it interesting.  Also, having the right side of the picture at the erasers being the focal point, the eye is led in that direction.  The colors are also terrific as well. 9 yea! - KazyKat</td>', 'What a terrific idea!  Very original!  Good composition as well.  I like the angle in which this was shot. Having the sushi tray pointed to the upper left in the background gives the picutre a quarky look and makes it interesting.  Also, having the right side of the picture at the erasers being the focal point, the eye is led in that direction.  The colors are also terrific as well. 9 yea! - KazyKat', '2002-08-19 14:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105998, 4536, 327, '<td valign="top">Creative idea, and really nice colors and textures. I like it. Score 7 ~Kee</td>', 'Creative idea, and really nice colors and textures. I like it. Score 7 ~Kee', '2002-08-19 15:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105999, 4536, 1543, '<td valign="top">backup chopsticks.  nice concept, gtreat colors.</td>', 'backup chopsticks.  nice concept, gtreat colors.', '2002-08-19 18:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106000, 4536, 656, '<td valign="top">is that hygenic ? !   good idea</td>', 'is that hygenic ? !   good idea', '2002-08-19 23:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106001, 4536, 92, '<td valign="top">I like this since the challenge said..take your pencil everywhere you go...this seems as if you did:)</td>', 'I like this since the challenge said..take your pencil everywhere you go...this seems as if you did:)', '2002-08-20 01:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106002, 4536, 1280, '<td valign="top">I thought about doing this...you did it well.  I did something else...that makes yours quite original.  Nice job!                      Grayce...aka...Gracious</td>', 'I thought about doing this...you did it well.  I did something else...that makes yours quite original.  Nice job!                      Grayce...aka...Gracious', '2002-08-20 02:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106003, 4536, 2466, '<td valign="top">clever.  the bright colors and textures of the sushi really add to it.  I hope you ate it!</td>', 'clever.  the bright colors and textures of the sushi really add to it.  I hope you ate it!', '2002-08-20 10:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106004, 4536, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, great idea and amusing</td>', 'This is a great shot, great idea and amusing', '2002-08-20 10:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106005, 4536, 3080, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool.  I love the colors of the food in the background and it looks good that it''s got a soft focus.  The pencils are very clear and the lighting is great. No distracting shadows or bright spots.  I would like to have seen this at different angles.  Wasn''t sure if  liked the angle at first, but it''s growing on me.  Great job with this photo and good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Pretty cool.  I love the colors of the food in the background and it looks good that it''s got a soft focus.  The pencils are very clear and the lighting is great. No distracting shadows or bright spots.  I would like to have seen this at different angles.  Wasn''t sure if  liked the angle at first, but it''s growing on me.  Great job with this photo and good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-20 11:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106006, 4536, 3087, '<td valign="top">Cute but not sharp enough for me. Dipping sauce is kind of lost in that top corner there. <br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'Cute but not sharp enough for me. Dipping sauce is kind of lost in that top corner there. 5, Kavey', '2002-08-20 13:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106007, 4536, 2123, '<td valign="top">Blech!  Nicely composed even if it is raw fish. ;-) 6</td>', 'Blech!  Nicely composed even if it is raw fish. ;-) 6', '2002-08-20 15:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106008, 4536, 3112, '<td valign="top">Mmmm. Sushi!  Good idea.  DOF did not encompass the whole pencil (eraser is soft).<br/></td>', 'Mmmm. Sushi!  Good idea.  DOF did not encompass the whole pencil (eraser is soft).', '2002-08-20 18:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106009, 4536, 3031, '<td valign="top">Nice concept. Could use some more focus (DOF).</td>', 'Nice concept. Could use some more focus (DOF).', '2002-08-21 04:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106010, 4536, 2667, '<td valign="top">sushi has never past my lips, but this shot looks good. i like the various colors of the flesh. nicely done. (6) ~mcmurma</td>', 'sushi has never past my lips, but this shot looks good. i like the various colors of the flesh. nicely done. (6) ~mcmurma', '2002-08-21 14:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106011, 4536, 1041, '<td valign="top">oh, my, i wonder whether you got the same looks from the waiter/waitress and constant questions whether you were ok that i got when i tried this in my local sushi place.  great idea. *grin*.  the pencils are positioned nicely in the shot, the soy sauce in the background is a little distracting, and i wish the sushi was a little more in focus (even though you may have chosen the shallow DOF deliberately, my personal preference would be all focus here). -- gr8photos (4)</td>', 'oh, my, i wonder whether you got the same looks from the waiter/waitress and constant questions whether you were ok that i got when i tried this in my local sushi place.  great idea. *grin*.  the pencils are positioned nicely in the shot, the soy sauce in the background is a little distracting, and i wish the sushi was a little more in focus (even though you may have chosen the shallow DOF deliberately, my personal preference would be all focus here). -- gr8photos (4)', '2002-08-21 16:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106012, 4536, 737, '<td valign="top">Composition - very good<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  high<br/>Other suggestions  I might have like a little larger DOF. Still, very good.<br/><br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Composition - very goodTechnical Aspects - quite goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality  highOther suggestions  I might have like a little larger DOF. Still, very good.Jim msp', '2002-08-21 23:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106013, 4536, 2427, '<td valign="top">The next best thing to chewing the pencils!</td>', 'The next best thing to chewing the pencils!', '2002-08-22 01:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106014, 4536, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,<br/>Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool', '2002-08-22 10:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106015, 4536, 772, '<td valign="top">That''s some NASTY stuff :)  I won''t hold that against your photo though :)  I like the composition on this shot... I would like to see the ''sushi'' in a little sharper focus though... good work! - jmsetzler</td>', 'That''s some NASTY stuff :)  I won''t hold that against your photo though :)  I like the composition on this shot... I would like to see the ''sushi'' in a little sharper focus though... good work! - jmsetzler', '2002-08-22 12:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106016, 4536, 2798, '<td valign="top">Wasabi!!! I''m suddenly HUNGRY! Great shot - colourful and well lit. Focus is where it should be - on the pencils.</td>', 'Wasabi!!! I''m suddenly HUNGRY! Great shot - colourful and well lit. Focus is where it should be - on the pencils.', '2002-08-22 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106017, 4536, 835, '<td valign="top">do you know the other pencil-sushi photographer?  Not much to say other than I like it.  I wish you could have better focus on the sushi but not lose any on the pencils &amp; hand.</td>', 'do you know the other pencil-sushi photographer?  Not much to say other than I like it.  I wish you could have better focus on the sushi but not lose any on the pencils & hand.', '2002-08-24 00:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106018, 4536, 3251, '<td valign="top">This is the better sushi shot. I like the colors</td>', 'This is the better sushi shot. I like the colors', '2002-08-24 02:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106019, 4536, 637, '<td valign="top">Creative, colorful, nice angle  6 sjgleah</td>', 'Creative, colorful, nice angle  6 sjgleah', '2002-08-25 11:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106020, 4537, 1908, '<td valign="top">like the colours and DOF a "8" good effort</td>', 'like the colours and DOF a "8" good effort', '2002-08-19 07:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106021, 4537, 2344, '<td valign="top">What a great idea! They grey background makes everything look duller... a white one may have helped the pencils to pop out a bit more. Great shot anyway!</td>', 'What a great idea! They grey background makes everything look duller... a white one may have helped the pencils to pop out a bit more. Great shot anyway!', '2002-08-19 10:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106022, 4537, 1779, '<td valign="top">clever...</td>', 'clever...', '2002-08-19 19:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106023, 4537, 3087, '<td valign="top">Simple and nice shapes, not keen on grey background and centred composition.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'Simple and nice shapes, not keen on grey background and centred composition.Kavey', '2002-08-20 11:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106024, 4537, 2752, '<td valign="top">clever idea..</td>', 'clever idea..', '2002-08-20 20:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106025, 4537, 2172, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  I''m being straight forward - NOT to offend.  There are a few things I would adjust.  I''m not sure that having the light source entering from the top right is effective here.  I''m not sure if the background is actually grey, or was supposed to be black - either way, I would have chosen something different.  Also, perhaps a different placement and angle - in effort to make the form stand out - to me, this is more of just a ''picture'' not a photograph.  Perhaps having the lightsource a little brighter as well as positioned differently, I would say on the side or in the front - show off the pine cone.  <br/>I am in no way an expert, just expressing my thoughts.  4<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Cute idea.  I''m being straight forward - NOT to offend.  There are a few things I would adjust.  I''m not sure that having the light source entering from the top right is effective here.  I''m not sure if the background is actually grey, or was supposed to be black - either way, I would have chosen something different.  Also, perhaps a different placement and angle - in effort to make the form stand out - to me, this is more of just a ''picture'' not a photograph.  Perhaps having the lightsource a little brighter as well as positioned differently, I would say on the side or in the front - show off the pine cone.  I am in no way an expert, just expressing my thoughts.  4Ruthann', '2002-08-21 22:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106026, 4537, 3080, '<td valign="top">The focus on that pine cone is really great.  You did a very nice job staggering color of the pencils.  Lighting is very good.  no distracting shadows or bright spots.  the only thing that might be kind of distracting is there is a small black dot in the upper left corner.  Otherwise, very creative.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The focus on that pine cone is really great.  You did a very nice job staggering color of the pencils.  Lighting is very good.  no distracting shadows or bright spots.  the only thing that might be kind of distracting is there is a small black dot in the upper left corner.  Otherwise, very creative.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-22 11:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106027, 4537, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,<br/>Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool', '2002-08-22 21:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106028, 4537, 2798, '<td valign="top">Seems a little dark. Perhaps another light from the front would have brought out the texture of the pine cone more.</td>', 'Seems a little dark. Perhaps another light from the front would have brought out the texture of the pine cone more.', '2002-08-23 09:31:00.000000', NULL, 1);
