(106036, 4539, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good DOF. Color is a little bland.  Need to make it snap a little more.  Overall, good.</td>', 'Good DOF. Color is a little bland.  Need to make it snap a little more.  Overall, good.', '2002-08-20 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
