(106038, 4539, 205, '<td valign="top">nice drawings</td>', 'nice drawings', '2002-08-22 08:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106039, 4539, 3080, '<td valign="top">I wonder how many people are judging the drawings rather than the photos.  This was taken at a very nice angle, but really looks like not much more than a photo of a drawing.  Good drawings though, but I don''t think we are suposed to judge the drawings.  The lighting was good, but I''m wondering why the fingers turned out red.  It''s a pretty good photo, don''t get me wrong, just lacks the "wow" factor for me.  Remember though, that''s just an opinion, and you can tell me to sick it up my wazoo if you want.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I wonder how many people are judging the drawings rather than the photos.  This was taken at a very nice angle, but really looks like not much more than a photo of a drawing.  Good drawings though, but I don''t think we are suposed to judge the drawings.  The lighting was good, but I''m wondering why the fingers turned out red.  It''s a pretty good photo, don''t get me wrong, just lacks the "wow" factor for me.  Remember though, that''s just an opinion, and you can tell me to sick it up my wazoo if you want.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-22 11:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
