(106095, 4548, 3080, '<td valign="top">Monday night, at midnight, this was the first photo that popped up in my list.  I laughed my butt off.  Thanks for that.  This is a great photo.  The angle and focus are great and the lighting is simply perfect.  I don''t see a shadow in the picture at all.  I have to wonder though if you got the seeds from the photographer of "how does your garden grow".  This challenge has been a riot.  Thanks again for adding to the humor and doing such a nice job of it. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Monday night, at midnight, this was the first photo that popped up in my list.  I laughed my butt off.  Thanks for that.  This is a great photo.  The angle and focus are great and the lighting is simply perfect.  I don''t see a shadow in the picture at all.  I have to wonder though if you got the seeds from the photographer of "how does your garden grow".  This challenge has been a riot.  Thanks again for adding to the humor and doing such a nice job of it. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-22 15:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106096, 4548, 2000, '<td valign="top">Might work better if the pencils looked like they were actually IN the ground (as if they''d been planted) without the visible trench.  It looks like the pencils were just shoved into the ground, which I know they were, but it looks too staged.</td>', 'Might work better if the pencils looked like they were actually IN the ground (as if they''d been planted) without the visible trench.  It looks like the pencils were just shoved into the ground, which I know they were, but it looks too staged.', '2002-08-22 16:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
