(106100, 4548, 1041, '<td valign="top">good idea, in fact, i was toying with doing something similar, but ran out of time.  i think i would''ve preferred it if you had cropped in closer on the pencils, all the dry and green grass takes up a lot of the photo and isn''t so visually appealing to me.  the watering can and the ''picked'' pencils are a nice touch though. -- gr8photos (4)</td>', 'good idea, in fact, i was toying with doing something similar, but ran out of time.  i think i would''ve preferred it if you had cropped in closer on the pencils, all the dry and green grass takes up a lot of the photo and isn''t so visually appealing to me.  the watering can and the ''picked'' pencils are a nice touch though. -- gr8photos (4)', '2002-08-23 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
