(106118, 4549, 772, '<td valign="top">As you may know, I particularly like this concept... This image has lost some ''crispness'' somewhere... the pixellation is farily dominant in this image.  This could have possibly resulted from enlarging a cropped segement of the photo.  The concept here is very strong but the clarity needs a little work probably :)  You may want to take a look at resampling the photo if you need to enlarge rather than resizing... good shot :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'As you may know, I particularly like this concept... This image has lost some ''crispness'' somewhere... the pixellation is farily dominant in this image.  This could have possibly resulted from enlarging a cropped segement of the photo.  The concept here is very strong but the clarity needs a little work probably :)  You may want to take a look at resampling the photo if you need to enlarge rather than resizing... good shot :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-23 02:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
