(106120, 4549, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m not one for abstract-ish photos, but this was done very nicely.  with the yellow, in addition to the shiny "ferrules" makes it look kind of like an actual sunburst.  The lighting is good.  Bright enough to see what you are looking at, but dark enough to not overwhelm the photo with reflection and glare.  Definately creative.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''m not one for abstract-ish photos, but this was done very nicely.  with the yellow, in addition to the shiny "ferrules" makes it look kind of like an actual sunburst.  The lighting is good.  Bright enough to see what you are looking at, but dark enough to not overwhelm the photo with reflection and glare.  Definately creative.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-23 18:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
