(106124, 4550, 1827, '<td valign="top">UPDATE:<br/>I''ve been thinking about this photo all week.  Every time I think about the challenge, this photo comes to mind.  For that you deserve a ten.  I''ve changed your score to such.  I only hope that people see the pencils and you don''t get scored down for their ambiguity.  Great Job.  Oh, and I still wanna know what I''m looking at -- mercury, candle wax, funhouse mirror?  10 (My only one for the week.)<br/><br/>ORIGINAL COMMENT:<br/>I can''t clearly see that those yellow things are pencils, but I''m taking your word for it because I like the rest of the photo so darned much.  The movement, the depth, the colors are all beautiful -- now do tell:  What AM I looking at?  9</td>', 'UPDATE:I''ve been thinking about this photo all week.  Every time I think about the challenge, this photo comes to mind.  For that you deserve a ten.  I''ve changed your score to such.  I only hope that people see the pencils and you don''t get scored down for their ambiguity.  Great Job.  Oh, and I still wanna know what I''m looking at -- mercury, candle wax, funhouse mirror?  10 (My only one for the week.)ORIGINAL COMMENT:I can''t clearly see that those yellow things are pencils, but I''m taking your word for it because I like the rest of the photo so darned much.  The movement, the depth, the colors are all beautiful -- now do tell:  What AM I looking at?  9', '2002-08-19 03:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
