(106193, 4551, 2472, '<td valign="top">I liked your composition very much. Your pencils are the most elegant, and least used by other photographers this week. I only wonder about the crack in the right side pencil''s eraser. One of my 3 favorites to win this week.</td>', 'I liked your composition very much. Your pencils are the most elegant, and least used by other photographers this week. I only wonder about the crack in the right side pencil''s eraser. One of my 3 favorites to win this week.', '2002-08-22 13:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106194, 4551, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background8,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,<br/>Total Averaged Rating8.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background8,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,Total Averaged Rating8.   Autool', '2002-08-22 20:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106195, 4551, 2352, '<td valign="top">I am amazed at how creative people can be with something as simple as a pencil.<br/>Your idea here works well.</td>', 'I am amazed at how creative people can be with something as simple as a pencil.Your idea here works well.', '2002-08-22 23:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106196, 4551, 2858, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of the rectangle, great control of negative space</td>', 'Excellent use of the rectangle, great control of negative space', '2002-08-23 10:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106197, 4551, 3080, '<td valign="top">Cool effect.  I like the idea.  Placement and angle are good.  Lighting and focus are great.  The only thing that stands out to me as odd is the blemish in the eraser at the bottom right of the photo.  unless the rest of the eraser is like that or worse, maybe rotating the pencil to a different spot of the eraser could have avoided showing this.  The background is absolutely great.  Very nice job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Cool effect.  I like the idea.  Placement and angle are good.  Lighting and focus are great.  The only thing that stands out to me as odd is the blemish in the eraser at the bottom right of the photo.  unless the rest of the eraser is like that or worse, maybe rotating the pencil to a different spot of the eraser could have avoided showing this.  The background is absolutely great.  Very nice job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-24 01:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106198, 4551, 1037, '<td valign="top">Awesome! This photo made me laugh :). I''m not sure I like the rotational symmetry, I think if the pencils were at different angles I''d like it more. But the strong lighting and the background are cool :)</td>', 'Awesome! This photo made me laugh :). I''m not sure I like the rotational symmetry, I think if the pencils were at different angles I''d like it more. But the strong lighting and the background are cool :)', '2002-08-24 08:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106199, 4551, 637, '<td valign="top">I don''t really get the concept... Little too contrived for my taste, and nothing about it really grabs me.  4 sjgleah</td>', 'I don''t really get the concept... Little too contrived for my taste, and nothing about it really grabs me.  4 sjgleah', '2002-08-24 19:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106200, 4551, 255, '<td valign="top">the clarity and crispness of this picture are awesome--it reminds me (other than the obvious!) of some show i used to see as a kid like sesame street or electric company (can''t remember which) where the big everyday items used to float thru the air in space--very cool. this pic would be a 10, but the negative space seems so balanced... so a 9.99999 for you!</td>', 'the clarity and crispness of this picture are awesome--it reminds me (other than the obvious!) of some show i used to see as a kid like sesame street or electric company (can''t remember which) where the big everyday items used to float thru the air in space--very cool. this pic would be a 10, but the negative space seems so balanced... so a 9.99999 for you!', '2002-08-25 16:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106201, 4551, 2586, '<td valign="top">The title is more fun than the picture. The 3 negative spaces in the picture are pretty simple too. And so is the background. Good sharp pencils. 4 Journey</td>', 'The title is more fun than the picture. The 3 negative spaces in the picture are pretty simple too. And so is the background. Good sharp pencils. 4 Journey', '2002-08-25 20:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106202, 4552, 2700, '<td valign="top">I was about to DQ for layers, but I see now that they are all burned... nice job, "DOF" and lighting well done... 9</td>', 'I was about to DQ for layers, but I see now that they are all burned... nice job, "DOF" and lighting well done... 9', '2002-08-19 02:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106203, 4552, 1826, '<td valign="top">Really like the diagonal placement here. Good choice.</td>', 'Really like the diagonal placement here. Good choice.', '2002-08-19 07:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106204, 4552, 806, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, focus, clarity, lines, dof, composition. = Great!</td>', 'Nice colors, focus, clarity, lines, dof, composition. = Great!', '2002-08-19 11:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106205, 4552, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very nice, one of my favorites.</td>', 'Very nice, one of my favorites.', '2002-08-19 11:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106206, 4552, 3239, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast, very good composition.  I like this image.</td>', 'Nice contrast, very good composition.  I like this image.', '2002-08-19 15:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106207, 4552, 2000, '<td valign="top">DOF works here, though it''s not overly necessary since the color is what makes the picture.  I might suggest a pencil with a bit more color to it - Dixon-ticonderoga, for example, uses green lettering - this would stand out the pencil a bit more.</td>', 'DOF works here, though it''s not overly necessary since the color is what makes the picture.  I might suggest a pencil with a bit more color to it - Dixon-ticonderoga, for example, uses green lettering - this would stand out the pencil a bit more.', '2002-08-19 18:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106208, 4552, 3127, '<td valign="top">Cool use of contrast.</td>', 'Cool use of contrast.', '2002-08-20 16:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106209, 4552, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely! Would like more of a diagonal angle. <br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Lovely! Would like more of a diagonal angle. 6, Kavey', '2002-08-20 18:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106210, 4552, 3287, '<td valign="top">The contrast is very striking, love the shot</td>', 'The contrast is very striking, love the shot', '2002-08-20 22:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106211, 4552, 772, '<td valign="top">I like the way you have used the flat grey to make the yellow pencil stand out in this photo.  I also like the diagonals.  this works very well :)  Now, I see some evidence of ''barrell distortion" in this photo.  This is the curvature that you can see at the top and bottom of this image.  The only way to correct that in an image like this is to back up a little bit with the camera... shoot the photo and then crop out the part that you want to keep :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'I like the way you have used the flat grey to make the yellow pencil stand out in this photo.  I also like the diagonals.  this works very well :)  Now, I see some evidence of ''barrell distortion" in this photo.  This is the curvature that you can see at the top and bottom of this image.  The only way to correct that in an image like this is to back up a little bit with the camera... shoot the photo and then crop out the part that you want to keep :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-21 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106212, 4552, 2667, '<td valign="top">nice contrast, and i like the perspective and depth of field. looks like you used a wider angle lens than most as it has the nice curvey around the edges look. well done.   ~mcmurma<br/>Aesthetics....6<br/>Meets Challenge...6<br/>Overall....6</td>', 'nice contrast, and i like the perspective and depth of field. looks like you used a wider angle lens than most as it has the nice curvey around the edges look. well done.   ~mcmurmaAesthetics....6Meets Challenge...6Overall....6', '2002-08-21 13:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106213, 4552, 2983, '<td valign="top">Good shot.</td>', 'Good shot.', '2002-08-21 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106214, 4552, 737, '<td valign="top">Composition - quite good<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  good/high<br/>Other suggestions  none<br/><br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Composition - quite goodTechnical Aspects - quite goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality  good/highOther suggestions  noneJim msp', '2002-08-22 00:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106215, 4552, 3431, '<td valign="top">great shot.  I love the feeling in this one  The lighting is great too... not too dark for all that black, but not so bright the pencil would wash out.  Great job</td>', 'great shot.  I love the feeling in this one  The lighting is great too... not too dark for all that black, but not so bright the pencil would wash out.  Great job', '2002-08-22 01:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106216, 4552, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,<br/>Total Averaged Rating8.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,Total Averaged Rating8.   Autool', '2002-08-22 10:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106217, 4552, 3080, '<td valign="top">The yellow #2 definately stands out in this photo.  The others look like those environmentally friendly pencils that are made out of recycled materials.  I wonder if you did the angle on purpose that way.  I''d like to see a comparrison of this photo to a photo of them head on with no diaganal tilt.  There is kind of a curved look to the pencils to the bottom of the photo.  I think it''s only a trick on the eyes though due to the angle cause when a ruler is placed up to it, it sure enough is straight.  Very nice display of pencils.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The yellow #2 definately stands out in this photo.  The others look like those environmentally friendly pencils that are made out of recycled materials.  I wonder if you did the angle on purpose that way.  I''d like to see a comparrison of this photo to a photo of them head on with no diaganal tilt.  There is kind of a curved look to the pencils to the bottom of the photo.  I think it''s only a trick on the eyes though due to the angle cause when a ruler is placed up to it, it sure enough is straight.  Very nice display of pencils.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-22 11:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106218, 4552, 1658, '<td valign="top">Well composed and well shot, one of my favorites this week</td>', 'Well composed and well shot, one of my favorites this week', '2002-08-22 13:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106219, 4552, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot.  Are the other pencils actually grey?? Cause if not, I want to know how to do that !!  lhall</td>', 'Very cool shot.  Are the other pencils actually grey?? Cause if not, I want to know how to do that !!  lhall', '2002-08-23 07:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106220, 4552, 2352, '<td valign="top">I like what you did here for this challenge.<br/>Lighting and DOF work well...</td>', 'I like what you did here for this challenge.Lighting and DOF work well...', '2002-08-23 21:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106221, 4552, 2172, '<td valign="top">Very Nice - (Running out of steam for commenting - so being brief)  was this with a fisheye lens?  I like this  - good choice of color (and non color), good dof, composition and cropping - all great for this image - I see great time, effort, thought and skill for this image  Great Work  8<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Very Nice - (Running out of steam for commenting - so being brief)  was this with a fisheye lens?  I like this  - good choice of color (and non color), good dof, composition and cropping - all great for this image - I see great time, effort, thought and skill for this image  Great Work  8Ruthann', '2002-08-23 23:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106222, 4552, 1209, '<td valign="top">Good concept. I like that the color of the greyed out pencils is "graphite".</td>', 'Good concept. I like that the color of the greyed out pencils is "graphite".', '2002-08-24 16:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106223, 4552, 3500, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, nice use of color</td>', 'Nice composition, nice use of color', '2002-08-24 17:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106224, 4552, 2427, '<td valign="top">Although there have been many photos in this challenge that have been similar in content, this is one I like becuase:  the choice of color, the focus.</td>', 'Although there have been many photos in this challenge that have been similar in content, this is one I like becuase:  the choice of color, the focus.', '2002-08-24 23:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106225, 4552, 2221, '<td valign="top">Perfect! Excellent composition, lighting, focus. Very creative and a nice style.<br/>-stephan</td>', 'Perfect! Excellent composition, lighting, focus. Very creative and a nice style.-stephan', '2002-08-25 19:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106226, 4555, 2256, '<td valign="top">very clever</td>', 'very clever', '2002-08-19 10:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106227, 4555, 327, '<td valign="top">Fun, creative shot. What a hoot. I would of liked better lite and maybe shot more from the top. Still I like this..Score 7 ~Kee</td>', 'Fun, creative shot. What a hoot. I would of liked better lite and maybe shot more from the top. Still I like this..Score 7 ~Kee', '2002-08-19 16:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
