(106262, 4560, 2352, '<td valign="top">This would have been a great subject for the "something old" challenge!<br/>This is a very good idea and like the small drawing, but the backboard is very distracting and takes up too much room in the pic. I think with a more creative way to hold the drawing, this would have been a contender...  Nice focus!</td>', 'This would have been a great subject for the "something old" challenge!This is a very good idea and like the small drawing, but the backboard is very distracting and takes up too much room in the pic. I think with a more creative way to hold the drawing, this would have been a contender...  Nice focus!', '2002-08-24 22:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
