(106265, 4562, 2818, '<td valign="top">Shar-<br/>Great shot.  I like it better with more pencils.  There is one problem that I don''t think you are seeing on your computer... you can see a distortion from the towel on the wall.  Try getting onto Ben''s computer and signing in on that one.  If you can''t see anything different on his, next time you are in town, stop by and I will bring it up on mine.<br/>Otherwise great job... and I already have some great ideas for this weeks challenge... don''t know if I''m gonna do it there or make a "studio" here to do it and let you find out later.<br/></td>', 'Shar-Great shot.  I like it better with more pencils.  There is one problem that I don''t think you are seeing on your computer... you can see a distortion from the towel on the wall.  Try getting onto Ben''s computer and signing in on that one.  If you can''t see anything different on his, next time you are in town, stop by and I will bring it up on mine.Otherwise great job... and I already have some great ideas for this weeks challenge... don''t know if I''m gonna do it there or make a "studio" here to do it and let you find out later.', '2002-08-19 04:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
