(106278, 4562, 2881, '<td valign="top">This is the nicest of this type of photo, you did a good job.  I love the reflective surface and black background. Makes all the colors so vidid.</td>', 'This is the nicest of this type of photo, you did a good job.  I love the reflective surface and black background. Makes all the colors so vidid.', '2002-08-20 12:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
