(106280, 4562, 2928, '<td valign="top">Its hard to get an interesting shot of pencils alone, but you have got a long way towards that goal. I really like the atmosphere created by the vibrant colours and dark backdrop.  Also, the reflective surface works really well.  In terms of a quality shot  it is.  Personally, pencils arent my thing, but, I think this is a well composed picture showing good technique and flair even with the massive pencil drag factor. :o)  (10)</td>', 'Its hard to get an interesting shot of pencils alone, but you have got a long way towards that goal. I really like the atmosphere created by the vibrant colours and dark backdrop.  Also, the reflective surface works really well.  In terms of a quality shot  it is.  Personally, pencils arent my thing, but, I think this is a well composed picture showing good technique and flair even with the massive pencil drag factor. :o)  (10)', '2002-08-20 15:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
