(106301, 4564, 2553, '<td valign="top">Though I like this shot, the way the flower is sitting dead center detracts from it, for me.  I would love to see a more dynamic shot of this setup. lhall</td>', 'Though I like this shot, the way the flower is sitting dead center detracts from it, for me.  I would love to see a more dynamic shot of this setup. lhall', '2002-08-19 11:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
