(106303, 4564, 2353, '<td valign="top">Terrific!  Very original and overall just a pleasing picture to look at...well, you know as pencils go :-).  The only thing is that the pencils aren''t lined up perfectly straight which isn''t a huge deal but against the black background it stands out a bit.  Good job and good luck on the challenge!  -KrazyKat</td>', 'Terrific!  Very original and overall just a pleasing picture to look at...well, you know as pencils go :-).  The only thing is that the pencils aren''t lined up perfectly straight which isn''t a huge deal but against the black background it stands out a bit.  Good job and good luck on the challenge!  -KrazyKat', '2002-08-19 22:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
