(106307, 4564, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and I adore the combination of yellow and black. Because this is such a geometric composition I''d like it if the pencils were more accurately arranged (feel free to call me a picky old cow). I do also find something a little too static in such a centralised composition, yet there is something in this which attracts me. Sorry, this has to be one of my more rambling and useless commments.<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'Lovely colours and I adore the combination of yellow and black. Because this is such a geometric composition I''d like it if the pencils were more accurately arranged (feel free to call me a picky old cow). I do also find something a little too static in such a centralised composition, yet there is something in this which attracts me. Sorry, this has to be one of my more rambling and useless commments.5, Kavey', '2002-08-20 13:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106308, 4564, 2649, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, very sharp.</td>', 'Nice photo, very sharp.', '2002-08-20 14:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
