(106354, 4567, 2295, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Focus looks good.  The lighting seems a bit dark at the bottom.  I like what you did with this picture.  I''d really like to see what this looks like in color.  8</td>', 'Very nice.  Focus looks good.  The lighting seems a bit dark at the bottom.  I like what you did with this picture.  I''d really like to see what this looks like in color.  8', '2002-08-19 14:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
