(106356, 4567, 2867, '<td valign="top">each week i give out 1 score of a 10 and this week u r it!  what a cute idea and this is a great photo.  the black and white is wonderfull and the pencil actually looks like a tree in the thumbnail picture! nice job</td>', 'each week i give out 1 score of a 10 and this week u r it!  what a cute idea and this is a great photo.  the black and white is wonderfull and the pencil actually looks like a tree in the thumbnail picture! nice job', '2002-08-19 18:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
