(106359, 4567, 1360, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  The soft focus in the background is perfect; with the light poking through... The forced perspective shot is amazing.  My highest rating so far.  9 -lennier</td>', 'I really like this.  The soft focus in the background is perfect; with the light poking through... The forced perspective shot is amazing.  My highest rating so far.  9 -lennier', '2002-08-19 19:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
