(106371, 4567, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful! I''m kind of looking at it and wondering what I would think if I didn''t know if was for the pencil challenge. Would it make sense? It would be kind of surreal. As part of the challenge though, it''s one of my favourites. 10 - lisae</td>', 'This is beautiful! I''m kind of looking at it and wondering what I would think if I didn''t know if was for the pencil challenge. Would it make sense? It would be kind of surreal. As part of the challenge though, it''s one of my favourites. 10 - lisae', '2002-08-21 12:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106372, 4567, 3220, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2002-08-21 12:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106373, 4567, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a classic; love it.  It grabbed my attention.  The clever angle and great use of B &amp; W create a superb sense of scale and make an alien object look like it belongs in the in the overall picture.  I think this shot shows a great eye for artistry.  (10)</td>', 'This is a classic; love it.  It grabbed my attention.  The clever angle and great use of B & W create a superb sense of scale and make an alien object look like it belongs in the in the overall picture.  I think this shot shows a great eye for artistry.  (10)', '2002-08-21 14:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
