(106388, 4567, 2172, '<td valign="top">Really cool.  (Running out of steam for commenting - so being brief)  Angle, exposure, b/w, idea, detail, time and effort - all great!  9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Really cool.  (Running out of steam for commenting - so being brief)  Angle, exposure, b/w, idea, detail, time and effort - all great!  9Ruthann', '2002-08-23 23:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106389, 4567, 1209, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, but the picture is a little too "blown out" for my taste, although I like the lighting on the pencil.</td>', 'Clever idea, but the picture is a little too "blown out" for my taste, although I like the lighting on the pencil.', '2002-08-24 16:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106390, 4567, 2353, '<td valign="top">The ant crawling on the pencil makes this pic to me.  Great job...I hope that you didn''t get too dirty down there!!! :-)  9-KrazyKat</td>', 'The ant crawling on the pencil makes this pic to me.  Great job...I hope that you didn''t get too dirty down there!!! :-)  9-KrazyKat', '2002-08-24 21:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106391, 4567, 3506, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and lighting.  Only suggestion I can think of would be to try compensating for the barrel distortion.  Great shot!</td>', 'Excellent composition and lighting.  Only suggestion I can think of would be to try compensating for the barrel distortion.  Great shot!', '2002-08-25 13:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106392, 4567, 3469, '<td valign="top">The idea is nice, but the execution is not very exciting. Lighting is good.</td>', 'The idea is nice, but the execution is not very exciting. Lighting is good.', '2002-08-25 18:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106393, 4567, 1808, '<td valign="top">Good composition. Did you glue the ant there?</td>', 'Good composition. Did you glue the ant there?', '2002-08-25 18:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106394, 4567, 2221, '<td valign="top">Creative idea! Good DOF to focus on the pencil. B&amp;W was a good choice, too. Is that an ant on the pencil? Cute ;-)<br/>-stephan</td>', 'Creative idea! Good DOF to focus on the pencil. B&W was a good choice, too. Is that an ant on the pencil? Cute ;-)-stephan', '2002-08-25 20:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106395, 4567, 835, '<td valign="top">there is nothing I would change with this picture. unique perspective.</td>', 'there is nothing I would change with this picture. unique perspective.', '2002-08-25 23:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106396, 4567, 772, '<td valign="top">Hokie, this is a great shot... excellent finish!</td>', 'Hokie, this is a great shot... excellent finish!', '2002-08-26 01:13:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(106397, 4567, 2586, '<td valign="top">This week I was very generous with my 10''s - I gave five of them, I believe. Your image though was by far my favorite. In fact, it blew me away.  Well done, Monet, eh I mean, Hokie.</td>', 'This week I was very generous with my 10''s - I gave five of them, I believe. Your image though was by far my favorite. In fact, it blew me away.  Well done, Monet, eh I mean, Hokie.', '2002-08-26 02:19:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(106398, 4567, 1066, '<td valign="top">Thanks to the folks that liked this.<br/><br/>I was taking some nature photos on a walk one day,  stuck the pencil in the ground...took about 20 photos at various angles and on the last photo this little ant crawled up the side of the pencil just as I snapped the shutter.  He literally ran up the side so fast he was gone before I could get another shot off!!! Woah!<br/><br/>Just lucky this one and only photo was in focus!!  Don''t you just love photography like that :-)</td>', 'Thanks to the folks that liked this.I was taking some nature photos on a walk one day,  stuck the pencil in the ground...took about 20 photos at various angles and on the last photo this little ant crawled up the side of the pencil just as I snapped the shutter.  He literally ran up the side so fast he was gone before I could get another shot off!!! Woah!Just lucky this one and only photo was in focus!!  Don''t you just love photography like that :-)', '2002-08-26 02:42:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(106399, 4567, 2667, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent shot Hokie. It had an added impact for me because this was my first idea for this challenge, but it was eventually tabled for fear that it was just too difficult a shot to pull off... you have shown me just how wrong I was. And btw, I love that ant!</td>', 'This is an excellent shot Hokie. It had an added impact for me because this was my first idea for this challenge, but it was eventually tabled for fear that it was just too difficult a shot to pull off... you have shown me just how wrong I was. And btw, I love that ant!', '2002-08-26 17:39:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(106400, 4571, 573, '<td valign="top">I have the feeling you spent some time making this photo and technicaly it''s good.  But when you use a seamless background it needs to be ironed to remove the distracting wrinkles.  In my opinion the whole glass should be in the frame and maybe even the main pencil as well.</td>', 'I have the feeling you spent some time making this photo and technicaly it''s good.  But when you use a seamless background it needs to be ironed to remove the distracting wrinkles.  In my opinion the whole glass should be in the frame and maybe even the main pencil as well.', '2002-08-19 15:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106401, 4571, 656, '<td valign="top">lacks ... something.  Not sure what but it seems a very literal depiction of the subject so ends up not exciting me/ moving me/ interesting me.  Yes it shows refraction.</td>', 'lacks ... something.  Not sure what but it seems a very literal depiction of the subject so ends up not exciting me/ moving me/ interesting me.  Yes it shows refraction.', '2002-08-19 22:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106402, 4571, 2, '<td valign="top">The colors on this shot are pretty dull, but could be helped with a levels/saturation adjustment in photoshop.</td>', 'The colors on this shot are pretty dull, but could be helped with a levels/saturation adjustment in photoshop.', '2002-08-20 01:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106403, 4571, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea and nice colour and light. Would prefer the top of the glass not to be missing and for the glass itself to sit more vertically.<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'Interesting idea and nice colour and light. Would prefer the top of the glass not to be missing and for the glass itself to sit more vertically.5, Kavey', '2002-08-20 14:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106404, 4571, 2752, '<td valign="top">good example but would be more effective if the glass were off center</td>', 'good example but would be more effective if the glass were off center', '2002-08-20 19:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106405, 4571, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing5,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,<br/>Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing5,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool', '2002-08-22 10:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106406, 4571, 2000, '<td valign="top">(muted trumpet) Ba Ba Bwee Bah.<br/>That one pencil hiding behind the glass (standing) is distracting with the eraser peeking out.  Nice concept, and fairly well executed.</td>', '(muted trumpet) Ba Ba Bwee Bah.That one pencil hiding behind the glass (standing) is distracting with the eraser peeking out.  Nice concept, and fairly well executed.', '2002-08-22 16:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106407, 4571, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice photo.  I like how you also have the pencils around the outside of the glass as well.  The lighting was great to emphasize the effect.  The focus is great and the angle is nice.  I would have maybe tried to get the glass a bit more straight up and down.  It kind of looks like it''s tilting a bit.  If you tried and couldn''t, no big deal, just tell me to shut up. lol.  Great job and good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'This is a very nice photo.  I like how you also have the pencils around the outside of the glass as well.  The lighting was great to emphasize the effect.  The focus is great and the angle is nice.  I would have maybe tried to get the glass a bit more straight up and down.  It kind of looks like it''s tilting a bit.  If you tried and couldn''t, no big deal, just tell me to shut up. lol.  Great job and good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-23 15:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106408, 4574, 2223, '<td valign="top">how did u do this?? im sure i wont be the only one to ask that question....very cool!</td>', 'how did u do this?? im sure i wont be the only one to ask that question....very cool!', '2002-08-19 01:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106409, 4574, 2204, '<td valign="top">Good DOF and contrast.  Complimentary color and composition.  Title could have been better.  =8 syamjonimi</td>', 'Good DOF and contrast.  Complimentary color and composition.  Title could have been better.  =8 syamjonimi', '2002-08-19 02:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106410, 4574, 2437, '<td valign="top">red pencil you mean.<br/>nice idea!<br/>how did you made the red pencil float?</td>', 'red pencil you mean.nice idea!how did you made the red pencil float?', '2002-08-19 03:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106411, 4574, 2928, '<td valign="top">Technically well done, meets the challenge.  My only gripe is with the sharpness of the image</td>', 'Technically well done, meets the challenge.  My only gripe is with the sharpness of the image', '2002-08-19 07:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106412, 4574, 3280, '<td valign="top">I think this had the makings of a great shot but just missed the mark a little.  Focus a little too soft...I''m not even sure but I just felt myself wanting something else.</td>', 'I think this had the makings of a great shot but just missed the mark a little.  Focus a little too soft...I''m not even sure but I just felt myself wanting something else.', '2002-08-19 15:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106413, 4574, 2586, '<td valign="top">I like this image and wonder how you did it. The increasing blur on the other pencils works very well. It creates a nice mystique. 7 for now definitely will revisit lateron this week. Journey. <br/>Update: This image is one that keeps pulling my attention again and again. As a humdrum aside, I get the feeling that the photographer is someone who likes to work with pencils since they are sharpened with a knife :) Anyway, congrat and a 10 Journey</td>', 'I like this image and wonder how you did it. The increasing blur on the other pencils works very well. It creates a nice mystique. 7 for now definitely will revisit lateron this week. Journey. Update: This image is one that keeps pulling my attention again and again. As a humdrum aside, I get the feeling that the photographer is someone who likes to work with pencils since they are sharpened with a knife :) Anyway, congrat and a 10 Journey', '2002-08-19 15:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106414, 4574, 1779, '<td valign="top">weird but interesting...</td>', 'weird but interesting...', '2002-08-19 18:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106415, 4574, 875, '<td valign="top">I like the contrasting colors, the "smoky" effect, and the nice DOF.<br/></td>', 'I like the contrasting colors, the "smoky" effect, and the nice DOF.', '2002-08-19 23:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106416, 4574, 2323, '<td valign="top">This is way cool... would love to know how you did it.  Picture seems a little blotty up top, but that may be a DOF thing.  It is also a bit too bright for my taste.    --6-- sohr</td>', 'This is way cool... would love to know how you did it.  Picture seems a little blotty up top, but that may be a DOF thing.  It is also a bit too bright for my taste.    --6-- sohr', '2002-08-20 00:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106417, 4574, 2152, '<td valign="top">Cool effect on this.  I don''t really like the DOF though.  I wish it was either smaller so the top of the pencil was more blurred or bigger so the whole pencil was in focus.  Anyway, it''s still one of the better shots this week.</td>', 'Cool effect on this.  I don''t really like the DOF though.  I wish it was either smaller so the top of the pencil was more blurred or bigger so the whole pencil was in focus.  Anyway, it''s still one of the better shots this week.', '2002-08-20 13:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106418, 4574, 2172, '<td valign="top">Really nice work - the pencil is jumping out at me!  I like the whole thing - the colors and the way the blue is on the side and sort of blends with the other pencils and how stark the light is on the tip of the red pencil - this photo is screaming - look at me! look at me!  Very artistic - reflects a lot of time and effort  (was a 9)  10!<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Really nice work - the pencil is jumping out at me!  I like the whole thing - the colors and the way the blue is on the side and sort of blends with the other pencils and how stark the light is on the tip of the red pencil - this photo is screaming - look at me! look at me!  Very artistic - reflects a lot of time and effort  (was a 9)  10!Ruthann', '2002-08-20 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106419, 4574, 2427, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect - curious as to how acheived...</td>', 'Interesting effect - curious as to how acheived...', '2002-08-20 18:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106420, 4574, 933, '<td valign="top">Very cool effect.  Cant wait to see how you did it.  Nice colors &amp; composition. Very well done!  9 md</td>', 'Very cool effect.  Cant wait to see how you did it.  Nice colors & composition. Very well done!  9 md', '2002-08-21 03:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106421, 4574, 2000, '<td valign="top">I hope you explain how you did this in your comments or notes.  I notice your''s is the only pic i''ve seen where the pencils were sharpened by knife rather than by sharpener.  It adds some nice texture and lighting surfaces.</td>', 'I hope you explain how you did this in your comments or notes.  I notice your''s is the only pic i''ve seen where the pencils were sharpened by knife rather than by sharpener.  It adds some nice texture and lighting surfaces.', '2002-08-21 11:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106422, 4574, 715, '<td valign="top">Great idea and a very good composition. - Well done!</td>', 'Great idea and a very good composition. - Well done!', '2002-08-21 16:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106423, 4574, 2752, '<td valign="top">good composition and I like the way the red pencil stands out from the rest.  Like the bluish background.</td>', 'good composition and I like the way the red pencil stands out from the rest.  Like the bluish background.', '2002-08-21 18:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106424, 4574, 1759, '<td valign="top">Very interesting effect. How did you do this? Good job!</td>', 'Very interesting effect. How did you do this? Good job!', '2002-08-21 22:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106425, 4574, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you live next door so you could explain how you made that effect!  :)</td>', 'I''m glad you live next door so you could explain how you made that effect!  :)', '2002-08-21 22:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
