(106441, 4575, 3087, '<td valign="top">Although I kind of wonder what the pencil is doing there, I do like the shape of the boy''s body and spade, and the use of DOF. The way the background frames the foreground is something I haven''t seen used this well before and for that I am giving this slightly higher.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Although I kind of wonder what the pencil is doing there, I do like the shape of the boy''s body and spade, and the use of DOF. The way the background frames the foreground is something I haven''t seen used this well before and for that I am giving this slightly higher.6, Kavey', '2002-08-20 18:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
