(106444, 4575, 3080, '<td valign="top">School''s out.  I''m going to the beach.  and I don''t need this pencil.  It would make a nice flag pole on top of my castle.  I like it.  I also like the 3 vertical objects in this.  The shovel, pencil and arm.  Love the natural light and your framing is great.  Godd job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'School''s out.  I''m going to the beach.  and I don''t need this pencil.  It would make a nice flag pole on top of my castle.  I like it.  I also like the 3 vertical objects in this.  The shovel, pencil and arm.  Love the natural light and your framing is great.  Godd job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-21 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
