(106447, 4575, 1037, '<td valign="top">Wow, I love a lot about this image. The composition and DOF are the most striking elements. It''s odd though that it doesn''t really appeal to me visually despite these things. I appreciate your vision.</td>', 'Wow, I love a lot about this image. The composition and DOF are the most striking elements. It''s odd though that it doesn''t really appeal to me visually despite these things. I appreciate your vision.', '2002-08-24 07:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
