(106466, 4576, 1005, '<td valign="top">Is that a pencil in the foreground?  I honestly don''t recognize it as such.  I like the yellow and white lights on either side of your object.  I also don''t get the significance of the artwork in the background, but am assuming it has something to do with the concept you were attempting.  (maybe pencil in pixelation?)  The reflected light on the right side is also a bit distracting.  6 Swash</td>', 'Is that a pencil in the foreground?  I honestly don''t recognize it as such.  I like the yellow and white lights on either side of your object.  I also don''t get the significance of the artwork in the background, but am assuming it has something to do with the concept you were attempting.  (maybe pencil in pixelation?)  The reflected light on the right side is also a bit distracting.  6 Swash', '2002-08-20 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106467, 4576, 1041, '<td valign="top">if i didn''t know this was the pencil challenge i would''ve thought you had a pen there, this is not recognizable specifically as a pencil.  there are some highlights on the pen.  interesting with the ''pencil'' design in the back (it''s a little pixelated ;), but, to be honest, the shot just isn''t very interesting to me and i think (personal interpretation) you barely meet the challenge.  sorry. -- gr8photos (2)</td>', 'if i didn''t know this was the pencil challenge i would''ve thought you had a pen there, this is not recognizable specifically as a pencil.  there are some highlights on the pen.  interesting with the ''pencil'' design in the back (it''s a little pixelated ;), but, to be honest, the shot just isn''t very interesting to me and i think (personal interpretation) you barely meet the challenge.  sorry. -- gr8photos (2)', '2002-08-21 16:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106468, 4576, 1827, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the intention of this photo.  What is the computerized image and what does it represent?  Is that the eraser of a mechanical pencil?  The play of light on the pencil (?) is nice, but overall, I think this is a poor photo.  Perhaps if you''d just worked with the pencil and the framing, but the computer icon only adds confusion for me, and leaves the pencil seemingly unimportant in the photo.  I''m sorry, but I scored this a 1.</td>', 'I don''t understand the intention of this photo.  What is the computerized image and what does it represent?  Is that the eraser of a mechanical pencil?  The play of light on the pencil (?) is nice, but overall, I think this is a poor photo.  Perhaps if you''d just worked with the pencil and the framing, but the computer icon only adds confusion for me, and leaves the pencil seemingly unimportant in the photo.  I''m sorry, but I scored this a 1.', '2002-08-21 17:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
