(106471, 4576, 3080, '<td valign="top">cute.  I think this is the pencil to a palm pilot.  correct me if i''m wrong.  i''ve never really seen one up close.  angle and lighting are great.  frame placement is ok.  I wish the black pointer thing was a little farther away so maybe it was a little clearer.  I can''t really make it out, and never seeing one before, even harder for me to understand really what i"m looking at.  however, focus and other technical aspects are fine.  good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'cute.  I think this is the pencil to a palm pilot.  correct me if i''m wrong.  i''ve never really seen one up close.  angle and lighting are great.  frame placement is ok.  I wish the black pointer thing was a little farther away so maybe it was a little clearer.  I can''t really make it out, and never seeing one before, even harder for me to understand really what i"m looking at.  however, focus and other technical aspects are fine.  good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-26 00:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
