(106482, 4577, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is funny.  It''s interesting how the pencil is sharp, and the foreground and background have a soft focus.  Pretty neat.  My camera doesn''t allow for me to adjust my own focus, so when I see focus tricks, it never ceases to amaze me.   Neat idea for the photo.  Lots of creativity this week.  the lighting is great and I like the angle.  Don''t think I''d hang it on my wall, but that''s not your fault, I just don''t have a "thing" for pencils.  So setting that aside, overall good photo.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is funny.  It''s interesting how the pencil is sharp, and the foreground and background have a soft focus.  Pretty neat.  My camera doesn''t allow for me to adjust my own focus, so when I see focus tricks, it never ceases to amaze me.   Neat idea for the photo.  Lots of creativity this week.  the lighting is great and I like the angle.  Don''t think I''d hang it on my wall, but that''s not your fault, I just don''t have a "thing" for pencils.  So setting that aside, overall good photo.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-20 11:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
