(106573, 4581, 2199, '<td valign="top">Very creative! I love the colors in your photo, especially the brown/green combination. Depth of field very effective also. Nice abstract quality -- is that a flame in the photograph, or just intense sunlight or ?</td>', 'Very creative! I love the colors in your photo, especially the brown/green combination. Depth of field very effective also. Nice abstract quality -- is that a flame in the photograph, or just intense sunlight or ?', '2002-08-20 23:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
