(106580, 4581, 3080, '<td valign="top">All too common this year.  I like how the flame is comming off the side of the pencil.  Gives it a different look that way.  focus and angle are good and the background being green gives it more of a "forest" feel.  Nice job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'All too common this year.  I like how the flame is comming off the side of the pencil.  Gives it a different look that way.  focus and angle are good and the background being green gives it more of a "forest" feel.  Nice job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-23 12:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
