(106582, 4581, 3189, '<td valign="top">I dont know, but I assume it was difficult to get this shot.  Yet it has simplicity; I really like it, you can almost feel the flame. (8)</td>', 'I dont know, but I assume it was difficult to get this shot.  Yet it has simplicity; I really like it, you can almost feel the flame. (8)', '2002-08-23 18:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106583, 4581, 2172, '<td valign="top">Really great!  The green is great.  The composition is great as well as the dof.  I definately appreciate the skill, time and effort to achieve this.  Excellent capture of the flame (I need to start trying that).  1 small thing - maybe a few more "trees" - but no big deal.  I really enjoy this photo.  Great work.  9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Really great!  The green is great.  The composition is great as well as the dof.  I definately appreciate the skill, time and effort to achieve this.  Excellent capture of the flame (I need to start trying that).  1 small thing - maybe a few more "trees" - but no big deal.  I really enjoy this photo.  Great work.  9Ruthann', '2002-08-23 22:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106584, 4582, 1330, '<td valign="top">out of focus</td>', 'out of focus', '2002-08-19 06:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106585, 4582, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting idea and the light on the pencil and rubble is good. I like the green colour and light reflected there but the tractor thing seems too much in shadow. I think though this is interesting idea, the photo doesn''t grab me visually.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'This is an interesting idea and the light on the pencil and rubble is good. I like the green colour and light reflected there but the tractor thing seems too much in shadow. I think though this is interesting idea, the photo doesn''t grab me visually.Kavey', '2002-08-20 07:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106586, 4582, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background9,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,<br/>Total Averaged Rating8.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background9,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,Total Averaged Rating8.   Autool', '2002-08-20 10:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106587, 4582, 2295, '<td valign="top">Lighting is good on this shot.  It seems to be a bit out of focus though.</td>', 'Lighting is good on this shot.  It seems to be a bit out of focus though.', '2002-08-20 10:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106588, 4582, 3031, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, it doesn''t appeal to me. Nice clean shot though.</td>', 'I''m sorry, it doesn''t appeal to me. Nice clean shot though.', '2002-08-21 04:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106589, 4582, 1041, '<td valign="top">you definitely met the challenge, and you''ve used the selective DOF quite well, but - to me - the picture has very little appeal, sorry.  also, i guess i don''t quite get the title.  the modernization probably relates to the heavy machinery and the pile of rubble.  if you mean modernization from using old-fashioned pens, there''s no link to what we are moving to. -- gr8photos (3)</td>', 'you definitely met the challenge, and you''ve used the selective DOF quite well, but - to me - the picture has very little appeal, sorry.  also, i guess i don''t quite get the title.  the modernization probably relates to the heavy machinery and the pile of rubble.  if you mean modernization from using old-fashioned pens, there''s no link to what we are moving to. -- gr8photos (3)', '2002-08-21 10:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106590, 4582, 3080, '<td valign="top">There is definately a pencil here.  I''m not sure I understand, but I think it has something to do with how something used to be done, and how it''s done now.  In my opinion, it''s not very visually appealing, however, my son loved the "big truck".  Setting all that aside...The lighting is good, and the angle on the dirt is good.  I wish we could see more of the bull dozer. Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'There is definately a pencil here.  I''m not sure I understand, but I think it has something to do with how something used to be done, and how it''s done now.  In my opinion, it''s not very visually appealing, however, my son loved the "big truck".  Setting all that aside...The lighting is good, and the angle on the dirt is good.  I wish we could see more of the bull dozer. Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-21 13:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106591, 4582, 772, '<td valign="top">I see the pencil... I''m not sure I understand the ''message'' though... I understand the ''modernization'' theme with the bulldozer making way for new things, but I''m lost on how the pencil fits in here... Maybe I''m just trying to figure out something that isn''t there :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'I see the pencil... I''m not sure I understand the ''message'' though... I understand the ''modernization'' theme with the bulldozer making way for new things, but I''m lost on how the pencil fits in here... Maybe I''m just trying to figure out something that isn''t there :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-22 12:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106592, 4582, 3448, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2002-08-22 15:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106593, 4582, 509, '<td valign="top">Well.....I liked it anyway</td>', 'Well.....I liked it anyway', '2002-08-26 01:24:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(106594, 4582, 509, '<td valign="top">Explanation:  The pencil is "just there" (broken by the bulldozer....not really).  I thought the roots and the live trees would make more of a message.  I wasn''t going for anything with the pencil specifically.  It was just in the way of the "modernization" caused by the bulldozer, just as the trees are/were.  Thanks to those who tried to figure it out though ; )</td>', 'Explanation:  The pencil is "just there" (broken by the bulldozer....not really).  I thought the roots and the live trees would make more of a message.  I wasn''t going for anything with the pencil specifically.  It was just in the way of the "modernization" caused by the bulldozer, just as the trees are/were.  Thanks to those who tried to figure it out though ; )', '2002-08-26 03:03:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(106595, 4583, 1054, '<td valign="top">Wery well-done!</td>', 'Wery well-done!', '2002-08-19 03:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106596, 4583, 2344, '<td valign="top">That is a pretty cool idea. Reminds me of that guy on the show "art attack" (not sure if you''ve heard of it) when there''s a camera high up and this guy makes a whole picture out of either strange objects or salt. That eraser gave me that feeling.</td>', 'That is a pretty cool idea. Reminds me of that guy on the show "art attack" (not sure if you''ve heard of it) when there''s a camera high up and this guy makes a whole picture out of either strange objects or salt. That eraser gave me that feeling.', '2002-08-19 10:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106597, 4583, 436, '<td valign="top">clever idea, but the composition doesn''t thrill me.  Perhaps if the other things looked like they were (or could be) used and echoed the angle/direction of the "pencil sketch"</td>', 'clever idea, but the composition doesn''t thrill me.  Perhaps if the other things looked like they were (or could be) used and echoed the angle/direction of the "pencil sketch"', '2002-08-19 12:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106598, 4583, 2466, '<td valign="top">the eraser is in the perfect place!  it makes me laugh</td>', 'the eraser is in the perfect place!  it makes me laugh', '2002-08-19 15:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106599, 4583, 327, '<td valign="top">Creative, cleaver, colorful, fun. This is a great job.....BRAVO!! Score 8 ~Kee</td>', 'Creative, cleaver, colorful, fun. This is a great job.....BRAVO!! Score 8 ~Kee', '2002-08-19 16:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106600, 4583, 3080, '<td valign="top">You put the eraser where the eraser should go.  At the end of the pencil!!  I love it!  That is really cute.  The lighting is good, the shadows are subtle enough they aren''t distracting.  However, toward the pinky finger on the hand, there is a dark outline going around the finger and down the back of the hand.  I tried to enlarge it and change the lighting to figure out what was making it, and I actually couldn''t figure out if it was a funny dark shadow, or if you may have moved your hand while the photo was being taken.  Anyway, If i''m getting that picky, then you have a nice photo.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'You put the eraser where the eraser should go.  At the end of the pencil!!  I love it!  That is really cute.  The lighting is good, the shadows are subtle enough they aren''t distracting.  However, toward the pinky finger on the hand, there is a dark outline going around the finger and down the back of the hand.  I tried to enlarge it and change the lighting to figure out what was making it, and I actually couldn''t figure out if it was a funny dark shadow, or if you may have moved your hand while the photo was being taken.  Anyway, If i''m getting that picky, then you have a nice photo.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-19 20:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106601, 4583, 2279, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture, but i would have made the entire pencil in his hand be visible. 8.</td>', 'I really like this picture, but i would have made the entire pencil in his hand be visible. 8.', '2002-08-20 01:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106602, 4583, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. What does TICONDEROGA mean? Composition doesn''t grab me. Wonder what it would be like taken from other angles?<br/>Kavey</td>', 'Interesting idea. What does TICONDEROGA mean? Composition doesn''t grab me. Wonder what it would be like taken from other angles?Kavey', '2002-08-20 07:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106603, 4583, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,<br/>Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool', '2002-08-20 10:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106604, 4583, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is really clever on the eye.  I love the surreal size illusion created within the shot; it all looks so normal at first glance, but when you look closely there''s more to this picture than first meets the eye Are they really giant pens?  Great shot  worthy 10</td>', 'This is really clever on the eye.  I love the surreal size illusion created within the shot; it all looks so normal at first glance, but when you look closely there''s more to this picture than first meets the eye Are they really giant pens?  Great shot  worthy 10', '2002-08-20 11:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106605, 4583, 3198, '<td valign="top">mmm the idea is good but the execution could have been better. not much depth in the image (no perspective) makes it dull and not very dynamic. lighting is very flat too.</td>', 'mmm the idea is good but the execution could have been better. not much depth in the image (no perspective) makes it dull and not very dynamic. lighting is very flat too.', '2002-08-21 06:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106606, 4583, 2158, '<td valign="top">I find this too cluttered.  I''d have preferred to have just the sketch with the hand holding the pencil.</td>', 'I find this too cluttered.  I''d have preferred to have just the sketch with the hand holding the pencil.', '2002-08-21 22:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106607, 4583, 1003, '<td valign="top">nicely done.</td>', 'nicely done.', '2002-08-22 07:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106608, 4584, 2586, '<td valign="top">The point of the pencil which happens to be in the foreground is way out of focus and that happens to be the first thing you see when looking at this picture. The reflections through the spoon aren''t particularly attractive either, background too cluttered and the photographer and the camera too prominent. Nice idea but you should have explored this more.</td>', 'The point of the pencil which happens to be in the foreground is way out of focus and that happens to be the first thing you see when looking at this picture. The reflections through the spoon aren''t particularly attractive either, background too cluttered and the photographer and the camera too prominent. Nice idea but you should have explored this more.', '2002-08-19 02:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106609, 4584, 1143, '<td valign="top">a reflection of only the pencil might be more effective in keeping with the simplicity of the shot</td>', 'a reflection of only the pencil might be more effective in keeping with the simplicity of the shot', '2002-08-19 02:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106610, 4584, 1360, '<td valign="top">I think having the point in focus might have worked better.  I like what you attempted, but a different angle, where the camera wasnt showing might have also worked better.  5 -lennier</td>', 'I think having the point in focus might have worked better.  I like what you attempted, but a different angle, where the camera wasnt showing might have also worked better.  5 -lennier', '2002-08-19 03:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106611, 4584, 806, '<td valign="top">I''m left wondering why you would want you, your camera and the ''frig in this reflection. Hmmm.</td>', 'I''m left wondering why you would want you, your camera and the ''frig in this reflection. Hmmm.', '2002-08-19 11:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106612, 4584, 472, '<td valign="top">good artistic shot.  like the blur but im sure most people hate it :)</td>', 'good artistic shot.  like the blur but im sure most people hate it :)', '2002-08-19 11:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106613, 4584, 2023, '<td valign="top">I like the concept but the setting could be improved a little, I mean a shinier spoon and more attractive background.</td>', 'I like the concept but the setting could be improved a little, I mean a shinier spoon and more attractive background.', '2002-08-19 14:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106614, 4584, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice......very nice. LOL clever work. Score 7 ~Kee</td>', 'Nice......very nice. LOL clever work. Score 7 ~Kee', '2002-08-19 16:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106615, 4584, 3127, '<td valign="top">This would be a nifty picture if the rest of the reflection wasn''t a laundry room scene.</td>', 'This would be a nifty picture if the rest of the reflection wasn''t a laundry room scene.', '2002-08-19 17:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106616, 4584, 3185, '<td valign="top">It may be just me, but I almost think that the pencil being blurry in the foreground is destracting.  I think I would like this better with a clear pencil as well as the spoon / reflection.  I really liked your idea though!</td>', 'It may be just me, but I almost think that the pencil being blurry in the foreground is destracting.  I think I would like this better with a clear pencil as well as the spoon / reflection.  I really liked your idea though!', '2002-08-19 17:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106617, 4584, 2815, '<td valign="top">I like this shot allot, but I know that everyone is going to rip on you for showing you camera.  for some reason everyone hates that.  Oh well i give you a (7)</td>', 'I like this shot allot, but I know that everyone is going to rip on you for showing you camera.  for some reason everyone hates that.  Oh well i give you a (7)', '2002-08-19 18:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106618, 4584, 1280, '<td valign="top">Creative use of reflection!</td>', 'Creative use of reflection!', '2002-08-19 18:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106619, 4584, 2011, '<td valign="top">In the thumbnail I couldnt tell what was in the reflection besides the pencil.  Now that I can see that it you I really think Its cool.  Only wish the pencil were a little clearer</td>', 'In the thumbnail I couldnt tell what was in the reflection besides the pencil.  Now that I can see that it you I really think Its cool.  Only wish the pencil were a little clearer', '2002-08-20 00:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106620, 4584, 2643, '<td valign="top">Nice camera!</td>', 'Nice camera!', '2002-08-20 01:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106621, 4584, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF use, unusual to see foreground being the bit that isn''t in focus, and like the way the whole pencil is in the reflection and points back at the photographer.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'I like the DOF use, unusual to see foreground being the bit that isn''t in focus, and like the way the whole pencil is in the reflection and points back at the photographer.6, Kavey', '2002-08-20 19:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106622, 4584, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty cool idea and your lighting is good.  Did you want to be in the photo? I almost think that you are in the photo on purpose.  Not sure why I think that.  I think it''s cause the title is simply "reflection"  not "reflection of a pencil".  For comparrision, I''d like to see it also at a different angle with a sollid color background in the spoon.   Might look too much like an ad though.  The focus is soft for my taste, but that''s only an opinion and  it doesn''t take anything away from the photo.  Good luck in the challenge</td>', 'This is a pretty cool idea and your lighting is good.  Did you want to be in the photo? I almost think that you are in the photo on purpose.  Not sure why I think that.  I think it''s cause the title is simply "reflection"  not "reflection of a pencil".  For comparrision, I''d like to see it also at a different angle with a sollid color background in the spoon.   Might look too much like an ad though.  The focus is soft for my taste, but that''s only an opinion and  it doesn''t take anything away from the photo.  Good luck in the challenge', '2002-08-20 19:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106623, 4584, 1041, '<td valign="top">nice idea, nicely controlled white background, good placement of objects.  the thing that keeps drawing my eye is the really out of focus tip of the pen.  i know it''s not supposed to be the focus of the shot, and that''s why the DOF is that way, but my eye still wanders there.  there are also too many details reflecting in the spoon other than you and the pen and the camera.  i know i''m probably asking a lot, but do you have a plain wall in the house that you could''ve used as background (and, yes, i have a very hard time finding one in mine, too, but i think it would make a difference to the photo). -- gr8photos (3)</td>', 'nice idea, nicely controlled white background, good placement of objects.  the thing that keeps drawing my eye is the really out of focus tip of the pen.  i know it''s not supposed to be the focus of the shot, and that''s why the DOF is that way, but my eye still wanders there.  there are also too many details reflecting in the spoon other than you and the pen and the camera.  i know i''m probably asking a lot, but do you have a plain wall in the house that you could''ve used as background (and, yes, i have a very hard time finding one in mine, too, but i think it would make a difference to the photo). -- gr8photos (3)', '2002-08-21 10:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106624, 4584, 3162, '<td valign="top">Good imagination. A little off on the technical side. Focus appears as problem not intentional.</td>', 'Good imagination. A little off on the technical side. Focus appears as problem not intentional.', '2002-08-21 11:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106625, 4584, 2798, '<td valign="top">Neat idea - I like that I can see you in the photo but Im less happy about the big white thing to the left of you. Dunno what it and I realise it''s REALLY hard to get rid of it. Your lighting is great, though and the DoF blurring the front of the pencil is great. Excellent concept and execution.</td>', 'Neat idea - I like that I can see you in the photo but Im less happy about the big white thing to the left of you. Dunno what it and I realise it''s REALLY hard to get rid of it. Your lighting is great, though and the DoF blurring the front of the pencil is great. Excellent concept and execution.', '2002-08-21 11:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106626, 4584, 3044, '<td valign="top">way cool. i love this. my first impression is the tip of the pencil should be in focus but then i realize the pencil is in focus in the reflection in the spoon. wonderful composition. very creative. 9</td>', 'way cool. i love this. my first impression is the tip of the pencil should be in focus but then i realize the pencil is in focus in the reflection in the spoon. wonderful composition. very creative. 9', '2002-08-21 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106627, 4584, 2867, '<td valign="top">i wish the pencil tip were in focus too, but i know thats not always possible ;)</td>', 'i wish the pencil tip were in focus too, but i know thats not always possible ;)', '2002-08-21 17:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106628, 4584, 1019, '<td valign="top">good use of different focus--interesting design--I like this--andrewm</td>', 'good use of different focus--interesting design--I like this--andrewm', '2002-08-22 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(106629, 4584, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background4,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing4,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,<br/>Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background4,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing4,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool', '2002-08-22 21:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106630, 4584, 2302, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here - creative and pretty well done - however I am too distracted by the reflection of you in the spoon. Could you try the shot moving a step or two to the right or left and shooting at an angle? I am not sure if you would still get the relection that way - but it might work. Good focus in the spoon and pretty good lighting = 5</td>', 'I like the idea here - creative and pretty well done - however I am too distracted by the reflection of you in the spoon. Could you try the shot moving a step or two to the right or left and shooting at an angle? I am not sure if you would still get the relection that way - but it might work. Good focus in the spoon and pretty good lighting = 5', '2002-08-23 15:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106631, 4584, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting concept for sure :)  This is also a tough shot to do... Keeping yourself out of the reflection would have been practically impossible here... curved reflective surfaces make that tough... I''m not sure if your camera has depth of field control, but I would like this photo better if the tip of the pencil in the foreground was in focus as well... good shot :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is an interesting concept for sure :)  This is also a tough shot to do... Keeping yourself out of the reflection would have been practically impossible here... curved reflective surfaces make that tough... I''m not sure if your camera has depth of field control, but I would like this photo better if the tip of the pencil in the foreground was in focus as well... good shot :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-23 15:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106632, 4584, 2158, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but there''s not too much in focus.</td>', 'Nice idea, but there''s not too much in focus.', '2002-08-23 21:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106633, 4584, 2352, '<td valign="top">This is the start of a nice creative idea for the challenge.<br/>Need to think more about focus and composition next time...<br/>Good luck!  You have a creative mind. I can see it was working...<br/></td>', 'This is the start of a nice creative idea for the challenge.Need to think more about focus and composition next time...Good luck!  You have a creative mind. I can see it was working...', '2002-08-23 22:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106634, 4584, 2204, '<td valign="top">Good use of reflection....Having the photographer and background appliances in the reflection are distracting.  I would prefer the purity of the subject being reflected in the spoon.</td>', 'Good use of reflection....Having the photographer and background appliances in the reflection are distracting.  I would prefer the purity of the subject being reflected in the spoon.', '2002-08-23 23:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106635, 4584, 3251, '<td valign="top">Yet another one of those: a very original idea, but not consequently executed. Focus is poor, the spoon has spots and marks, and there is too much distracting background in the reflection, including the photographer. Plus, the top of the spoon is cut off.</td>', 'Yet another one of those: a very original idea, but not consequently executed. Focus is poor, the spoon has spots and marks, and there is too much distracting background in the reflection, including the photographer. Plus, the top of the spoon is cut off.', '2002-08-24 02:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106636, 4584, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is very neat. The composition, soft focus, lovely light background, the scratches on the spoon''s surface, and the reflection of the photographer all combine to make this photo appealing and intriguing to me. It''s almost a little bit surreal. I don''t really know what the spoon is doing there, but it seems to belong :). I feel like giving this 10 - lisae</td>', 'This is very neat. The composition, soft focus, lovely light background, the scratches on the spoon''s surface, and the reflection of the photographer all combine to make this photo appealing and intriguing to me. It''s almost a little bit surreal. I don''t really know what the spoon is doing there, but it seems to belong :). I feel like giving this 10 - lisae', '2002-08-24 08:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106637, 4584, 637, '<td valign="top">Reflection for its own sake does not necessarily make for an interesting image... 4 sjgleah</td>', 'Reflection for its own sake does not necessarily make for an interesting image... 4 sjgleah', '2002-08-25 02:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106638, 4585, 3280, '<td valign="top">A little off on the focus...</td>', 'A little off on the focus...', '2002-08-19 10:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106639, 4585, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderfu dof, good shot, creative work. Score 7 ~Kee</td>', 'Wonderfu dof, good shot, creative work. Score 7 ~Kee', '2002-08-19 16:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106640, 4585, 2170, '<td valign="top">The focus on the crumbs is great, but without the title it looks like the focus of the picture is off.  Was the shadow in the front intentional?  It''s a bit distracting when combined with the shallow DOF.  Just MHO....muckpond.</td>', 'The focus on the crumbs is great, but without the title it looks like the focus of the picture is off.  Was the shadow in the front intentional?  It''s a bit distracting when combined with the shallow DOF.  Just MHO....muckpond.', '2002-08-20 17:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106641, 4585, 3087, '<td valign="top">Like the diagonal lines of the paper against the edge of the paper and the pencil. <br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Like the diagonal lines of the paper against the edge of the paper and the pencil. 6, Kavey', '2002-08-20 18:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
