(106680, 4586, 3080, '<td valign="top">I hope this isn''t the real address, and SS#s.  I feel your pain though.  I give up and have mine done professionally.  Great use of a pencil, and the focus on this is amazing.  lighting and frame placement are also good.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I hope this isn''t the real address, and SS#s.  I feel your pain though.  I give up and have mine done professionally.  Great use of a pencil, and the focus on this is amazing.  lighting and frame placement are also good.  good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-26 00:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106681, 4586, 3280, '<td valign="top">Of the 34 comments I recieved, 21 mentioned that they hoped I used fictional Social Security numbers and names.  I can assure you that I did.  I even got an e-mail from Drew that requested that I withdraw the photo if they were real.  I imagine there is some criminal out there somewhere, using fictitious Phillip Ferrell''s name with his phony I.D.  I hope he gets caught!!</td>', 'Of the 34 comments I recieved, 21 mentioned that they hoped I used fictional Social Security numbers and names.  I can assure you that I did.  I even got an e-mail from Drew that requested that I withdraw the photo if they were real.  I imagine there is some criminal out there somewhere, using fictitious Phillip Ferrell''s name with his phony I.D.  I hope he gets caught!!', '2002-08-26 01:17:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(106682, 4595, 3095, '<td valign="top">Bizarre! yay for you!</td>', 'Bizarre! yay for you!', '2002-08-19 02:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
