(106753, 4598, 3080, '<td valign="top">That is a pretty cool pencil.  I like the angle at which you took the pencil, but the angle of the rest of the photo kind of bothers me.  It looks like the kid is going to fall right out of the left side of their seat.  The lighting is good, and the photo has a lot of nice color in it.  You did a really great job of keeping distracting glare and reflection off the matallic colored pencil.  Looks like maybe the kid isn''t a natural lefty, but rather just in the left hand to get a good angle on the pencil.  That has no bearing on anything. LOL  Just an observation.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'That is a pretty cool pencil.  I like the angle at which you took the pencil, but the angle of the rest of the photo kind of bothers me.  It looks like the kid is going to fall right out of the left side of their seat.  The lighting is good, and the photo has a lot of nice color in it.  You did a really great job of keeping distracting glare and reflection off the matallic colored pencil.  Looks like maybe the kid isn''t a natural lefty, but rather just in the left hand to get a good angle on the pencil.  That has no bearing on anything. LOL  Just an observation.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-22 10:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
