(106759, 4599, 2172, '<td valign="top">Excellent work!  Are you the photographer and the sketch artist?  This is really great - can barely tell that the shadow is drawn.  Great work.  9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Excellent work!  Are you the photographer and the sketch artist?  This is really great - can barely tell that the shadow is drawn.  Great work.  9Ruthann', '2002-08-19 11:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106760, 4599, 3080, '<td valign="top">With the photos containing drawings, I can only wonder if the pencil actually did the drawing, or if the drawing was taken from something.  Then I thought, who cares.  The point has been made, the idea is really neat and if properly excecuted, overall great effect.  The only things holding me back from giving this the highest rating is (and I know this is REALLY picky) but seeing the edge of the paper.  I don''t think we have to see the edge of the paper to know it''s a drawing.  Also, I think it would have a higher visual impact if you could have gotten the shadow of the drawing in the same direction as the hand.  Great shot and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'With the photos containing drawings, I can only wonder if the pencil actually did the drawing, or if the drawing was taken from something.  Then I thought, who cares.  The point has been made, the idea is really neat and if properly excecuted, overall great effect.  The only things holding me back from giving this the highest rating is (and I know this is REALLY picky) but seeing the edge of the paper.  I don''t think we have to see the edge of the paper to know it''s a drawing.  Also, I think it would have a higher visual impact if you could have gotten the shadow of the drawing in the same direction as the hand.  Great shot and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-19 11:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106761, 4599, 2722, '<td valign="top">Very nice sketch work. I am a real beginner, why did you crop the pencil off? Other than that it''s a real crisp shot. - 8</td>', 'Very nice sketch work. I am a real beginner, why did you crop the pencil off? Other than that it''s a real crisp shot. - 8', '2002-08-19 13:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
