(106766, 4599, 772, '<td valign="top">This is phenomenal.  i really love the concept here and I think several people, like yourself, had similar ideas.  Kudos to you and everyone who did, because I''m enjoying these immensely.  Only minor ''goof'' for me in this photo is the paper edge under your hand.  it''s not really a ''distraction'' but I think the image would be improved without it.  This is print-worthy material :)  Great shot...  = 10 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is phenomenal.  i really love the concept here and I think several people, like yourself, had similar ideas.  Kudos to you and everyone who did, because I''m enjoying these immensely.  Only minor ''goof'' for me in this photo is the paper edge under your hand.  it''s not really a ''distraction'' but I think the image would be improved without it.  This is print-worthy material :)  Great shot...  = 10 - jmsetzler', '2002-08-19 17:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
