(106823, 4601, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very sharp, very crisp, and very clear.  I like the angle of this and the lighting is perfect. There are no bright spots and only a slight mellow shadow from the pencil.  Your idea for this is really neat.  Simple, but really neat. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very sharp, very crisp, and very clear.  I like the angle of this and the lighting is perfect. There are no bright spots and only a slight mellow shadow from the pencil.  Your idea for this is really neat.  Simple, but really neat. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-21 11:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
