(106825, 4601, 772, '<td valign="top">This is neat :)  You know what would have been really neat? I would (just for fun) have scanned this maze and then done an obvious photoshop edit to the ''end of the road'' part and given it some sort of creative title to go along with it :)  good shot... = 8 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is neat :)  You know what would have been really neat? I would (just for fun) have scanned this maze and then done an obvious photoshop edit to the ''end of the road'' part and given it some sort of creative title to go along with it :)  good shot... = 8 - jmsetzler', '2002-08-21 17:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106826, 4601, 1877, '<td valign="top">10, love it.. can''t wait to add it to faves. good job :)</td>', '10, love it.. can''t wait to add it to faves. good job :)', '2002-08-21 17:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106827, 4601, 3087, '<td valign="top">Strong, graphical image, wonderful OTT contrast, can really see the texture of the pencil line. Because the verticals and horizontals aren''t entirely, it makes me feel a bit sort of twisty in my brain. Er. Do feel free to ask me to elaborate on that. Hmmm it''s just gone midnight and it''s a weekday, perhaps I should go to bed before I become a pumpkin and review my comment tomorrow? (I did vote when fully awake).<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Strong, graphical image, wonderful OTT contrast, can really see the texture of the pencil line. Because the verticals and horizontals aren''t entirely, it makes me feel a bit sort of twisty in my brain. Er. Do feel free to ask me to elaborate on that. Hmmm it''s just gone midnight and it''s a weekday, perhaps I should go to bed before I become a pumpkin and review my comment tomorrow? (I did vote when fully awake).6, Kavey', '2002-08-21 20:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
