(106833, 4601, 3559, '<td valign="top">Hey Roshan,<br/>i liked ur end of road....i dont really know much bout digital photograpy.....my friends gave me this webstie and i was just surfin....and came around ur picz.....itz a bomb.....i like the name of the picz.....u have got a gr8 telant....wat else can i say....keep it up and best of luck for future.....dotn have any word for ur work....all i can say is itz awsome...<br/>Cutegujugurl</td>', 'Hey Roshan,i liked ur end of road....i dont really know much bout digital photograpy.....my friends gave me this webstie and i was just surfin....and came around ur picz.....itz a bomb.....i like the name of the picz.....u have got a gr8 telant....wat else can i say....keep it up and best of luck for future.....dotn have any word for ur work....all i can say is itz awsome...Cutegujugurl', '2002-08-27 00:05:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(106834, 4606, 3002, '<td valign="top">This has absolutely nothing to do with pencils, period.  Hello?</td>', 'This has absolutely nothing to do with pencils, period.  Hello?', '2002-08-19 03:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
