(106837, 4606, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice job, he even posed for you.  How long of a lens did you use? Very clear focus, it looks like you were only a couple of inches away.</td>', 'Nice job, he even posed for you.  How long of a lens did you use? Very clear focus, it looks like you were only a couple of inches away.', '2002-08-19 12:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
