(106849, 4606, 3087, '<td valign="top">Impressive to get the bird actually on the pencil, which does bring it more into the shot, although I still find myself thinking, "so it''s a pencil instead of a regular stick, so what?".  But it''s a great photo of the bird, with seed in mouth, and I love the glint in the eye. Would lose the little bits of other pencils at left and right.<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'Impressive to get the bird actually on the pencil, which does bring it more into the shot, although I still find myself thinking, "so it''s a pencil instead of a regular stick, so what?".  But it''s a great photo of the bird, with seed in mouth, and I love the glint in the eye. Would lose the little bits of other pencils at left and right.5, Kavey', '2002-08-20 14:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
