(106863, 4606, 2199, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture -- did you have to wait long? I love the detail in this image, especially in the feet, and feathers. Depth of field is very good too -- great job! 10 LanSnake</td>', 'Excellent capture -- did you have to wait long? I love the detail in this image, especially in the feet, and feathers. Depth of field is very good too -- great job! 10 LanSnake', '2002-08-23 14:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
