(106865, 4606, 1748, '<td valign="top">great bird shot but</td>', 'great bird shot but', '2002-08-25 21:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106866, 4606, 748, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments.  Yes, the bird was definitely real, and I erected the perch on Tuesday and finally got this shot on Friday.  I had a couple of other shots with finches on the pencil, but the titmouse is a less frequent visitor!  I only had this and two other shots in total to pick from, so was a tough but rewarding challenge for me.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments.  Yes, the bird was definitely real, and I erected the perch on Tuesday and finally got this shot on Friday.  I had a couple of other shots with finches on the pencil, but the titmouse is a less frequent visitor!  I only had this and two other shots in total to pick from, so was a tough but rewarding challenge for me.', '2002-08-27 07:17:00.000000', NULL, 0),
