(106876, 4607, 3080, '<td valign="top">Don''t take this the wrong way, but it doesn''t look like too much effort was put into this.  The background isnt'' very pleasing.  Kind of looks like you took it sitting at your computer.  Just ignore me if I''m wrong.  A nicer background would have made all the difference.  However, the placement of the subject in the photo is very nice.  Lighting makes the hair shine and there is definately a pencil.  The color of the hair is very nice and the pencil looks very nice in relation to color with the hair.  I would love to see this again with another background.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Don''t take this the wrong way, but it doesn''t look like too much effort was put into this.  The background isnt'' very pleasing.  Kind of looks like you took it sitting at your computer.  Just ignore me if I''m wrong.  A nicer background would have made all the difference.  However, the placement of the subject in the photo is very nice.  Lighting makes the hair shine and there is definately a pencil.  The color of the hair is very nice and the pencil looks very nice in relation to color with the hair.  I would love to see this again with another background.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-23 17:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106877, 4608, 2932, '<td valign="top">i totally hear ya on that title!</td>', 'i totally hear ya on that title!', '2002-08-19 01:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106878, 4608, 2000, '<td valign="top">The obligatory cat photo.  Cute, though it''s really the expression on the cat''s face that does it.</td>', 'The obligatory cat photo.  Cute, though it''s really the expression on the cat''s face that does it.', '2002-08-19 11:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106879, 4608, 1041, '<td valign="top">you have a very adorable cat there, and photogenic, too.  i''m not too thrilled by the background (too many different fabrics, patterns) or the fact that you cut off the cat''s butt.  could you have taken a portrait format shot?  also, and this is just my own opinion, you have met the challenge, but i''m not very excited by the lack of interaction between the cat and the pen.  sorry. -- gr8photos (3)</td>', 'you have a very adorable cat there, and photogenic, too.  i''m not too thrilled by the background (too many different fabrics, patterns) or the fact that you cut off the cat''s butt.  could you have taken a portrait format shot?  also, and this is just my own opinion, you have met the challenge, but i''m not very excited by the lack of interaction between the cat and the pen.  sorry. -- gr8photos (3)', '2002-08-19 13:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106880, 4608, 117, '<td valign="top">once again the cat or the pencil in focus</td>', 'once again the cat or the pencil in focus', '2002-08-19 15:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106881, 4608, 3087, '<td valign="top">Is this the same cat as in the entry called "I love pencils"?<br/>I should say straight off that I am not keen on pet photos generally, though not close minded about them. The background seems dark and a little too busy (especially the cloth at the top left). I think the eyes have come out very well and it''s great that he/ she is looking right at you. May work better cropped to portrait orientation?<br/>Kavey</td>', 'Is this the same cat as in the entry called "I love pencils"?I should say straight off that I am not keen on pet photos generally, though not close minded about them. The background seems dark and a little too busy (especially the cloth at the top left). I think the eyes have come out very well and it''s great that he/ she is looking right at you. May work better cropped to portrait orientation?Kavey', '2002-08-20 07:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106882, 4608, 2798, '<td valign="top">Great expression. :)</td>', 'Great expression. :)', '2002-08-20 08:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106883, 4608, 2466, '<td valign="top">good cat photo.</td>', 'good cat photo.', '2002-08-20 09:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106884, 4608, 835, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred more interaction between the cat and the pencil.  Great focus on the cat but the pencil is lacking.  I like how both the black and white parts of the cat has detail.</td>', 'I would have preferred more interaction between the cat and the pencil.  Great focus on the cat but the pencil is lacking.  I like how both the black and white parts of the cat has detail.', '2002-08-20 10:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
