(106887, 4608, 2667, '<td valign="top">nice cat. they can be so uncooperative at times... great shot technically, but it does little to move me. sorry.  (4)   ~mcmurma</td>', 'nice cat. they can be so uncooperative at times... great shot technically, but it does little to move me. sorry.  (4)   ~mcmurma', '2002-08-21 14:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106888, 4608, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Funny title.  I like cats and cat pictures!  (I hope this off sets any anti-cat sentiments you might have received  -  see rant)  She/He has an interesting left eye with the brown spot.  The rug/blanket give this a snapshot look, I don''t mind, but if you''re going for a high score, you might want to think about this.  <br/>8 Swash</td>', 'Great shot!  Funny title.  I like cats and cat pictures!  (I hope this off sets any anti-cat sentiments you might have received  -  see rant)  She/He has an interesting left eye with the brown spot.  The rug/blanket give this a snapshot look, I don''t mind, but if you''re going for a high score, you might want to think about this.  8 Swash', '2002-08-21 20:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106889, 4608, 1280, '<td valign="top">From my perspective:<br/>Meets challenge:Yes<br/>Technical:Good, could be just a tad lighter but really is fine.<br/>Appeal/Artistic:good<br/>Composition:good, except I''d get rid of the clothes on the right.  They only add clutter. The lines in the afgan are fine though.  They point right to the cat. The back of the cat is cut off though... :-(  would like to see the cat''s tail included.<br/>Originality:ok<br/>Comments:I love the sweetness in the face of this lovely feline. The picture is very nice.Good luck in the challenge.<br/></td>', 'From my perspective:Meets challenge:YesTechnical:Good, could be just a tad lighter but really is fine.Appeal/Artistic:goodComposition:good, except I''d get rid of the clothes on the right.  They only add clutter. The lines in the afgan are fine though.  They point right to the cat. The back of the cat is cut off though... :-(  would like to see the cat''s tail included.Originality:okComments:I love the sweetness in the face of this lovely feline. The picture is very nice.Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-21 21:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106890, 4608, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing5,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,<br/>Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing5,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool', '2002-08-22 10:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106891, 4608, 1792, '<td valign="top">How did you get the cat to participate in this so well?  The arrangement of cat, pencil, pad, afghan are all nicely planned in the "still-life" mode.  It might have been nice if the color of whatever is under the afghan were just a bit more vivid.  Also the pencil being a little out of focus bothers me a little-but not much.  I do like cats, by the way, but they don''t always lend themselves to the topics of the challenge (or if they do, they don''t cooperate and the thing ends up looking really contrived).  There are cute cat pictures and there are good cat pictures.  This one is good and how nice that it works so well into the theme.  Good job and compliments to the cat.</td>', 'How did you get the cat to participate in this so well?  The arrangement of cat, pencil, pad, afghan are all nicely planned in the "still-life" mode.  It might have been nice if the color of whatever is under the afghan were just a bit more vivid.  Also the pencil being a little out of focus bothers me a little-but not much.  I do like cats, by the way, but they don''t always lend themselves to the topics of the challenge (or if they do, they don''t cooperate and the thing ends up looking really contrived).  There are cute cat pictures and there are good cat pictures.  This one is good and how nice that it works so well into the theme.  Good job and compliments to the cat.', '2002-08-25 03:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106892, 4608, 2204, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tabby.  Has a very interesting eye.</td>', 'Beautiful tabby.  Has a very interesting eye.', '2002-08-25 09:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106893, 4608, 3080, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This is such a cute, calm looking kitty.  I never would have thought that it would be able to rip apart a pencil with those sharp teeth, if I hadn''t seen it myself.  2 totally different sides to the same kitty.  I would have lliked to have seen the entire cat in the photo.  either move the photo up a tad, or back it up a tad.  Great focus, lighting and angle.  good job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wow.  This is such a cute, calm looking kitty.  I never would have thought that it would be able to rip apart a pencil with those sharp teeth, if I hadn''t seen it myself.  2 totally different sides to the same kitty.  I would have lliked to have seen the entire cat in the photo.  either move the photo up a tad, or back it up a tad.  Great focus, lighting and angle.  good job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-26 00:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106894, 4609, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like your composition and "setup", but personally,  would have like for all of the pencils to have been in focus. Nice shot though ! lhall</td>', 'I like your composition and "setup", but personally,  would have like for all of the pencils to have been in focus. Nice shot though ! lhall', '2002-08-19 11:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106895, 4609, 573, '<td valign="top">The yellow realy stands out, but to get it I feel you sacrificed the red of the erasure.</td>', 'The yellow realy stands out, but to get it I feel you sacrificed the red of the erasure.', '2002-08-19 15:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
