(106919, 4611, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo.  The idea is great.  Lighting is perfect, the pencil doesn''t even have a shadow.  There are a few pencils standing by themselves in the challenge.  I can''t really figure out how it was done, but think it has something to do with taking a really quick photo before the pencil falls after letting go of it.  Angle is great and placement is great.  Congrats and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo.  The idea is great.  Lighting is perfect, the pencil doesn''t even have a shadow.  There are a few pencils standing by themselves in the challenge.  I can''t really figure out how it was done, but think it has something to do with taking a really quick photo before the pencil falls after letting go of it.  Angle is great and placement is great.  Congrats and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-19 11:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
