(106986, 4612, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like this, though actually like the abstract you''d get if you cropped in on the pencil and the glass, although it wouldnt show that it was a table out in the garden, I just love the texture of the glass with the green in it. I don''t like the fat vertical of the chair.<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'I like this, though actually like the abstract you''d get if you cropped in on the pencil and the glass, although it wouldnt show that it was a table out in the garden, I just love the texture of the glass with the green in it. I don''t like the fat vertical of the chair.5, Kavey', '2002-08-20 14:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106987, 4612, 2172, '<td valign="top">GREAT Job with this - brings out sadness.  I like how the sun light is just barely highlighting the tip of the pencil.  Really nice.  9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'GREAT Job with this - brings out sadness.  I like how the sun light is just barely highlighting the tip of the pencil.  Really nice.  9Ruthann', '2002-08-20 15:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
