(106989, 4612, 772, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure how to go about commenting on this photo.  I like the mood.. It reminds me of one of those afternoon thunderstorms and how the sun comes out afterwards...  - jmsetzler</td>', 'I''m not really sure how to go about commenting on this photo.  I like the mood.. It reminds me of one of those afternoon thunderstorms and how the sun comes out afterwards...  - jmsetzler', '2002-08-20 17:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106990, 4612, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice angle.  I like how you have done this with the chair in front.  Sometimes this doesn''t work, but it works nicely in this case.  Now, I know the table is textured, but I think it also has water on it too.  I would have stopped at the fact that the table was textured, if not for the 2 little water droplets on the chair.  I was trying to figure out why the pencil was a bit distorted looking and I came to the conclusion that it is either because of the texture, or added water, or both.  The grass looks really neat through the glass on the table.  The lighting is great for portraying that "forgotten" look.  It''s dim light, but definately not too dim.  Great shot and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice angle.  I like how you have done this with the chair in front.  Sometimes this doesn''t work, but it works nicely in this case.  Now, I know the table is textured, but I think it also has water on it too.  I would have stopped at the fact that the table was textured, if not for the 2 little water droplets on the chair.  I was trying to figure out why the pencil was a bit distorted looking and I came to the conclusion that it is either because of the texture, or added water, or both.  The grass looks really neat through the glass on the table.  The lighting is great for portraying that "forgotten" look.  It''s dim light, but definately not too dim.  Great shot and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-21 01:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(106991, 4612, 2667, '<td valign="top">the color is great, looks like it was shot at dawn. and the tabletop looks wet, though it may well just be the texture in the glass. The chair in the foreground on the right distracts me though, and I wish the pencil had a more starring role in the shot.  (5)   ~mcmurma</td>', 'the color is great, looks like it was shot at dawn. and the tabletop looks wet, though it may well just be the texture in the glass. The chair in the foreground on the right distracts me though, and I wish the pencil had a more starring role in the shot.  (5)   ~mcmurma', '2002-08-21 14:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
