(107035, 4615, 82, '<td valign="top">Your color composition is dynamite!  Love the deep blue with a tiny nub of pink, and the orange pencils are nicely arranged.</td>', 'Your color composition is dynamite!  Love the deep blue with a tiny nub of pink, and the orange pencils are nicely arranged.', '2002-08-22 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
