(107037, 4615, 616, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, it looks as if the pencils are floating. The detail is crisp and the DOF is great.</td>', 'Nicely done, it looks as if the pencils are floating. The detail is crisp and the DOF is great.', '2002-08-22 21:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107038, 4615, 2553, '<td valign="top">Love the bright yellow against the blue, also like the composition and lighting.  I like that there is only one eraser, and text on the pencil, prominent in the shot.  Very nice. lhall</td>', 'Love the bright yellow against the blue, also like the composition and lighting.  I like that there is only one eraser, and text on the pencil, prominent in the shot.  Very nice. lhall', '2002-08-23 07:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107039, 4615, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours and lighting. Vibrant. I love that it''s abstract but this particular composition doens''t work 100% for me. Do you have outtakes of same thing with different layouts of the pencils? I''d love to see if so.<br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'Beautiful colours and lighting. Vibrant. I love that it''s abstract but this particular composition doens''t work 100% for me. Do you have outtakes of same thing with different layouts of the pencils? I''d love to see if so.7, Kavey', '2002-08-23 08:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107040, 4615, 436, '<td valign="top">i am really drawn to this photo.  the background color works so well.  the lighting is so nice.  it''s quite appealing 9<br/></td>', 'i am really drawn to this photo.  the background color works so well.  the lighting is so nice.  it''s quite appealing 9', '2002-08-23 15:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
