(107054, 4616, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, but the idea, although it certainly fits the challenge, is perhaps a little weak.  I can''t comment on the shot itself, that''s technically fine as far as I can judge, so overall, it''s a good shot.</td>', 'This is a great shot, but the idea, although it certainly fits the challenge, is perhaps a little weak.  I can''t comment on the shot itself, that''s technically fine as far as I can judge, so overall, it''s a good shot.', '2002-08-22 13:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
