(107057, 4616, 3080, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  Very creative and original.  This would be a perfect photo if we ever had a "objects out of place" challenge. LOL.  I like all the red and white in the photo.  Makes it seem planned that way.  The angle and frame filling is good and I like how the front is in sharp focus and the back is soft focus.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Cute idea.  Very creative and original.  This would be a perfect photo if we ever had a "objects out of place" challenge. LOL.  I like all the red and white in the photo.  Makes it seem planned that way.  The angle and frame filling is good and I like how the front is in sharp focus and the back is soft focus.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-25 23:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107058, 4617, 1280, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge Theme:yes<br/>Technical :fine<br/>Composition:fair<br/>Creativity:fair<br/>Visual Appeal to me:fair<br/>Remarks:good use of color<br/>Grayce...aka...Gracious</td>', 'Meets Challenge Theme:yesTechnical :fineComposition:fairCreativity:fairVisual Appeal to me:fairRemarks:good use of colorGrayce...aka...Gracious', '2002-08-19 20:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
