(107060, 4617, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept :) The shadows possible could have been removed by shooting from the opposite direction... - jmsetzler</td>', 'Interesting concept :) The shadows possible could have been removed by shooting from the opposite direction... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-20 07:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107061, 4617, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea but composition doens''t work for me, too busy. Maybe a much tighter crop?<br/>Kavey</td>', 'Interesting idea but composition doens''t work for me, too busy. Maybe a much tighter crop?Kavey', '2002-08-20 11:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107062, 4617, 2337, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of "framing" and think it would be a good topic for a future challenge... However, I think your execution had a few problems... If there was anyway to not have your hand holding the frame, it would have helped... Also the shadow on the ground hurt a bit too... A closer crop where we don''t see much ''outside'' the frame may have worked better...</td>', 'I like the concept of "framing" and think it would be a good topic for a future challenge... However, I think your execution had a few problems... If there was anyway to not have your hand holding the frame, it would have helped... Also the shadow on the ground hurt a bit too... A closer crop where we don''t see much ''outside'' the frame may have worked better...', '2002-08-20 16:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107063, 4617, 2000, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t tell at first if that was a pencil or pen being held by the drawer, but upon closer examination I can see it probably is.  The lighting doesn''t make much stand out here, but it''s a good concept with that frame.</td>', 'I couldn''t tell at first if that was a pencil or pen being held by the drawer, but upon closer examination I can see it probably is.  The lighting doesn''t make much stand out here, but it''s a good concept with that frame.', '2002-08-20 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
