(107066, 4617, 3080, '<td valign="top">really cool use of a pencil frame.  I like it.  the photo is creative and original.  The lighting and angle are good, however it also kind of looks like the chest of this person is also kind of in a "frame"  makes it stand out pretty well.  the focus is great.  I even like the soft focus on the hand in the front.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'really cool use of a pencil frame.  I like it.  the photo is creative and original.  The lighting and angle are good, however it also kind of looks like the chest of this person is also kind of in a "frame"  makes it stand out pretty well.  the focus is great.  I even like the soft focus on the hand in the front.  good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-26 00:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
