(107088, 4618, 3080, '<td valign="top">For having a metallic pencil, and a whole lot of metal in this photo, you did an amazing job job of keeping reflection and glare off all the metal.  Beautiful lighting and lighting control.  The angle is great for the purpose of having the pencil as the main subject.  Personally, if there wasn''t a "pencil" challenge to be met here, I would back the camera up, give it a wider angle and replace the pencil with a bottle of flavored lotion.  Strawberry.  And throw in a couple pair of edible undi... oh, now I''ve gone too far. LOL  Great photo and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'For having a metallic pencil, and a whole lot of metal in this photo, you did an amazing job job of keeping reflection and glare off all the metal.  Beautiful lighting and lighting control.  The angle is great for the purpose of having the pencil as the main subject.  Personally, if there wasn''t a "pencil" challenge to be met here, I would back the camera up, give it a wider angle and replace the pencil with a bottle of flavored lotion.  Strawberry.  And throw in a couple pair of edible undi... oh, now I''ve gone too far. LOL  Great photo and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-25 22:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107089, 4620, 2437, '<td valign="top">pencil is over exposed</td>', 'pencil is over exposed', '2002-08-19 03:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107090, 4620, 1827, '<td valign="top">This was a clever way to get a really nice shot and still meet the challenge.  Unfortunately, there''s that wing blocking the bird''s face.  There''s a graininess that maybe shooting at a higher resolution and then resizing could fix.  Why the yellow pencil?  The bird''s perch seems sufficient to meet the challenge.  4</td>', 'This was a clever way to get a really nice shot and still meet the challenge.  Unfortunately, there''s that wing blocking the bird''s face.  There''s a graininess that maybe shooting at a higher resolution and then resizing could fix.  Why the yellow pencil?  The bird''s perch seems sufficient to meet the challenge.  4', '2002-08-19 03:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107091, 4620, 2596, '<td valign="top">I you get a good score on this one so think the bird for it    the pencils are not doing out anything there.I can´t give you wery high score because I think you are using the bird to much for this shot. On the other hand it is a wery good picture of the bird end nice to see his wings. Good luck thou -rocco22-</td>', 'I you get a good score on this one so think the bird for it    the pencils are not doing out anything there.I can´t give you wery high score because I think you are using the bird to much for this shot. On the other hand it is a wery good picture of the bird end nice to see his wings. Good luck thou -rocco22-', '2002-08-19 06:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
