(107099, 4620, 3087, '<td valign="top">Feels like the pencils have been stuck there purely to allow a photo of bird to be entered. Fair enough, just seem really out of place in it. I know those little fellas move way too fast but it''s just too blurry for me. I do like the way the green background forms it''s own wonderful shape between the shadows.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'Feels like the pencils have been stuck there purely to allow a photo of bird to be entered. Fair enough, just seem really out of place in it. I know those little fellas move way too fast but it''s just too blurry for me. I do like the way the green background forms it''s own wonderful shape between the shadows.Kavey', '2002-08-20 08:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
