(107104, 4620, 2928, '<td valign="top">Very cleverly done... A great effort on a hard to get shot.  Focus is slightly off, but apart from that small gripe it''s a good picture.</td>', 'Very cleverly done... A great effort on a hard to get shot.  Focus is slightly off, but apart from that small gripe it''s a good picture.', '2002-08-21 17:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107105, 4620, 3080, '<td valign="top">wow, I don''t think I''ve ever seen a humming bird up close like that.  Kind of looks like an earless bat.  Great use of pencils.  The angle, lighting and focus are great.  There''s a bit of a glare on the yellow pencil, but I''ve found that you can''t get too picky when dealing with animal photos.  especially fast moving animals.  Great shot.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'wow, I don''t think I''ve ever seen a humming bird up close like that.  Kind of looks like an earless bat.  Great use of pencils.  The angle, lighting and focus are great.  There''s a bit of a glare on the yellow pencil, but I''ve found that you can''t get too picky when dealing with animal photos.  especially fast moving animals.  Great shot.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-22 15:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
