(107132, 4621, 2170, '<td valign="top">If the tip of the white pencil could be pushed EVER SO SLIGHTLY against the red pencil, this would have been perfect.  As it is, it''s an excellent photo and a great idea.  The shadows are somewhat harsh, but I still enjoy it.</td>', 'If the tip of the white pencil could be pushed EVER SO SLIGHTLY against the red pencil, this would have been perfect.  As it is, it''s an excellent photo and a great idea.  The shadows are somewhat harsh, but I still enjoy it.', '2002-08-19 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107133, 4621, 2997, '<td valign="top">High Contract; rich color; simplicity!  I am going to keep this as an example to myself.  I keep telling myself "KISS" (keep it simple stupid).  I give this picture (and your presentation skills) a perfect "10."</td>', 'High Contract; rich color; simplicity!  I am going to keep this as an example to myself.  I keep telling myself "KISS" (keep it simple stupid).  I give this picture (and your presentation skills) a perfect "10."', '2002-08-19 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
