(107164, 4621, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,<br/>Total Averaged Rating8.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,Total Averaged Rating8.   Autool', '2002-08-22 20:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107165, 4621, 2235, '<td valign="top">Very artistic. Well done and concept is excellent. Like the play on colors against each other.</td>', 'Very artistic. Well done and concept is excellent. Like the play on colors against each other.', '2002-08-22 21:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107166, 4621, 259, '<td valign="top">finally a photo that doesn''t make me want to stick a pencil in my eye after seeing it.  my favorite so far.</td>', 'finally a photo that doesn''t make me want to stick a pencil in my eye after seeing it.  my favorite so far.', '2002-08-23 03:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107167, 4621, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is just beautiful. Such striking colours and composition. <br/>If _looking_ for a criticism I''d say only this - the white pencil bleeds seamlessly into the white background - the red pencil doesn''t bleed into the red background because of the shadows. But then, it wouldn''t work without any shadows, as they give the pencils form and dimension, and the shadows would look bloody weird if they were on opposite sides for each pencil. So I don''t know that it would be something you would want to change anyway.<br/>This is in my top three photos this week, very very striking.<br/>9, Kavey</td>', 'This is just beautiful. Such striking colours and composition. If _looking_ for a criticism I''d say only this - the white pencil bleeds seamlessly into the white background - the red pencil doesn''t bleed into the red background because of the shadows. But then, it wouldn''t work without any shadows, as they give the pencils form and dimension, and the shadows would look bloody weird if they were on opposite sides for each pencil. So I don''t know that it would be something you would want to change anyway.This is in my top three photos this week, very very striking.9, Kavey', '2002-08-23 10:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107168, 4621, 3111, '<td valign="top">I enjoy how the white pencil bleeds into the white background.  I wish that could have happened with the red pencil and red background.  Sorry, I can''t help you with how to do this - I am new at this.</td>', 'I enjoy how the white pencil bleeds into the white background.  I wish that could have happened with the red pencil and red background.  Sorry, I can''t help you with how to do this - I am new at this.', '2002-08-23 18:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107169, 4621, 835, '<td valign="top">very artistic.  I really like it.</td>', 'very artistic.  I really like it.', '2002-08-24 00:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107170, 4621, 1330, '<td valign="top">I don''t really care for the shadow on the right but an excellent picture otherwise.  8</td>', 'I don''t really care for the shadow on the right but an excellent picture otherwise.  8', '2002-08-24 09:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107171, 4621, 2815, '<td valign="top">I think this picture is fantastic!!!  I love the colors.  It feels  alittle sharp but I think it makes that picture look better.  I love the backgrounds they turned out so solid.  Great looking photot.   Norm (8)</td>', 'I think this picture is fantastic!!!  I love the colors.  It feels  alittle sharp but I think it makes that picture look better.  I love the backgrounds they turned out so solid.  Great looking photot.   Norm (8)', '2002-08-24 16:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
