(107173, 4621, 554, '<td valign="top">This is a GREAT photo---the ONLY thing I wish were different was the elimination of the shadows but I have no idea if that is possible. This is one of my favorites.</td>', 'This is a GREAT photo---the ONLY thing I wish were different was the elimination of the shadows but I have no idea if that is possible. This is one of my favorites.', '2002-08-24 20:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
