(107185, 4621, 2204, '<td valign="top">This is the ONE photo in this challenge that made me say WOW!!  I actually thought it would be first.   Congratulations.<br/>Syamjonimi</td>', 'This is the ONE photo in this challenge that made me say WOW!!  I actually thought it would be first.   Congratulations.Syamjonimi', '2002-08-27 21:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
