(107187, 4622, 2344, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept here! At a glance this stuff all looks like medical supplies! I was expecting at least one submission to go above and beyond the wood pencil and here it is! Well done!</td>', 'Interesting concept here! At a glance this stuff all looks like medical supplies! I was expecting at least one submission to go above and beyond the wood pencil and here it is! Well done!', '2002-08-19 10:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
