(107203, 4622, 2221, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea! I like the simple composition and the lighting. Focus is good, too. I wonder how it would look in b&amp;w because it does not have much colour and I think it would look better when completely desaturated.<br/>-stephan</td>', 'Very nice idea! I like the simple composition and the lighting. Focus is good, too. I wonder how it would look in b&w because it does not have much colour and I think it would look better when completely desaturated.-stephan', '2002-08-25 19:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107204, 4624, 1827, '<td valign="top">I want your right eye to also be hidden by the pencil.  Still, nicely framed; without the pencil it would make a nice portrait.  With the pencil it makes a nice challenge entry.  8</td>', 'I want your right eye to also be hidden by the pencil.  Still, nicely framed; without the pencil it would make a nice portrait.  With the pencil it makes a nice challenge entry.  8', '2002-08-19 04:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
