(107210, 4624, 2, '<td valign="top">This is a very stunning image, and the more I look at it, I''m convinced it''s because of your outstanding lighting.  You''ve really created a very effective, tonal image.  Great job.</td>', 'This is a very stunning image, and the more I look at it, I''m convinced it''s because of your outstanding lighting.  You''ve really created a very effective, tonal image.  Great job.', '2002-08-20 01:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
