(107297, 4633, 1005, '<td valign="top">I was surprised at the number of garden pencils we got this week.  I very much liked your idea of the weed.  Did you have any hidden meaning in the erasures?  Very funny.  (just because other''s thought of a similar idea, don''t put up with any cliche comments...good job!)  8 Swash</td>', 'I was surprised at the number of garden pencils we got this week.  I very much liked your idea of the weed.  Did you have any hidden meaning in the erasures?  Very funny.  (just because other''s thought of a similar idea, don''t put up with any cliche comments...good job!)  8 Swash', '2002-08-21 20:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
