(107300, 4633, 3080, '<td valign="top">The lighting and angle are great.  I like how you threw the weed in there.  Also, I think it''s cute that they are at different stages of "growing" with a couple of the pencils having half of an eraser and the rest having new erasers.  Also, it''s neat how you have all the words showing, but not all head on, some are being viewed at an angle.  Focus is really great.  Nice job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The lighting and angle are great.  I like how you threw the weed in there.  Also, I think it''s cute that they are at different stages of "growing" with a couple of the pencils having half of an eraser and the rest having new erasers.  Also, it''s neat how you have all the words showing, but not all head on, some are being viewed at an angle.  Focus is really great.  Nice job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-23 12:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
