(107314, 4634, 3080, '<td valign="top">Wow.  5 CM exactly from the tips of the wrench to the edge of the photo on both the top and bottom and 2 CM from each side at the farthest point on the sides!!!  (going by the large photo on the comment screen)  Very impressive.  Very very impressive actually.  Far too impressive to have been done by eye.  You spent some serious time measuring this.  I am wondering however, that if you spent such time on getting it that perfect, then why is the distance between the pencil and the wrench on the very bottom edge of the photo 6cm, and the distance between the pencil and the wrench on the top edge of the photo 7cm??  I am thinking there was some kind of angle discrepency with the wrenches themselves and nothing you could do about it.  You will have to forgive me for actually physically measuring your photo, but I just HAD to know.  It is so beautiful.  The lighting is great, setup is well...PERFECT and there is high humor appeal.  You spent some time with this.  It wasn''t just thrown together.  I really really hope people see this!!!  I want to see this in the top 3.  Seriously.  I''d give you 3 10''s if I could.  Good luck in the challenge.  ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Wow.  5 CM exactly from the tips of the wrench to the edge of the photo on both the top and bottom and 2 CM from each side at the farthest point on the sides!!!  (going by the large photo on the comment screen)  Very impressive.  Very very impressive actually.  Far too impressive to have been done by eye.  You spent some serious time measuring this.  I am wondering however, that if you spent such time on getting it that perfect, then why is the distance between the pencil and the wrench on the very bottom edge of the photo 6cm, and the distance between the pencil and the wrench on the top edge of the photo 7cm??  I am thinking there was some kind of angle discrepency with the wrenches themselves and nothing you could do about it.  You will have to forgive me for actually physically measuring your photo, but I just HAD to know.  It is so beautiful.  The lighting is great, setup is well...PERFECT and there is high humor appeal.  You spent some time with this.  It wasn''t just thrown together.  I really really hope people see this!!!  I want to see this in the top 3.  Seriously.  I''d give you 3 10''s if I could.  Good luck in the challenge.  ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-08-19 16:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
