(107368, 4635, 2000, '<td valign="top">Take an old type of shot (seen stuff like this in movies with darts) and make it new again with pencils.  I like the concept, the colors, and the shadows are good.</td>', 'Take an old type of shot (seen stuff like this in movies with darts) and make it new again with pencils.  I like the concept, the colors, and the shadows are good.', '2002-08-21 11:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107369, 4635, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately original.  Great colors.  I like how it''s not centered, but closer to the bottom right corner.  The angle is great and so is the lighting.  I like the use of blue pencils instead of yellow here.  Yellow would have blend in to much and the blue stands out nicely.  In a hypothetical situation, With the precision of the "arrow" though, I don''t think there would be so many stray shots in target.  However, that doesn''t mean that someone else wasn''t practicing there as well.  :) Good job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Definately original.  Great colors.  I like how it''s not centered, but closer to the bottom right corner.  The angle is great and so is the lighting.  I like the use of blue pencils instead of yellow here.  Yellow would have blend in to much and the blue stands out nicely.  In a hypothetical situation, With the precision of the "arrow" though, I don''t think there would be so many stray shots in target.  However, that doesn''t mean that someone else wasn''t practicing there as well.  :) Good job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-21 13:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107370, 4635, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the bright colors of this.  Took me jsut a minute, but i realize that you split a pencil in two.  Impressive.  karmat</td>', 'I like the bright colors of this.  Took me jsut a minute, but i realize that you split a pencil in two.  Impressive.  karmat', '2002-08-21 16:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107371, 4635, 2983, '<td valign="top">Creative and colorful</td>', 'Creative and colorful', '2002-08-21 16:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107372, 4635, 875, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, good lighting, and nice color.  You even managed to get the pencil to look fairly roughly split.</td>', 'Cute idea, good lighting, and nice color.  You even managed to get the pencil to look fairly roughly split.', '2002-08-21 17:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107373, 4635, 2235, '<td valign="top">Very original. Nice idea. Good color and sharp focus</td>', 'Very original. Nice idea. Good color and sharp focus', '2002-08-22 00:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107374, 4635, 2649, '<td valign="top">Great idea for pencil photo.  Meets challenge and is technically very good.</td>', 'Great idea for pencil photo.  Meets challenge and is technically very good.', '2002-08-22 18:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107375, 4635, 2352, '<td valign="top">Nice shot...Oh...A pun...fun!!!<br/>I like it!!</td>', 'Nice shot...Oh...A pun...fun!!!I like it!!', '2002-08-23 21:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107376, 4635, 3251, '<td valign="top">Good shot, Locksley.. The eraser is a bit out of focus and the holes in the target are rather distracting but the lighting is good.</td>', 'Good shot, Locksley.. The eraser is a bit out of focus and the holes in the target are rather distracting but the lighting is good.', '2002-08-24 01:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107377, 4635, 3500, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2002-08-24 17:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107378, 4635, 2807, '<td valign="top">Traditional or crossbow?</td>', 'Traditional or crossbow?', '2002-08-24 20:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107379, 4640, 2223, '<td valign="top">thats very cute.</td>', 'thats very cute.', '2002-08-19 01:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107380, 4640, 806, '<td valign="top">crop this closer to eliminate the table some more, and the writing and illustration will pop out too.</td>', 'crop this closer to eliminate the table some more, and the writing and illustration will pop out too.', '2002-08-19 18:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107381, 4640, 3111, '<td valign="top">You misspelled Rital--- what was I saying?  Anyway, good idea, buy I would have liked to see the two broken pieces not so arranged.</td>', 'You misspelled Rital--- what was I saying?  Anyway, good idea, buy I would have liked to see the two broken pieces not so arranged.', '2002-08-20 01:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107382, 4640, 3087, '<td valign="top">I personally am not overly keen on photos where the interest is mostly in the text written or printed on the paper/ sign/ wall.<br/>I like the customised pencil - it reminds me of the kind of things we did as kids to pencils and stuff at school. I find the veneer background a little heavy.<br/>The focus and lighting seem good.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'I personally am not overly keen on photos where the interest is mostly in the text written or printed on the paper/ sign/ wall.I like the customised pencil - it reminds me of the kind of things we did as kids to pencils and stuff at school. I find the veneer background a little heavy.The focus and lighting seem good.Kavey', '2002-08-20 07:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107383, 4640, 2000, '<td valign="top">The pencil''s presence in this picture is questionable at the moment.  I like the two erasers, but I''m rating on the use/necessesity of the pencil to make the point in the picture.  Also, the upper corner seems underexposed/dark.  Good idea overall, though.</td>', 'The pencil''s presence in this picture is questionable at the moment.  I like the two erasers, but I''m rating on the use/necessesity of the pencil to make the point in the picture.  Also, the upper corner seems underexposed/dark.  Good idea overall, though.', '2002-08-20 12:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107384, 4640, 1827, '<td valign="top">Too common a misconception.  Need to be stimulated, interested, and challenged.  But then, that would make too long a tiitle, huh?</td>', 'Too common a misconception.  Need to be stimulated, interested, and challenged.  But then, that would make too long a tiitle, huh?', '2002-08-20 14:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107385, 4640, 2123, '<td valign="top">Cute!  It''s "Ritalin" by the way.  See, you *should* pay attention in class.  ;-)  Please know that I''m teasing...lol</td>', 'Cute!  It''s "Ritalin" by the way.  See, you *should* pay attention in class.  ;-)  Please know that I''m teasing...lol', '2002-08-20 15:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107386, 4640, 2172, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this very much.  (Being honest - not to offend)  I think this could''ve been done a little more effectiveley (also just for the record, and not sure if it was intentional, but it''s Ritalin)  Being someone with ADD, I can respect the intent and can imagine something more for this - the shot is too set up...or organized, yes that''s the word...the word people with ADD do NOT know.  I think I would have added some more misc things in disarray - things that didn''t have anything to do with anything...or some tears in the paper...or put the pencil through one of the paper holes.  As for the photo, I would crop it more, I don''t think that so much of the desk space is necessary.  I may have also come at it from a different angle, a little lower perhaps.  Sorry to go on and on, just that this one hits home, so a creative idea.  I was just thinking...for someone with ADD, they see the wold go faster than most, would be cool if there was a slight blur in the image...but you know it would not go over well here  lol.  One more quick thing, the lighting does not do much for this - it''s not setting a mood - but not sure what to suggest.....but I just had another idea - peal some of the pencil, as if done with a finger nail...yes that would enhance the idea of needing ritalin - that would put more emphasis on the pencil and not relying so much on the what is on the paper.<br/><br/>Alright, sorry to go on and on.  If you give this another shot, I''d be interested in seeing it.  Still great effort.<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'I like the idea behind this very much.  (Being honest - not to offend)  I think this could''ve been done a little more effectiveley (also just for the record, and not sure if it was intentional, but it''s Ritalin)  Being someone with ADD, I can respect the intent and can imagine something more for this - the shot is too set up...or organized, yes that''s the word...the word people with ADD do NOT know.  I think I would have added some more misc things in disarray - things that didn''t have anything to do with anything...or some tears in the paper...or put the pencil through one of the paper holes.  As for the photo, I would crop it more, I don''t think that so much of the desk space is necessary.  I may have also come at it from a different angle, a little lower perhaps.  Sorry to go on and on, just that this one hits home, so a creative idea.  I was just thinking...for someone with ADD, they see the wold go faster than most, would be cool if there was a slight blur in the image...but you know it would not go over well here  lol.  One more quick thing, the lighting does not do much for this - it''s not setting a mood - but not sure what to suggest.....but I just had another idea - peal some of the pencil, as if done with a finger nail...yes that would enhance the idea of needing ritalin - that would put more emphasis on the pencil and not relying so much on the what is on the paper.Alright, sorry to go on and on.  If you give this another shot, I''d be interested in seeing it.  Still great effort.Ruthann', '2002-08-20 16:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107387, 4640, 2667, '<td valign="top">cute, and i like the dual eraser thing and the wood-grain on the table, but overall the image does little to "grab" me. sorry.   ~mcmurma<br/>Aesthetics....3<br/>Meets Challenge...5<br/>Overall....4</td>', 'cute, and i like the dual eraser thing and the wood-grain on the table, but overall the image does little to "grab" me. sorry.   ~mcmurmaAesthetics....3Meets Challenge...5Overall....4', '2002-08-21 13:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107388, 4640, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background4,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing5,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 2,<br/>Total Averaged Rating5.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background4,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing5,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 2,Total Averaged Rating5.   Autool', '2002-08-22 10:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107389, 4640, 472, '<td valign="top">would go more closeup on the paper, even cur off the edges to be able to see what''s on it</td>', 'would go more closeup on the paper, even cur off the edges to be able to see what''s on it', '2002-08-22 12:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107390, 4640, 441, '<td valign="top">good entry for childhood challenge!</td>', 'good entry for childhood challenge!', '2002-08-22 17:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107391, 4640, 811, '<td valign="top">normally i don''t like a wood grain background, but i think it works well here simply because it could be a desk or table top in a classroom.  love the pencil. karmat</td>', 'normally i don''t like a wood grain background, but i think it works well here simply because it could be a desk or table top in a classroom.  love the pencil. karmat', '2002-08-22 23:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107392, 4640, 1128, '<td valign="top">This is a clear photo with good color.  However, I am sensitive to the subject matter of this photo (particularly the title).   Maybe it''s because I am a teacher and I have seen children struggle with attention disorders.  I hope it was not a joke.  I have voted on it with the assumption that it was serious.</td>', 'This is a clear photo with good color.  However, I am sensitive to the subject matter of this photo (particularly the title).   Maybe it''s because I am a teacher and I have seen children struggle with attention disorders.  I hope it was not a joke.  I have voted on it with the assumption that it was serious.', '2002-08-25 23:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107393, 4640, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''ll start out first by saying I LOVE that wood grain.  very pretty.  the idea behind this photo is funny.  (for everyone that doesn''t have a kid on ridilin, that is).  I also like the use of a different looking pencil.  cute bunny.  lighting and frame placement is great, as is the angle. there is a dark spot in the upper left that is a bit odd, but I was thinking it may be in the wood, however, if it''s not, I''d like to see it without the dark spot.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''ll start out first by saying I LOVE that wood grain.  very pretty.  the idea behind this photo is funny.  (for everyone that doesn''t have a kid on ridilin, that is).  I also like the use of a different looking pencil.  cute bunny.  lighting and frame placement is great, as is the angle. there is a dark spot in the upper left that is a bit odd, but I was thinking it may be in the wood, however, if it''s not, I''d like to see it without the dark spot.  good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-26 00:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107394, 4641, 1827, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t help laughing.  Very funny.</td>', 'I couldn''t help laughing.  Very funny.', '2002-08-19 02:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107395, 4641, 842, '<td valign="top">it made me laugh.. thanks.</td>', 'it made me laugh.. thanks.', '2002-08-19 03:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107396, 4641, 1360, '<td valign="top">This is the strangest thing I have seen all day.  Espically criminal is the wasted crossiant.  6 -lennier</td>', 'This is the strangest thing I have seen all day.  Espically criminal is the wasted crossiant.  6 -lennier', '2002-08-19 03:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107397, 4641, 2596, '<td valign="top">Did your mother never said   "don´t play with your food" ?  I think you did a little bit to much of that in this shot. If you take just the top of the picture and use it like that(where all the pencils is standing out from the head) Just try to crop it from the top of the eyes and up and then look at it I think that would be better. <br/></td>', 'Did your mother never said   "don´t play with your food" ?  I think you did a little bit to much of that in this shot. If you take just the top of the picture and use it like that(where all the pencils is standing out from the head) Just try to crop it from the top of the eyes and up and then look at it I think that would be better. ', '2002-08-19 06:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107398, 4641, 2204, '<td valign="top">Clever &amp; inventive...Made me smile</td>', 'Clever & inventive...Made me smile', '2002-08-19 14:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107399, 4641, 2815, '<td valign="top">I keep thinking that I have seen the most orginal photo. Now that I am looking at your it is definetly the most creative I have seen yet!!!   (8)</td>', 'I keep thinking that I have seen the most orginal photo. Now that I am looking at your it is definetly the most creative I have seen yet!!!   (8)', '2002-08-19 18:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107400, 4641, 327, '<td valign="top">This is just sooooooooooooo clever, and fun. I love this. You should be ashamed to ruin a good melon!! :) Well done, congrats to you! Score 8 ~Kee</td>', 'This is just sooooooooooooo clever, and fun. I love this. You should be ashamed to ruin a good melon!! :) Well done, congrats to you! Score 8 ~Kee', '2002-08-19 19:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107401, 4641, 3378, '<td valign="top">Funny idea, well executed.</td>', 'Funny idea, well executed.', '2002-08-19 22:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107402, 4641, 2881, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is CUTE! How imaginative. I''m amazed at people''s different ideas. The photo  the subject are BOTH works of art.</td>', 'Oh, this is CUTE! How imaginative. I''m amazed at people''s different ideas. The photo  the subject are BOTH works of art.', '2002-08-20 09:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107403, 4641, 2466, '<td valign="top">very funny and nicely shot</td>', 'very funny and nicely shot', '2002-08-20 09:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107404, 4641, 2295, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo.  Focus is great.  Lighting is great.  8</td>', 'I really like this photo.  Focus is great.  Lighting is great.  8', '2002-08-20 10:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107405, 4641, 3087, '<td valign="top">He hee, that is ONE ugly melon head. "Hey man, you''re twisting my melon, man" (can you place that quote?) Good colours and rich background.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'He hee, that is ONE ugly melon head. "Hey man, you''re twisting my melon, man" (can you place that quote?) Good colours and rich background.Kavey', '2002-08-20 11:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107406, 4641, 2000, '<td valign="top">Good slight decenter.  Is her collar a croissant?  nice creative shot.</td>', 'Good slight decenter.  Is her collar a croissant?  nice creative shot.', '2002-08-20 12:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107407, 4641, 737, '<td valign="top">Composition - very good<br/>Technical Aspects - very good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  high/very good<br/>Other comments  Top 5<br/><br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Composition - very goodTechnical Aspects - very goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality  high/very goodOther comments  Top 5Jim msp', '2002-08-20 17:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107408, 4641, 1543, '<td valign="top">cute hairdo. ;-)</td>', 'cute hairdo. ;-)', '2002-08-20 19:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107409, 4641, 3162, '<td valign="top">Nice props. Good creation</td>', 'Nice props. Good creation', '2002-08-21 11:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107410, 4641, 1759, '<td valign="top">Just when I thought that I''d seen it all, up pops this one! Thanks for the laugh. There seems to be no end to the creativity on this challenge and this arrangement is very high on my creativity list. BTW, good job on the photo too; it has very good exposure, decent composition (though the cropping is a bit tight), and makes a really nice... ahem, portrait.</td>', 'Just when I thought that I''d seen it all, up pops this one! Thanks for the laugh. There seems to be no end to the creativity on this challenge and this arrangement is very high on my creativity list. BTW, good job on the photo too; it has very good exposure, decent composition (though the cropping is a bit tight), and makes a really nice... ahem, portrait.', '2002-08-21 22:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107411, 4641, 2667, '<td valign="top">this is so silly!  but i like it.  (6) ~mcmurma</td>', 'this is so silly!  but i like it.  (6) ~mcmurma', '2002-08-22 03:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107412, 4641, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing5,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,<br/>Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing5,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool', '2002-08-22 10:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107413, 4641, 259, '<td valign="top">frighting</td>', 'frighting', '2002-08-23 03:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107414, 4641, 3080, '<td valign="top">This has got to be one of the strangest things I''ve ever seen. LOL.  What is DPC doing to us?  The lighting is great. There is definately originality and creativity.  The only thing that I would have to comment on is the slight left tilt.  I understand that it was probably difficult to get it to stand up in the first place, so I won''t count it against you, just an observation.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This has got to be one of the strangest things I''ve ever seen. LOL.  What is DPC doing to us?  The lighting is great. There is definately originality and creativity.  The only thing that I would have to comment on is the slight left tilt.  I understand that it was probably difficult to get it to stand up in the first place, so I won''t count it against you, just an observation.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-23 19:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107415, 4641, 3251, '<td valign="top">That''s about the most original shot around. What did you use for the ears? Cheerios?</td>', 'That''s about the most original shot around. What did you use for the ears? Cheerios?', '2002-08-24 01:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107416, 4641, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a very creative use of pencils for this challenge :)  The lighting is also right on target here... I thought that I didn''t like the pencils being cropped at the top, but that seems quite irrelevant after I look at the image a little closer... good shot! - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a very creative use of pencils for this challenge :)  The lighting is also right on target here... I thought that I didn''t like the pencils being cropped at the top, but that seems quite irrelevant after I look at the image a little closer... good shot! - jmsetzler', '2002-08-24 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107417, 4643, 2295, '<td valign="top">Nice fangs on the cat.  Good picture.  Lighting is OK.  Focus is just a bit soft.  Subject is good.  6</td>', 'Nice fangs on the cat.  Good picture.  Lighting is OK.  Focus is just a bit soft.  Subject is good.  6', '2002-08-19 14:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107418, 4643, 3102, '<td valign="top">What an expression!</td>', 'What an expression!', '2002-08-19 19:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
