(107420, 4643, 2199, '<td valign="top">Those teeth are SCARY!  ;-)</td>', 'Those teeth are SCARY!  ;-)', '2002-08-19 22:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107421, 4643, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think I see teeth marks...has he been working on this one awhile?  This looks like an anti-pencil ad.  Your lighting is good and I like the angle.  Would like to see how it looked a little pulled back so you could see his other ear.  Overall pretty nice.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I think I see teeth marks...has he been working on this one awhile?  This looks like an anti-pencil ad.  Your lighting is good and I like the angle.  Would like to see how it looked a little pulled back so you could see his other ear.  Overall pretty nice.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-20 00:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107422, 4643, 2586, '<td valign="top">I get a little tired of the cat shots but this one has a very interesting angle and composition and far superior to the average cute cat picture. Great definition of the yellowing of the teeth, the whiskers and the fur. Nice toowith that corner of note pad. My only nitpick is that the background rug (?) is distracting. Will revisit this lateron this week. 7 for now. Journey</td>', 'I get a little tired of the cat shots but this one has a very interesting angle and composition and far superior to the average cute cat picture. Great definition of the yellowing of the teeth, the whiskers and the fur. Nice toowith that corner of note pad. My only nitpick is that the background rug (?) is distracting. Will revisit this lateron this week. 7 for now. Journey', '2002-08-20 01:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107423, 4643, 3087, '<td valign="top">The other elements in this photo are intruding too much for me, and the dark part of cat''s head is merging too much with the darker background at the top of the photo. The teeth gripping the pencil have come out well though. <br/>This one doesn''t appeal to me overly, but I do admit I am not big into pet photos, though I do like cats.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'The other elements in this photo are intruding too much for me, and the dark part of cat''s head is merging too much with the darker background at the top of the photo. The teeth gripping the pencil have come out well though. This one doesn''t appeal to me overly, but I do admit I am not big into pet photos, though I do like cats.Kavey', '2002-08-20 07:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107424, 4643, 2937, '<td valign="top">I hate my cat for doing this to me all the time ;-) My regrets to you</td>', 'I hate my cat for doing this to me all the time ;-) My regrets to you', '2002-08-20 09:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107425, 4643, 835, '<td valign="top">this cat, flooring, pencil, and notepad looks very familiar.  I do have to rate this one higher though because the cat is interacting with the pencil.</td>', 'this cat, flooring, pencil, and notepad looks very familiar.  I do have to rate this one higher though because the cat is interacting with the pencil.', '2002-08-20 10:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107426, 4643, 1041, '<td valign="top">your cat has quite some teeth.  i like that you have some interaction going on between the cat and the pencil, the placement of the writing pad in the corner is also a nice touch.  the ears of your cat melt into the background a little too much, and i see the wooden floor peeking through on the left.  i think i would have preferred to see all wood, but then, i really like wooden floors. -- gr8phtoos (4)</td>', 'your cat has quite some teeth.  i like that you have some interaction going on between the cat and the pencil, the placement of the writing pad in the corner is also a nice touch.  the ears of your cat melt into the background a little too much, and i see the wooden floor peeking through on the left.  i think i would have preferred to see all wood, but then, i really like wooden floors. -- gr8phtoos (4)', '2002-08-20 12:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
