(107451, 4647, 3080, '<td valign="top">Please don''t feed the animals...pencils?  LOL  I''m not usually a huge fan of motion blurs, but I think it works well here indicating that he''s going for the pencil, and it''s not an over exagerated blur.  He''s a cute little thing.  The only animal you can touch at our zoo is a goat, so I''m impressed that you got so close to him.  The lighting was very nice for this photo.  Good job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Please don''t feed the animals...pencils?  LOL  I''m not usually a huge fan of motion blurs, but I think it works well here indicating that he''s going for the pencil, and it''s not an over exagerated blur.  He''s a cute little thing.  The only animal you can touch at our zoo is a goat, so I''m impressed that you got so close to him.  The lighting was very nice for this photo.  Good job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-22 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
