(107473, 4651, 1041, '<td valign="top">ok, i have to admit, i had to smile when i first looked at this.  the idea is great, however, the implementation doesn''t totally overwhelm me.  i think the blanket o nthe left adds a little too much confusion by being in layers, the colors are quite muted (which may be what you were going for, i just personally would''ve liked a little more color).  i think overall, if you had it, a doll''s bed would''ve really done the trick here. -- gr8photos (3)</td>', 'ok, i have to admit, i had to smile when i first looked at this.  the idea is great, however, the implementation doesn''t totally overwhelm me.  i think the blanket o nthe left adds a little too much confusion by being in layers, the colors are quite muted (which may be what you were going for, i just personally would''ve liked a little more color).  i think overall, if you had it, a doll''s bed would''ve really done the trick here. -- gr8photos (3)', '2002-08-20 12:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
