(107487, 4654, 2586, '<td valign="top">It is a pleasure to contemplate Pencilopolis. So much so actually that I have a tough time critiquing the actual photograph :)  I keep seeing all these neat things but they are all in the drawing(s), such as Big Bird watching the hand and the page curl of the background drawing. I have been downplaying the actual photograph; technically it is very good. The total package is just great. A lot of originality and a fine sense of humor. Wonder what the significance of the B is? :)  I will revisit this later this week a few more times to settle on a final score. Congratulations, well done, I love this! Thanks for making the voting process so entertaining. An 8 for now; Journey<br/>Have really enjoyed looking at this image this week. 10 Journey</td>', 'It is a pleasure to contemplate Pencilopolis. So much so actually that I have a tough time critiquing the actual photograph :)  I keep seeing all these neat things but they are all in the drawing(s), such as Big Bird watching the hand and the page curl of the background drawing. I have been downplaying the actual photograph; technically it is very good. The total package is just great. A lot of originality and a fine sense of humor. Wonder what the significance of the B is? :)  I will revisit this later this week a few more times to settle on a final score. Congratulations, well done, I love this! Thanks for making the voting process so entertaining. An 8 for now; JourneyHave really enjoyed looking at this image this week. 10 Journey', '2002-08-19 02:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
