(107512, 4654, 1280, '<td valign="top">From my perspective:<br/>Meets challenge:Yes<br/>Technical:fine<br/>Appeal/Artistic:inspired!!! Very nice.<br/>Composition:good<br/>Originality:excellent<br/>Comments:Great job, one of my favorites. So much to look at here.  I''m wondering about some of the things in the pic.  Like what is the "B" for and why is it sideways? Why is there a bite taken out of the building on the left?  Is that an insect on the building on the right?  What is the meaning?  Enquiring minds wanna know!  LOL  Good luck in the challenge.<br/></td>', 'From my perspective:Meets challenge:YesTechnical:fineAppeal/Artistic:inspired!!! Very nice.Composition:goodOriginality:excellentComments:Great job, one of my favorites. So much to look at here.  I''m wondering about some of the things in the pic.  Like what is the "B" for and why is it sideways? Why is there a bite taken out of the building on the left?  Is that an insect on the building on the right?  What is the meaning?  Enquiring minds wanna know!  LOL  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-21 21:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
