(107517, 4654, 2472, '<td valign="top">The best of this image is the light. Very good; there are no hand shadows on top of the drawing. The sharpeness and focus is very good. One has to wonder if the pencil drawing (which is very cool) was made for the challege picture, or if it already existed, but that has nothing to do with the quality of the picture.</td>', 'The best of this image is the light. Very good; there are no hand shadows on top of the drawing. The sharpeness and focus is very good. One has to wonder if the pencil drawing (which is very cool) was made for the challege picture, or if it already existed, but that has nothing to do with the quality of the picture.', '2002-08-22 16:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
