(107526, 4659, 2553, '<td valign="top">I suspect you are going to get some grief because this isn''t a "high impact" shot, but I love it.  Beautiful composition, colors and mood. Very nice! lhall</td>', 'I suspect you are going to get some grief because this isn''t a "high impact" shot, but I love it.  Beautiful composition, colors and mood. Very nice! lhall', '2002-08-19 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107527, 4659, 2897, '<td valign="top">Very romantic feel to this picture.  The story I see behind this is someone sitting down to write a love letter to their husband or boyfriend who is off or some reason.  Nicew lighting, nice feel.</td>', 'Very romantic feel to this picture.  The story I see behind this is someone sitting down to write a love letter to their husband or boyfriend who is off or some reason.  Nicew lighting, nice feel.', '2002-08-19 11:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107528, 4659, 2586, '<td valign="top">The association of the pencils with the meditative scene is rather lost on me. You used pencils because that''s what the challenge said but a book, poem, music score would have made a better association. It doesn''t matter (and won''t reflect my score), just an observation. This is a very nice image, nice composition, lovely color scheme,mood invoking. I find the diagonal of the open tray and the pencils a little too harsh and jarring with the mood/tone of the rest of the composition which seems to call for soft lines and soft curves.  Not sure I''m conveying my thoughts well here. 6 for now will revisit this later. Journey</td>', 'The association of the pencils with the meditative scene is rather lost on me. You used pencils because that''s what the challenge said but a book, poem, music score would have made a better association. It doesn''t matter (and won''t reflect my score), just an observation. This is a very nice image, nice composition, lovely color scheme,mood invoking. I find the diagonal of the open tray and the pencils a little too harsh and jarring with the mood/tone of the rest of the composition which seems to call for soft lines and soft curves.  Not sure I''m conveying my thoughts well here. 6 for now will revisit this later. Journey', '2002-08-19 15:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107529, 4659, 806, '<td valign="top">interesting triangular composition. like how the soft colors coordinate. not sure I understand time to reflect with a candle and pencils, but that''s just a personal observation.</td>', 'interesting triangular composition. like how the soft colors coordinate. not sure I understand time to reflect with a candle and pencils, but that''s just a personal observation.', '2002-08-19 17:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107530, 4659, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is very pretty.  I could put this in the den.  The pencils are obvious, but subtle.  Looks like a dreamy photo.  I think it''s neat that it has a softer focus because of that reason. The lighting is good.  Kind of a harsh glare where the flame is, but understood that it is hard to photograph fire.  The angle is excelent and the color is beautiful.  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is very pretty.  I could put this in the den.  The pencils are obvious, but subtle.  Looks like a dreamy photo.  I think it''s neat that it has a softer focus because of that reason. The lighting is good.  Kind of a harsh glare where the flame is, but understood that it is hard to photograph fire.  The angle is excelent and the color is beautiful.  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-20 00:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107531, 4659, 1041, '<td valign="top">interesting combination to throw in the pink marbled pen with the standard yellow ones and that the pink matches the flowers.  the photo seems cropped a little too tightly at the top, i constantly try and scroll to see more.  the flame is a little hot, but that''s hard to control.  -- gr8photos (4)</td>', 'interesting combination to throw in the pink marbled pen with the standard yellow ones and that the pink matches the flowers.  the photo seems cropped a little too tightly at the top, i constantly try and scroll to see more.  the flame is a little hot, but that''s hard to control.  -- gr8photos (4)', '2002-08-20 12:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107532, 4659, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the soft pastel colours, which are unusual in this challenge and therefore do stand out. I love the inclusion of the flowers and candle. I am not sure the exact composition works perfectly - it''s a little unbalanced from left to right. The top left corner seems a little too empty compared with the rest.<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'I like the soft pastel colours, which are unusual in this challenge and therefore do stand out. I love the inclusion of the flowers and candle. I am not sure the exact composition works perfectly - it''s a little unbalanced from left to right. The top left corner seems a little too empty compared with the rest.5, Kavey', '2002-08-20 13:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
