(107591, 4666, 1280, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge Theme:yes<br/>Technical :pencil is perfectly focused<br/>Composition: fair<br/>Creativity:fair<br/>Visual Appeal to me:not really very appealing to me but personal taste varies.<br/>Remarks:the purple stuff is interesting...not sure what it is though.  Petals?  <br/>Grayce...aka...Gracious</td>', 'Meets Challenge Theme:yesTechnical :pencil is perfectly focusedComposition: fairCreativity:fairVisual Appeal to me:not really very appealing to me but personal taste varies.Remarks:the purple stuff is interesting...not sure what it is though.  Petals?  Grayce...aka...Gracious', '2002-08-19 20:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
