(107599, 4666, 3087, '<td valign="top">The texture and colour of the background is what draws me to this one, and the way that the colour combo (to me) is not attractive but that just makes me look more. <br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'The texture and colour of the background is what draws me to this one, and the way that the colour combo (to me) is not attractive but that just makes me look more. 6, Kavey', '2002-08-23 07:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107600, 4666, 3080, '<td valign="top">Dead pencil.  It looks like he''s laying on some flower petals and pencil shavings.  The lighting is good and I like the angle of the pencil.  The glare on the pencil between where it says USA and HB is kind of distracting.  Otherwise great photo.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Dead pencil.  It looks like he''s laying on some flower petals and pencil shavings.  The lighting is good and I like the angle of the pencil.  The glare on the pencil between where it says USA and HB is kind of distracting.  Otherwise great photo.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-23 14:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107601, 4666, 2427, '<td valign="top">Good color</td>', 'Good color', '2002-08-25 09:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107602, 4666, 2221, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. But the lighting is not so good. Flash is (in my opinion) a very bad light source. A desktop lamp casting its light from a lower angle and from the side would make this photo much better I think. It would give the petals much more depth and the glare on the pencil would be gone, too.<br/>-stephan</td>', 'Nice idea. But the lighting is not so good. Flash is (in my opinion) a very bad light source. A desktop lamp casting its light from a lower angle and from the side would make this photo much better I think. It would give the petals much more depth and the glare on the pencil would be gone, too.-stephan', '2002-08-25 20:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107603, 4667, 2279, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what it is, but the thing on the right is really distracting.</td>', 'I don''t know what it is, but the thing on the right is really distracting.', '2002-08-19 01:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107604, 4667, 1360, '<td valign="top">What is that supposed to be, to the right?</td>', 'What is that supposed to be, to the right?', '2002-08-19 03:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107605, 4667, 3280, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the photo.</td>', 'I like the idea and the photo.', '2002-08-19 10:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107606, 4667, 806, '<td valign="top">I''m lost as to the meaning behind or use of the cloth/towel/ what is it?<br/>good use of light.</td>', 'I''m lost as to the meaning behind or use of the cloth/towel/ what is it?good use of light.', '2002-08-19 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
