(107612, 4667, 2323, '<td valign="top">This is a bit too grey-on-grey for my taste-- shouldn''t the keys be white?  And I''m not quite sure what that item there is on the right-- a cloth of some sorts?  --4-- sohr</td>', 'This is a bit too grey-on-grey for my taste-- shouldn''t the keys be white?  And I''m not quite sure what that item there is on the right-- a cloth of some sorts?  --4-- sohr', '2002-08-20 00:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107613, 4667, 2798, '<td valign="top">A nicely taken shot but Im not clear what that towel thing is. Good light and focus.</td>', 'A nicely taken shot but Im not clear what that towel thing is. Good light and focus.', '2002-08-20 08:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107614, 4667, 3087, '<td valign="top">Focus a little fuzzy but like the patterns.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'Focus a little fuzzy but like the patterns.Kavey', '2002-08-20 11:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107615, 4667, 2337, '<td valign="top">I like the use of BW here, and the deapth of field works for me too... However, whatever that is on the right hand side of the shot, it killed the shot for me...I think this would have been a VERY strong shot without the whatever it is... But it dominates my attention everytime I revisit this shot...  I''d love to see a reshoot without it :)</td>', 'I like the use of BW here, and the deapth of field works for me too... However, whatever that is on the right hand side of the shot, it killed the shot for me...I think this would have been a VERY strong shot without the whatever it is... But it dominates my attention everytime I revisit this shot...  I''d love to see a reshoot without it :)', '2002-08-20 16:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107616, 4667, 573, '<td valign="top">I won''t let those things go near my keyboard, they leave erasings between the keys.</td>', 'I won''t let those things go near my keyboard, they leave erasings between the keys.', '2002-08-20 17:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107617, 4667, 3080, '<td valign="top">Great contrast of the pencil and the keyboard.  I wasn''t sure what the object to the right was, but my mom and I agreed that it was the wrist thing used when people get carpal tunnel.  Then it all makes sense.  Your lighting is good and the angle is good.  at the bottom, it looks parallel to the bottom of the photo, but at the top, it looks like it''s tilted a bit to the left.  Most likely nothing can be done about that at this angle, but I wouldn''t change the angle.  I like it how it is.  Good photo and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Great contrast of the pencil and the keyboard.  I wasn''t sure what the object to the right was, but my mom and I agreed that it was the wrist thing used when people get carpal tunnel.  Then it all makes sense.  Your lighting is good and the angle is good.  at the bottom, it looks parallel to the bottom of the photo, but at the top, it looks like it''s tilted a bit to the left.  Most likely nothing can be done about that at this angle, but I wouldn''t change the angle.  I like it how it is.  Good photo and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-21 12:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107618, 4667, 772, '<td valign="top">I believe that the lighting is slightly harsh on this photo... maybe the camera flash?  I also believe, in this case, that more depth of field would be an improvement :)  I''m asking myself why you chose black and white also.... I believe that a color image in this case would make the pencil stand out more since it would contrast better against the keyboard in color :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'I believe that the lighting is slightly harsh on this photo... maybe the camera flash?  I also believe, in this case, that more depth of field would be an improvement :)  I''m asking myself why you chose black and white also.... I believe that a color image in this case would make the pencil stand out more since it would contrast better against the keyboard in color :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-21 12:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107619, 4667, 1280, '<td valign="top">From my perspective:<br/>Meets challenge:Yes<br/>Technical:a little blurry<br/>Appeal/Artistic:Doesn''t appeal to me really<br/>Composition:I think this would look better without the rags.  I just don''t understand why they are included here...Of course it may just be over my head.<br/>Originality:ok<br/>Comments:Good luck in the challenge.<br/></td>', 'From my perspective:Meets challenge:YesTechnical:a little blurryAppeal/Artistic:Doesn''t appeal to me reallyComposition:I think this would look better without the rags.  I just don''t understand why they are included here...Of course it may just be over my head.Originality:okComments:Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-21 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107620, 4667, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background4,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing5,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,<br/>Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background4,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing5,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool', '2002-08-22 10:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107621, 4667, 1041, '<td valign="top">b&amp;w works well here, so does DOF, but i am totally missing what the thing on the right is and how it fits into the photo.  a piece of clothing?  sorry, must be having one of my blond days. -- gr8photos (4)</td>', 'b&w works well here, so does DOF, but i am totally missing what the thing on the right is and how it fits into the photo.  a piece of clothing?  sorry, must be having one of my blond days. -- gr8photos (4)', '2002-08-23 14:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107622, 4669, 2223, '<td valign="top">thats very creative.</td>', 'thats very creative.', '2002-08-19 01:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107623, 4669, 1826, '<td valign="top">Love this concept, so creative!</td>', 'Love this concept, so creative!', '2002-08-19 06:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107624, 4669, 674, '<td valign="top">excellent idea! lighting and white balance could be better. If your camera has the option try other white balance settings. sulamk</td>', 'excellent idea! lighting and white balance could be better. If your camera has the option try other white balance settings. sulamk', '2002-08-19 07:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107625, 4669, 2344, '<td valign="top">I had to laugh. The pencils dreaming of a vacation just like people do! Is the white balance off or am I just hallucinating? Great shot though. cute idea</td>', 'I had to laugh. The pencils dreaming of a vacation just like people do! Is the white balance off or am I just hallucinating? Great shot though. cute idea', '2002-08-19 10:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107626, 4669, 3280, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but the light seems a bit off.</td>', 'I like the idea but the light seems a bit off.', '2002-08-19 10:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107627, 4669, 2928, '<td valign="top">Superb, brilliantly funny, exceptionally well shot.  I can''t fault this picture technically, and wouldn''t if I could - the concept of inanimate objects having holiday fantasies is wickedly amusing and deserves 10 on it''s own.  The way you have put the idea into action is to be congratulated  first class shot Winner? May be? Good luck Easy 10++</td>', 'Superb, brilliantly funny, exceptionally well shot.  I can''t fault this picture technically, and wouldn''t if I could - the concept of inanimate objects having holiday fantasies is wickedly amusing and deserves 10 on it''s own.  The way you have put the idea into action is to be congratulated  first class shot Winner? May be? Good luck Easy 10++', '2002-08-19 12:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107628, 4669, 2815, '<td valign="top">LOL  very funny (7)</td>', 'LOL  very funny (7)', '2002-08-19 15:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107629, 4669, 327, '<td valign="top">Fantastic idea, creative to the max!!!!!!! Well done composition, but the light has let you down. Still I like it very much. Scroe 7 ~Kee</td>', 'Fantastic idea, creative to the max!!!!!!! Well done composition, but the light has let you down. Still I like it very much. Scroe 7 ~Kee', '2002-08-19 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(107630, 4669, 1779, '<td valign="top">I love the idea. That''s a 7 just for that. Now the picture: I dunno if its the camera (hope its that so you can get of the hook easy) but it looks blurry. It need more contrast also.</td>', 'I love the idea. That''s a 7 just for that. Now the picture: I dunno if its the camera (hope its that so you can get of the hook easy) but it looks blurry. It need more contrast also.', '2002-08-19 18:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107631, 4669, 806, '<td valign="top">clever. a bit grainy. ... did you make the drawing, too? good!</td>', 'clever. a bit grainy. ... did you make the drawing, too? good!', '2002-08-19 18:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107632, 4669, 1543, '<td valign="top">pencils with thought patterns.  nice.</td>', 'pencils with thought patterns.  nice.', '2002-08-19 18:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107633, 4669, 2334, '<td valign="top">just wow.</td>', 'just wow.', '2002-08-19 19:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107634, 4669, 656, '<td valign="top">cute idea, but doesn''t make a very exciting image.  Could maybe be a good advertisment concept</td>', 'cute idea, but doesn''t make a very exciting image.  Could maybe be a good advertisment concept', '2002-08-19 22:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107635, 4669, 2204, '<td valign="top">Very very clever.</td>', 'Very very clever.', '2002-08-20 03:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107636, 4669, 2586, '<td valign="top">I really adore this playful image. You have a good imagination and a fine sense of humor. Thanks to you I really see that red pencil as a living human being who dreams about being in Hawaii and escaping the regimented life. I like the placement of the little pencils; the blue background (drawn by you I presume) makes for a nice little touch. Good light. I really appreciate this.  You know I have gone through all the pictures and voted on all of them and I see a lot of pencils doing all sorts of things but often the context doesn''t make much sense. Here you, however, has created a nice pencil life. Great job. 8 Journey</td>', 'I really adore this playful image. You have a good imagination and a fine sense of humor. Thanks to you I really see that red pencil as a living human being who dreams about being in Hawaii and escaping the regimented life. I like the placement of the little pencils; the blue background (drawn by you I presume) makes for a nice little touch. Good light. I really appreciate this.  You know I have gone through all the pictures and voted on all of them and I see a lot of pencils doing all sorts of things but often the context doesn''t make much sense. Here you, however, has created a nice pencil life. Great job. 8 Journey', '2002-08-20 03:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107637, 4669, 156, '<td valign="top">heeheehee! did you draw this? dang! you''re talented...8</td>', 'heeheehee! did you draw this? dang! you''re talented...8', '2002-08-20 10:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107638, 4669, 1360, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but the end product is lacking a bit.  The colors seem washed out, and the lighting seems a bit off.  Theres also a lot of ccd noise, maybe you could use iso ~100 next time?  6 -lennier</td>', 'Great idea, but the end product is lacking a bit.  The colors seem washed out, and the lighting seems a bit off.  Theres also a lot of ccd noise, maybe you could use iso ~100 next time?  6 -lennier', '2002-08-20 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107639, 4669, 3112, '<td valign="top">Extremely creative.  Could use some whitebalance and lighting changes to make the colors stand out. focus is soft.  7.5, but rounded up to 8.</td>', 'Extremely creative.  Could use some whitebalance and lighting changes to make the colors stand out. focus is soft.  7.5, but rounded up to 8.', '2002-08-20 18:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107640, 4669, 2881, '<td valign="top">I like what you''ve done with light and shadows here. Creative idea too.</td>', 'I like what you''ve done with light and shadows here. Creative idea too.', '2002-08-20 22:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107641, 4669, 1280, '<td valign="top">very clever...cute even!  That little red dreamer...lol well I think you carried this out well, except the pencils are a wee bit underexposed.  But still good. 7 Grayce...aka...gracious</td>', 'very clever...cute even!  That little red dreamer...lol well I think you carried this out well, except the pencils are a wee bit underexposed.  But still good. 7 Grayce...aka...gracious', '2002-08-21 01:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107642, 4669, 3002, '<td valign="top">I expected to see many photos ''like'' this, but because of the talent of the photographer, and the way s/he has composed this shot, this one is special.</td>', 'I expected to see many photos ''like'' this, but because of the talent of the photographer, and the way s/he has composed this shot, this one is special.', '2002-08-21 01:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107643, 4669, 2352, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the laugh!  That is cute!!!</td>', 'Thanks for the laugh!  That is cute!!!', '2002-08-21 03:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107644, 4669, 3415, '<td valign="top">No photo appeared here</td>', 'No photo appeared here', '2002-08-21 12:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107645, 4669, 3273, '<td valign="top">Slightly uneven light and out of focus.  Nice idea though.</td>', 'Slightly uneven light and out of focus.  Nice idea though.', '2002-08-21 12:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107646, 4669, 1827, '<td valign="top">She got sun-burned just thinking about it!  LOL.  Very original.  The drawing is GREAT.  The photo is pretty good.  The concept is sellable.  I could see this idea reproduced as an ad for crayons or colored pencils.  Out of curiosity (and not as a complaint) why did you limit yourself to blue and red?  7</td>', 'She got sun-burned just thinking about it!  LOL.  Very original.  The drawing is GREAT.  The photo is pretty good.  The concept is sellable.  I could see this idea reproduced as an ad for crayons or colored pencils.  Out of curiosity (and not as a complaint) why did you limit yourself to blue and red?  7', '2002-08-21 16:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107647, 4669, 1877, '<td valign="top">good comp, great drawing! there sure are some artists on this site.. 10, love it :)</td>', 'good comp, great drawing! there sure are some artists on this site.. 10, love it :)', '2002-08-21 17:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107648, 4669, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m the red pencil right now. LOL.  Except maybe I wish I were in Alaska where it isn''t so darn hot and humid.  This is a cute idea.  It has originality and creativity.  Lighting, angle and focus are great.  Congrats and good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I''m the red pencil right now. LOL.  Except maybe I wish I were in Alaska where it isn''t so darn hot and humid.  This is a cute idea.  It has originality and creativity.  Lighting, angle and focus are great.  Congrats and good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-21 18:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107649, 4669, 3087, '<td valign="top">Cute! A lot of grain in the background, perhaps this is intentional, or down to the camera. The pencils just look so cute. I like the big margin at the bottom - makes me think the composition is very deliberate within the entire frame.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Cute! A lot of grain in the background, perhaps this is intentional, or down to the camera. The pencils just look so cute. I like the big margin at the bottom - makes me think the composition is very deliberate within the entire frame.6, Kavey', '2002-08-21 19:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107650, 4669, 1759, '<td valign="top">I love it! This one caught me off guard. Good thing I wasn''t taking a drink of coffee when it popped up. Extremely creative and original idea. Well done. My only nitpick is that for my taste it could be a bit sharper and I would rather have a bit of fill-in lighting from the left to lessen the shadows and improve the visibility of the pencils. (9)</td>', 'I love it! This one caught me off guard. Good thing I wasn''t taking a drink of coffee when it popped up. Extremely creative and original idea. Well done. My only nitpick is that for my taste it could be a bit sharper and I would rather have a bit of fill-in lighting from the left to lessen the shadows and improve the visibility of the pencils. (9)', '2002-08-21 21:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
