(107677, 4670, 3080, '<td valign="top">There are quite a few photos of drawings this week.  I have to wonder though, how many people are judging the drawing rather than the photo.  This photo is very nice with the focus and the sharp tip of the pencil more obvious and clear than the drawing.  This photo seems like a photo of a pencil, rather than a photo of a drawing that just happens to have a pencil in it.  Great lighting and the angle is also very nice.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'There are quite a few photos of drawings this week.  I have to wonder though, how many people are judging the drawing rather than the photo.  This photo is very nice with the focus and the sharp tip of the pencil more obvious and clear than the drawing.  This photo seems like a photo of a pencil, rather than a photo of a drawing that just happens to have a pencil in it.  Great lighting and the angle is also very nice.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-22 11:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
