(107706, 4678, 2928, '<td valign="top">First off, this made me laugh It''s not easy to get humour from a pencil.  You have also executed the shot with technical aplomb.  It''s clear from the forensic evidence of the ''slightly worn rubber'' that #2 did it, and, when kicked, sorry, cautioned, admitted to the heinous deed :)  I think this shot, for inventiveness and wit alone gets high marks.  Easy 10 Good luck</td>', 'First off, this made me laugh It''s not easy to get humour from a pencil.  You have also executed the shot with technical aplomb.  It''s clear from the forensic evidence of the ''slightly worn rubber'' that #2 did it, and, when kicked, sorry, cautioned, admitted to the heinous deed :)  I think this shot, for inventiveness and wit alone gets high marks.  Easy 10 Good luck', '2002-08-19 06:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
