(107745, 4678, 1005, '<td valign="top">(The balding criminal?)  Great title and shot.  At first, I had a hard time with the two pencil reflections, then I followed the light backwards.  I thought I had it, but no the logic fails..I''ll just have to ask.  Which pencils are reflecting against the background.  Both look like silver tops, but there is no place where two silver tops appear in next to each other.  Where DID the reflections come from.  (At first I didn''t like them, but the questions kept me intrigued.)  <br/>Nice work, great photo, good "take" on the challenge.  Score bumped to 9.  Swash</td>', '(The balding criminal?)  Great title and shot.  At first, I had a hard time with the two pencil reflections, then I followed the light backwards.  I thought I had it, but no the logic fails..I''ll just have to ask.  Which pencils are reflecting against the background.  Both look like silver tops, but there is no place where two silver tops appear in next to each other.  Where DID the reflections come from.  (At first I didn''t like them, but the questions kept me intrigued.)  Nice work, great photo, good "take" on the challenge.  Score bumped to 9.  Swash', '2002-08-21 18:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
