(107759, 4678, 1209, '<td valign="top">Please tell me that you didn''t do this out of experience! Just from all those cop shows on T.V., right? Extremely well done, one of the best resolution pictures in this challenge. And, it is done with a healthy dose of humor, which makes it a well-rounded favorite for me. Top 3, I bet!</td>', 'Please tell me that you didn''t do this out of experience! Just from all those cop shows on T.V., right? Extremely well done, one of the best resolution pictures in this challenge. And, it is done with a healthy dose of humor, which makes it a well-rounded favorite for me. Top 3, I bet!', '2002-08-25 02:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
