(107784, 4680, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice composition... i like the use of the pencil in this shot quite a bit :)  I believe the shadows that are traversing her back diagonally look slightly awkward... I''m not sure if there was a way to eliminate that or not... :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'very nice composition... i like the use of the pencil in this shot quite a bit :)  I believe the shadows that are traversing her back diagonally look slightly awkward... I''m not sure if there was a way to eliminate that or not... :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-23 14:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107785, 4680, 3275, '<td valign="top">Perhaps my eyes are playing tricks on me, but I see a slight discoloration at the left side of the woman''s head. Otherwise, great photo.</td>', 'Perhaps my eyes are playing tricks on me, but I see a slight discoloration at the left side of the woman''s head. Otherwise, great photo.', '2002-08-25 19:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107786, 4680, 1143, '<td valign="top">Well, I''m a little surprised that there were two photos so similar and one placed 14th while the other placed 91st. Just shows that the idea was very good, but the voters are very picky about lighting. <br/>The shadows were caused by a very old desk lamp. It was either that or overhead lighting so...<br/>Congratulations to everyone. There were some great shots in this challenge. I managed to pick 4 of the final 5.</td>', 'Well, I''m a little surprised that there were two photos so similar and one placed 14th while the other placed 91st. Just shows that the idea was very good, but the voters are very picky about lighting. The shadows were caused by a very old desk lamp. It was either that or overhead lighting so...Congratulations to everyone. There were some great shots in this challenge. I managed to pick 4 of the final 5.', '2002-08-26 01:59:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(107787, 4682, 51167, '<td valign="top">I like this picture, I sorta did something like this for mine too.  But mine wasn''t as clear.</td>', 'I like this picture, I sorta did something like this for mine too.  But mine wasn''t as clear.', '2002-08-19 01:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107788, 4682, 2344, '<td valign="top">Where''s Gumby''s little horsie friend gone? Good shot :)</td>', 'Where''s Gumby''s little horsie friend gone? Good shot :)', '2002-08-19 10:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107789, 4682, 1543, '<td valign="top">cute.</td>', 'cute.', '2002-08-19 18:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107790, 4682, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice work, creative, good color, interesting. Brrrravo. Score 8 ~Kee</td>', 'Nice work, creative, good color, interesting. Brrrravo. Score 8 ~Kee', '2002-08-19 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107791, 4682, 3111, '<td valign="top">I love the flat black background, brings out the cartoon-y aspect of this picture.  I do worry, however, that Gumby seems to have problems puncturing the paper.  He may need anger management classes.</td>', 'I love the flat black background, brings out the cartoon-y aspect of this picture.  I do worry, however, that Gumby seems to have problems puncturing the paper.  He may need anger management classes.', '2002-08-19 21:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107792, 4682, 3080, '<td valign="top">This would be really cool if he was writing on one of those name tags they make you wear at get togethers.  I''m a big fan of gumby.  I like the angle and the lighting is great.  No funny shadows or bright spots.  I like the soft focus on this photo.  I''m not a huge fan of soft focus, but gumby isn''t suposed to be sharp and crisp, so it works for me.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This would be really cool if he was writing on one of those name tags they make you wear at get togethers.  I''m a big fan of gumby.  I like the angle and the lighting is great.  No funny shadows or bright spots.  I like the soft focus on this photo.  I''m not a huge fan of soft focus, but gumby isn''t suposed to be sharp and crisp, so it works for me.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-19 22:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107793, 4682, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the composition here, but the subject matter doesn''t appeal to me. The black background does come through as a wonderfully rich black which is something I struggle with in my own photos. <br/>Please feel free to message me to discuss my comments should you wish.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'I like the composition here, but the subject matter doesn''t appeal to me. The black background does come through as a wonderfully rich black which is something I struggle with in my own photos. Please feel free to message me to discuss my comments should you wish.Kavey', '2002-08-20 07:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107794, 4682, 2295, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept.  Judging by the holesin the paper, gumby seems a bit tense.  Since everybody else harps on it, I will too...  The end of the pencil seems to be a bit out of focus.    Over all, this is a good picture.  Focus is good, lighting is good &amp; I actually like the subject...  7</td>', 'Interesting concept.  Judging by the holesin the paper, gumby seems a bit tense.  Since everybody else harps on it, I will too...  The end of the pencil seems to be a bit out of focus.    Over all, this is a good picture.  Focus is good, lighting is good & I actually like the subject...  7', '2002-08-20 16:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107795, 4682, 1041, '<td valign="top">nice bold colors.  the writing looks like it really is from gumb...  so, you met the challenge, the shot is technically ok, but i just don''t find it very exciting. sorry. -- gr8photos (5)</td>', 'nice bold colors.  the writing looks like it really is from gumb...  so, you met the challenge, the shot is technically ok, but i just don''t find it very exciting. sorry. -- gr8photos (5)', '2002-08-21 16:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
