(107797, 4682, 3479, '<td valign="top">funny</td>', 'funny', '2002-08-23 16:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107798, 4682, 1209, '<td valign="top">If my daughter''s camera wasn''t in the shop for repairs, I''d have to swear this was her picture!  Written in my sidewalk (the day after it was poured 20 years ago) is GUMBY WAS HERE.  I wouldn''t have been surprised if she had come up with this pic! Really fun picture. 10</td>', 'If my daughter''s camera wasn''t in the shop for repairs, I''d have to swear this was her picture!  Written in my sidewalk (the day after it was poured 20 years ago) is GUMBY WAS HERE.  I wouldn''t have been surprised if she had come up with this pic! Really fun picture. 10', '2002-08-25 02:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107799, 4682, 1042, '<td valign="top">This is cute and I like the angle in which it is shot....I wish that gumby and the pencil were more the focus than the paper though. I like the way gumby is looking directly at his words though..lol. Good Job</td>', 'This is cute and I like the angle in which it is shot....I wish that gumby and the pencil were more the focus than the paper though. I like the way gumby is looking directly at his words though..lol. Good Job', '2002-08-25 11:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
