(107804, 4683, 3273, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, very strong.  Good layout of both paper and pencils, nice opposing arcs.</td>', 'Nice colors, very strong.  Good layout of both paper and pencils, nice opposing arcs.', '2002-08-19 08:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107805, 4683, 1779, '<td valign="top">great composition!</td>', 'great composition!', '2002-08-19 11:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107806, 4683, 1019, '<td valign="top">Lovely design and colours--great shot  andrewm</td>', 'Lovely design and colours--great shot  andrewm', '2002-08-19 14:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107807, 4683, 2983, '<td valign="top">Neat effect here.  Great lines, though the colors selectio nis strange</td>', 'Neat effect here.  Great lines, though the colors selectio nis strange', '2002-08-19 14:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107808, 4683, 3127, '<td valign="top">I like the use of colors!</td>', 'I like the use of colors!', '2002-08-19 16:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107809, 4683, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very colorful.  I''m not sure I understand reference to the title though.  Unless you''re just refering to a fan.  Ah, who cares.  This isn''t a title contest.  The colors are great, great spacing in the pencils and different colors.  I like how the words are up on all pencils.  That shows you took time to make this artistic.  The lighting is great.  No distracting shadows or bright spots.  Nice job and good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Very colorful.  I''m not sure I understand reference to the title though.  Unless you''re just refering to a fan.  Ah, who cares.  This isn''t a title contest.  The colors are great, great spacing in the pencils and different colors.  I like how the words are up on all pencils.  That shows you took time to make this artistic.  The lighting is great.  No distracting shadows or bright spots.  Nice job and good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-19 17:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107810, 4683, 2279, '<td valign="top">This one really catches my eye. 8 :)</td>', 'This one really catches my eye. 8 :)', '2002-08-19 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107811, 4683, 2204, '<td valign="top">Cool!!! I love the use of color on color and the abstract fan effect from two directions.  Good lighting with minimal reflection.  =9 syamjonimi</td>', 'Cool!!! I love the use of color on color and the abstract fan effect from two directions.  Good lighting with minimal reflection.  =9 syamjonimi', '2002-08-19 22:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107812, 4683, 656, '<td valign="top">like the intersecting lines/ pencils .  My eyes darting all over the place though - no real resting place that I get led to, other than up the corner, then I get pulled away again</td>', 'like the intersecting lines/ pencils .  My eyes darting all over the place though - no real resting place that I get led to, other than up the corner, then I get pulled away again', '2002-08-19 22:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107813, 4683, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice setup and good use of color :)  There are a lot of contrasting colors in this photo, which is good in many cases... I wonder what this would look like if the background behind the pencils was an alternating pattern of two colors rather than this many different ones?  Good shot :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'Nice setup and good use of color :)  There are a lot of contrasting colors in this photo, which is good in many cases... I wonder what this would look like if the background behind the pencils was an alternating pattern of two colors rather than this many different ones?  Good shot :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-20 17:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107814, 4683, 3162, '<td valign="top">Nice use of colors. Ad type photo.</td>', 'Nice use of colors. Ad type photo.', '2002-08-21 11:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107815, 4683, 1826, '<td valign="top">Really like the use of diagonals in your shot, great color too.</td>', 'Really like the use of diagonals in your shot, great color too.', '2002-08-22 07:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107816, 4683, 1204, '<td valign="top">Being an engineer I just may be that linear thinking - but should the top and right-most pencils be parallel to the edges?  Otherwise, a nice one. 7.</td>', 'Being an engineer I just may be that linear thinking - but should the top and right-most pencils be parallel to the edges?  Otherwise, a nice one. 7.', '2002-08-22 16:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107817, 4683, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,<br/>Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool', '2002-08-22 20:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107818, 4683, 1280, '<td valign="top">Ahhhhhh the addition of colored pape is a very good idea!  It adds drama to the image in a simple and basic way.  Very nice! Grayce...aka...Gracious</td>', 'Ahhhhhh the addition of colored pape is a very good idea!  It adds drama to the image in a simple and basic way.  Very nice! Grayce...aka...Gracious', '2002-08-23 00:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107819, 4683, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is a nice abstract and colourful pattern, I''d like it more if I happened to like the colours used more, but that''s purely about my tastes in colour. Like tthe curve made by the top of the pencils, like a child''s drawing of the sun. Pretty.<br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'This is a nice abstract and colourful pattern, I''d like it more if I happened to like the colours used more, but that''s purely about my tastes in colour. Like tthe curve made by the top of the pencils, like a child''s drawing of the sun. Pretty.7, Kavey', '2002-08-23 07:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107820, 4683, 2172, '<td valign="top">Really cool  (Running out of steam for commenting - so being brief)  nice lines, detail, composition, cropping, colors - great for this.  Although I know that construction paper is not very bright - I wish the colors were more vibrant - doesn''t matter though - great time, effort and work  8<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Really cool  (Running out of steam for commenting - so being brief)  nice lines, detail, composition, cropping, colors - great for this.  Although I know that construction paper is not very bright - I wish the colors were more vibrant - doesn''t matter though - great time, effort and work  8Ruthann', '2002-08-23 23:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107821, 4683, 3500, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I might have used more vivid colors or better lighting.</td>', 'Nice composition.  I might have used more vivid colors or better lighting.', '2002-08-24 17:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107822, 4683, 1808, '<td valign="top">Nice color. You should sell this to the PaperMate Co. for their advertising.</td>', 'Nice color. You should sell this to the PaperMate Co. for their advertising.', '2002-08-25 18:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107823, 4684, 772, '<td valign="top">cute.... not very appropriate for this challenge... - jmsetzler</td>', 'cute.... not very appropriate for this challenge... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-19 01:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107824, 4684, 2, '<td valign="top">I''ve caught your attempt at a pun, and I definitely don''t like it.  I think you''ve missed the point of the challenge.</td>', 'I''ve caught your attempt at a pun, and I definitely don''t like it.  I think you''ve missed the point of the challenge.', '2002-08-19 02:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107825, 4684, 1827, '<td valign="top">UPDATE:  Okay, so given all of the hullabaloo on the forums about pencil-dicked horses, I now see the error of my thinking.  So, despite the fact that I still don''t think this meets the challenge, I thought I would offer some thoughts on the composition:  both the sign and the red/white strap pull my eye away from the "pencil" -- so much in fact, that I didn''t even notice it upon first viewing.  The sign is unfortunate.  That happened to be where the horse stopped.  The strap could maybe have been avoided by crouching for a slighly lower upward angle.  I would also like to see the horses tail in the photo, but of course there may be other stuff cropped out with it.  Sorry, score was unaffected by my enlightenment.<br/><br/>ORIGINAL:  I looked and looked and looked, but I just don''t see it.  3</td>', 'UPDATE:  Okay, so given all of the hullabaloo on the forums about pencil-dicked horses, I now see the error of my thinking.  So, despite the fact that I still don''t think this meets the challenge, I thought I would offer some thoughts on the composition:  both the sign and the red/white strap pull my eye away from the "pencil" -- so much in fact, that I didn''t even notice it upon first viewing.  The sign is unfortunate.  That happened to be where the horse stopped.  The strap could maybe have been avoided by crouching for a slighly lower upward angle.  I would also like to see the horses tail in the photo, but of course there may be other stuff cropped out with it.  Sorry, score was unaffected by my enlightenment.ORIGINAL:  I looked and looked and looked, but I just don''t see it.  3', '2002-08-19 04:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107826, 4684, 1826, '<td valign="top">Can''t find the pencil.</td>', 'Can''t find the pencil.', '2002-08-19 06:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107827, 4684, 2596, '<td valign="top">I don´t get it. please help me with this one  i´m puting a 1 on it and you have to send me a e-mail if i´m missing something so I can look at it again. -rocco22-</td>', 'I don´t get it. please help me with this one  i´m puting a 1 on it and you have to send me a e-mail if i´m missing something so I can look at it again. -rocco22-', '2002-08-19 06:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107828, 4684, 2815, '<td valign="top">I see what you are trying to do, but don''t see a pencil  (2)</td>', 'I see what you are trying to do, but don''t see a pencil  (2)', '2002-08-19 13:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107829, 4684, 1041, '<td valign="top">ok, i''ve read the discussions in the forums, i understand there''s a ''pencil'' in this shot, but IMHO, this does not meet the intent of the challenge (which was to include a writing implement kind of pencil), so i will be voting you low, sorry.  as for the photo, the sign looks a little overexposed, and i''m not sure i like the cropping, but then, i haven''t taken a photo of a horse''s pencil as the main subject, so what do i know. -- gr8photos (2)</td>', 'ok, i''ve read the discussions in the forums, i understand there''s a ''pencil'' in this shot, but IMHO, this does not meet the intent of the challenge (which was to include a writing implement kind of pencil), so i will be voting you low, sorry.  as for the photo, the sign looks a little overexposed, and i''m not sure i like the cropping, but then, i haven''t taken a photo of a horse''s pencil as the main subject, so what do i know. -- gr8photos (2)', '2002-08-19 13:33:00.000000', NULL, 1);
