(107831, 4684, 3087, '<td valign="top">Understanding of this photo and how it relates to the challenge comes from the forums. This one scores low for me just because I don''t find the photo appealing, since I now get the concept of pencil you are using!<br/>Kavey</td>', 'Understanding of this photo and how it relates to the challenge comes from the forums. This one scores low for me just because I don''t find the photo appealing, since I now get the concept of pencil you are using!Kavey', '2002-08-19 18:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
