(107833, 4684, 1360, '<td valign="top">Err.  That''s definately original.   I think it''s a bit childish, but original.  3 -lennier</td>', 'Err.  That''s definately original.   I think it''s a bit childish, but original.  3 -lennier', '2002-08-19 19:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
