(107840, 4684, 2668, '<td valign="top">Ok, I can appreciate the humor here, and if you could''ve gotten him to hold a real pencil with it, I''d stand up and applaude and give you a 10.  And it''d be in the upper half it were a good pic of his pencil....the parking sign is very distracting....maybe if you''d zoomed in on the main subject of the picture a bit more, (i can''t believe I''m critiquing a horse''s willy), lol, I hope this doesn''t start a trend here....we''d have to change the meaning of dpchallenge  (deviate pencil challenge).  ;)</td>', 'Ok, I can appreciate the humor here, and if you could''ve gotten him to hold a real pencil with it, I''d stand up and applaude and give you a 10.  And it''d be in the upper half it were a good pic of his pencil....the parking sign is very distracting....maybe if you''d zoomed in on the main subject of the picture a bit more, (i can''t believe I''m critiquing a horse''s willy), lol, I hope this doesn''t start a trend here....we''d have to change the meaning of dpchallenge  (deviate pencil challenge).  ;)', '2002-08-20 10:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107841, 4684, 156, '<td valign="top">huh? i know that''s not constructive but it''s all i can think of...i just don''t get this...</td>', 'huh? i know that''s not constructive but it''s all i can think of...i just don''t get this...', '2002-08-20 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107842, 4684, 2337, '<td valign="top">After looking through the dictionary, I understand what you were shooting for...  I have to congradulate you on an original, different perspective... However, I don''t care much for the execution... There were so many things competing for attention that I had a hard time figuring out what you were shooting for... I spent a long time trying to figure out what the sign had to do with a pencil, since that seemed to be the dominant aspect...</td>', 'After looking through the dictionary, I understand what you were shooting for...  I have to congradulate you on an original, different perspective... However, I don''t care much for the execution... There were so many things competing for attention that I had a hard time figuring out what you were shooting for... I spent a long time trying to figure out what the sign had to do with a pencil, since that seemed to be the dominant aspect...', '2002-08-20 16:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
