(107844, 4684, 1005, '<td valign="top">O.K. let''s start with an apology.  Sorry for using your photo as an example.  I didn''t see the pencil, nor did I have any clue that pencil derived from penis (but looking at the two word written, I should have guessed).  That said, your new review:<br/>Focus appears to be on the red/white striped bar.  The straps and harness shadow the rest of the subject, suggest a flash to help there.  5 Swash</td>', 'O.K. let''s start with an apology.  Sorry for using your photo as an example.  I didn''t see the pencil, nor did I have any clue that pencil derived from penis (but looking at the two word written, I should have guessed).  That said, your new review:Focus appears to be on the red/white striped bar.  The straps and harness shadow the rest of the subject, suggest a flash to help there.  5 Swash', '2002-08-20 20:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107845, 4684, 1454, '<td valign="top">Is the word ''pencil'' that hard to understand?? why do you use it in other ways? a pencil is a pencil.</td>', 'Is the word ''pencil'' that hard to understand?? why do you use it in other ways? a pencil is a pencil.', '2002-08-21 11:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
