(107870, 4686, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea!  very creative.  You probably got lots of framing comments, so I will pass there.  Did you want to vary the lighting from light to dark, left to right?  If so, skip the next sentence.  Suggestion:  two lights from either side, nice balance.  Nice play on words on your title.  8 Swash</td>', 'This is a great idea!  very creative.  You probably got lots of framing comments, so I will pass there.  Did you want to vary the lighting from light to dark, left to right?  If so, skip the next sentence.  Suggestion:  two lights from either side, nice balance.  Nice play on words on your title.  8 Swash', '2002-08-21 20:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
