(107899, 4687, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I was surprised at the amount of Self portrait photos.  I saw a similar looking guy in the challenge archives, I believe it was in the Table Top challenge, or the From the ground up challenge.  He was stomping on the camera lens or something   Anyway, the lighting here looks perfect.  Very creative way to make the little man drawing and great drawing of the little man drawing.  The angle couldn''t be better.  I noticed that the pencil is leaning a little to the left, but also noticed that it''s leaning in the self portrait too, so great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice.  I was surprised at the amount of Self portrait photos.  I saw a similar looking guy in the challenge archives, I believe it was in the Table Top challenge, or the From the ground up challenge.  He was stomping on the camera lens or something   Anyway, the lighting here looks perfect.  Very creative way to make the little man drawing and great drawing of the little man drawing.  The angle couldn''t be better.  I noticed that the pencil is leaning a little to the left, but also noticed that it''s leaning in the self portrait too, so great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-21 01:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107900, 4687, 2667, '<td valign="top">nice image. but i wish you would have used a "natural" pencil or a yellow pencil to give it a little more kick. the natural pencil would go well with the puppet, a yellow pencil would give a nice splash of color.   ~mcmurma<br/>Aesthetics....6<br/>Meets Challenge...7<br/>Overall....6</td>', 'nice image. but i wish you would have used a "natural" pencil or a yellow pencil to give it a little more kick. the natural pencil would go well with the puppet, a yellow pencil would give a nice splash of color.   ~mcmurmaAesthetics....6Meets Challenge...7Overall....6', '2002-08-21 13:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
