(107926, 4688, 3080, '<td valign="top">Too darn funny.  This is very creative and original.  I like the obvious, but subtle pan.  I have the feeling someone is going to comment on the focus of the pencil.  However, I think its important that the focus is on the paper.  The pencil is IN the photo, that''s all that matters.  I like the lighting and the angle.  You''re going to have to do a tutorial on how to train lobsters to hold a pencil.  Too funny.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Too darn funny.  This is very creative and original.  I like the obvious, but subtle pan.  I have the feeling someone is going to comment on the focus of the pencil.  However, I think its important that the focus is on the paper.  The pencil is IN the photo, that''s all that matters.  I like the lighting and the angle.  You''re going to have to do a tutorial on how to train lobsters to hold a pencil.  Too funny.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-19 17:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
