(107966, 4690, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  My thoughts exactly.  I entered something else, but wished I could have done something with a carpenters pencil.  My first job was in a lumber yard (and I''m a girl, so that made it extra special)  I got a lot of flack for being a girl "out of place" but after 3 years, I real knew my stuff and I was the only one that ever remembered my pencil, so the (at first skeptical) guys needed me to mark stuff for cutting and I felt like I finally fit in.<br/>Anyway, lol...The lighting is great.  Maybe a little bit dark behind the hammer and wrist section of the glove, but I don''t think it takes away from the photo.  Great shot and good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice.  My thoughts exactly.  I entered something else, but wished I could have done something with a carpenters pencil.  My first job was in a lumber yard (and I''m a girl, so that made it extra special)  I got a lot of flack for being a girl "out of place" but after 3 years, I real knew my stuff and I was the only one that ever remembered my pencil, so the (at first skeptical) guys needed me to mark stuff for cutting and I felt like I finally fit in.Anyway, lol...The lighting is great.  Maybe a little bit dark behind the hammer and wrist section of the glove, but I don''t think it takes away from the photo.  Great shot and good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-19 19:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107967, 4690, 327, '<td valign="top">Great idea, composition......poor light. I know natural but it''s too much with the ground and washes out the _tools_. Still I do like your effort. Score 7 ~Kee</td>', 'Great idea, composition......poor light. I know natural but it''s too much with the ground and washes out the _tools_. Still I do like your effort. Score 7 ~Kee', '2002-08-19 19:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
