(107990, 4691, 3080, '<td valign="top">Great effect.  Looks like it was done in a glass or some kind of curved glass.  I like how you have the soft focus on the word "soft" lol   Pretty neat.  The lighting is great.  I wonder why there is a green outline.  was is something to do with the way you acchieved the curved "blooming" look?  Not complaining, just curious.  Actually, I think it adds to the photo by giving it an edge so the yellow doesn''t just fall into the black background.  Cool.  I like it.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Great effect.  Looks like it was done in a glass or some kind of curved glass.  I like how you have the soft focus on the word "soft" lol   Pretty neat.  The lighting is great.  I wonder why there is a green outline.  was is something to do with the way you acchieved the curved "blooming" look?  Not complaining, just curious.  Actually, I think it adds to the photo by giving it an edge so the yellow doesn''t just fall into the black background.  Cool.  I like it.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-22 10:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107991, 4691, 472, '<td valign="top">this is a beautiful effect.</td>', 'this is a beautiful effect.', '2002-08-22 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107992, 4691, 3087, '<td valign="top">Weird and wonderful. I really like the black curve at the lower right and how it balances with the black background at top left. I like the angle, I like the text and I like the DOF.<br/>And it''s yellow. :)<br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'Weird and wonderful. I really like the black curve at the lower right and how it balances with the black background at top left. I like the angle, I like the text and I like the DOF.And it''s yellow. :)7, Kavey', '2002-08-23 07:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107993, 4691, 2172, '<td valign="top">Really Great.  (Running out of steam for commenting - so being brief)  great idea, composition, lighting, color, dof - all great for this image!  I can see a lot of time, effort and skill in this image.   Great work  9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Really Great.  (Running out of steam for commenting - so being brief)  great idea, composition, lighting, color, dof - all great for this image!  I can see a lot of time, effort and skill in this image.   Great work  9Ruthann', '2002-08-23 23:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107994, 4693, 1827, '<td valign="top">Original.  I like the idea.  I find myself wanting to push the mirror away so I can see the rest of her face.  Also, there''s a tad bit too much grain for me.  Still I like it.</td>', 'Original.  I like the idea.  I find myself wanting to push the mirror away so I can see the rest of her face.  Also, there''s a tad bit too much grain for me.  Still I like it.', '2002-08-19 01:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107995, 4693, 1707, '<td valign="top">good thinking!  #2 pencils aren''t the only pencils we use...</td>', 'good thinking!  #2 pencils aren''t the only pencils we use...', '2002-08-19 05:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107996, 4693, 1826, '<td valign="top">Good choice going with the black and white. :)</td>', 'Good choice going with the black and white. :)', '2002-08-19 06:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107997, 4693, 2, '<td valign="top">I think the greenish night-cam type effect makes her look scared instead of innocent.  I''m not sure this is the right place for this image effect.</td>', 'I think the greenish night-cam type effect makes her look scared instead of innocent.  I''m not sure this is the right place for this image effect.', '2002-08-19 11:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107998, 4693, 2897, '<td valign="top">I am sure someone will comment on the blob in the bottom left corner, however, I can see that it is a mirror.  Maybe move it out of the picture, or move it more in so it is more clear as to what it is, since it does kind of distract, but the picture is still beautiful!  8!!!</td>', 'I am sure someone will comment on the blob in the bottom left corner, however, I can see that it is a mirror.  Maybe move it out of the picture, or move it more in so it is more clear as to what it is, since it does kind of distract, but the picture is still beautiful!  8!!!', '2002-08-19 11:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(107999, 4693, 801, '<td valign="top">I like this shot</td>', 'I like this shot', '2002-08-19 16:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108000, 4693, 656, '<td valign="top">very ''reportage'' feel to this with the slightly blurred/ noisy feel.  Good entry.</td>', 'very ''reportage'' feel to this with the slightly blurred/ noisy feel.  Good entry.', '2002-08-19 22:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108001, 4693, 1255, '<td valign="top">Great twist on the challenge.  I do wish the compact/mirror in the bottom left was nto so distracting though.  Love the graininess and the intimate feel.  8 shedonist</td>', 'Great twist on the challenge.  I do wish the compact/mirror in the bottom left was nto so distracting though.  Love the graininess and the intimate feel.  8 shedonist', '2002-08-19 22:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108002, 4693, 3087, '<td valign="top">Like it but the mirror reminds me of when I''ve got my thumb or something else in the frame by accident - it''s too starkly white compared with her skin, for my taste. I like the close crop on her face and the slight reflection in the eye.<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'Like it but the mirror reminds me of when I''ve got my thumb or something else in the frame by accident - it''s too starkly white compared with her skin, for my taste. I like the close crop on her face and the slight reflection in the eye.5, Kavey', '2002-08-20 18:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108003, 4693, 3002, '<td valign="top">The blown out, glowing mirror kind of messes up this image, in my honest opinion.</td>', 'The blown out, glowing mirror kind of messes up this image, in my honest opinion.', '2002-08-21 02:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108004, 4693, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice. The soft focus/graininess makes it a warmer, more personal photo. Very strong composition. In fact, it''s so beautiful that I''m giving it 10 - lisae</td>', 'Nice. The soft focus/graininess makes it a warmer, more personal photo. Very strong composition. In fact, it''s so beautiful that I''m giving it 10 - lisae', '2002-08-21 14:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108005, 4693, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice shot :)  I love the way the mirror plays into this image.  I''m trying to decide if the black and white works well for me here or not... Black and white with grain is something that I generally associate with ''old''.  I''m not sure how those two aspects are improving this photo overall.  The soft focus works nicely here... I would love to see the color version of this :)  Good shot... - jmsetzler</td>', 'very nice shot :)  I love the way the mirror plays into this image.  I''m trying to decide if the black and white works well for me here or not... Black and white with grain is something that I generally associate with ''old''.  I''m not sure how those two aspects are improving this photo overall.  The soft focus works nicely here... I would love to see the color version of this :)  Good shot... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-21 15:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108006, 4693, 2798, '<td valign="top">Love the angle and the grain. Excellent shot.</td>', 'Love the angle and the grain. Excellent shot.', '2002-08-22 17:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108007, 4693, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing5,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 3,<br/>Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing5,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 3,Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool', '2002-08-22 21:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108008, 4693, 2907, '<td valign="top">ughh! she''s sticking that pencil into her eye....</td>', 'ughh! she''s sticking that pencil into her eye....', '2002-08-22 22:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108009, 4693, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think that if you wanted the mirror in the photo that you might have wanted to back it up just a bit.  It''s a bit distracting from the rest of the photo.  That is just my opinion though.  I like the mirror in there, but it''s a bit too close for my taste.  I wonder why you went with black and white here.  A lot of time people go with black and white when dealing with people and skin tones, but I like faces in color.  You might have tried it and it didn''t look good to you.  I would like to see them both to compare b/w to color.  I love the eye pencil idea.  Other than the closeness of the mirror, the angle is great and lighting appears to be good as well.  I like the angle so you can tell you are trying to look into the mirror.  You have nice eyes and pretty lashes.  They would make for great macros.  Good job with the photo and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I think that if you wanted the mirror in the photo that you might have wanted to back it up just a bit.  It''s a bit distracting from the rest of the photo.  That is just my opinion though.  I like the mirror in there, but it''s a bit too close for my taste.  I wonder why you went with black and white here.  A lot of time people go with black and white when dealing with people and skin tones, but I like faces in color.  You might have tried it and it didn''t look good to you.  I would like to see them both to compare b/w to color.  I love the eye pencil idea.  Other than the closeness of the mirror, the angle is great and lighting appears to be good as well.  I like the angle so you can tell you are trying to look into the mirror.  You have nice eyes and pretty lashes.  They would make for great macros.  Good job with the photo and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-24 01:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108010, 4693, 3469, '<td valign="top">Great idea, seemingly casual, she is really herself, even not hiding that she bites her nails (next stage of the make up process?).</td>', 'Great idea, seemingly casual, she is really herself, even not hiding that she bites her nails (next stage of the make up process?).', '2002-08-25 17:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108011, 4695, 1143, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. I''m interested to know how you did it - overexposure? I''m sure that quite a few folks will take off points for not using a writing pencil, but I think it''s a great entry.</td>', 'This is beautiful. I''m interested to know how you did it - overexposure? I''m sure that quite a few folks will take off points for not using a writing pencil, but I think it''s a great entry.', '2002-08-19 02:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108012, 4695, 2668, '<td valign="top">Would love to know how you did this....I''ve been playing with my camera for months trying to accomplish this....Can you share with me how you did it?  Thanks.</td>', 'Would love to know how you did this....I''ve been playing with my camera for months trying to accomplish this....Can you share with me how you did it?  Thanks.', '2002-08-19 02:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108013, 4695, 1827, '<td valign="top">It''s clear that you desaturated as a choice; it leaves the image almost like a charcoal sketch instead of a photo.  I didn''t think I liked it at first and rated it a 4.  But something in it strikes me and 4 seems unwarranted.  6</td>', 'It''s clear that you desaturated as a choice; it leaves the image almost like a charcoal sketch instead of a photo.  I didn''t think I liked it at first and rated it a 4.  But something in it strikes me and 4 seems unwarranted.  6', '2002-08-19 03:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108014, 4695, 1908, '<td valign="top">nearlt got ot right, u needed a small back light to give more definement to the models head</td>', 'nearlt got ot right, u needed a small back light to give more definement to the models head', '2002-08-19 07:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108015, 4695, 3127, '<td valign="top">A little too oblique.</td>', 'A little too oblique.', '2002-08-19 09:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108016, 4695, 2223, '<td valign="top">this is a very artsy b&amp;w photo, well done. i would like to know the meaning behind the title.</td>', 'this is a very artsy b&w photo, well done. i would like to know the meaning behind the title.', '2002-08-19 11:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108017, 4695, 2343, '<td valign="top">Good photo if not a bit washed out.  I like it!!</td>', 'Good photo if not a bit washed out.  I like it!!', '2002-08-19 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108018, 4695, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a very neat concept and I really like the image.  I also believe that post processing can be used to significantly enhance a photograph.  My personal problem (not yours) is that I try to draw a line between what is digital art and photography.  This photo crosses that line for me.  The post processing on this image gives me the impression of a pencil or charcoal sketch rather than a photograph.  This image has great artistic merit and really do like it.  I''m giving it a 9 rather than a 10 because of this twisted view I have of what is photography and what isn''t :)  Great work!  = 9 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a very neat concept and I really like the image.  I also believe that post processing can be used to significantly enhance a photograph.  My personal problem (not yours) is that I try to draw a line between what is digital art and photography.  This photo crosses that line for me.  The post processing on this image gives me the impression of a pencil or charcoal sketch rather than a photograph.  This image has great artistic merit and really do like it.  I''m giving it a 9 rather than a 10 because of this twisted view I have of what is photography and what isn''t :)  Great work!  = 9 - jmsetzler', '2002-08-19 13:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108019, 4695, 2764, '<td valign="top">Nice but the center of interest should be the point of the pencil where it meets the eye and because of the contrast it is lost,  When the challange is over and you can cheat, fix up that point and you''ll have a nice image/</td>', 'Nice but the center of interest should be the point of the pencil where it meets the eye and because of the contrast it is lost,  When the challange is over and you can cheat, fix up that point and you''ll have a nice image/', '2002-08-19 13:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108020, 4695, 1024, '<td valign="top">I love how this photo also looks like a drrawing..... extra points for creativity!</td>', 'I love how this photo also looks like a drrawing..... extra points for creativity!', '2002-08-19 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108021, 4695, 2261, '<td valign="top">Excellent.</td>', 'Excellent.', '2002-08-19 15:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108022, 4695, 3349, '<td valign="top">very good!!</td>', 'very good!!', '2002-08-19 15:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108023, 4695, 2170, '<td valign="top">I love shots like this, and this is such a great take on the challenge.<br/><br/>Can you post or email me the original so that I can see what your lighting was like?  I''d appreciate it.  Muckpond.</td>', 'I love shots like this, and this is such a great take on the challenge.Can you post or email me the original so that I can see what your lighting was like?  I''d appreciate it.  Muckpond.', '2002-08-19 15:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108024, 4695, 1877, '<td valign="top">Love it! 10</td>', 'Love it! 10', '2002-08-19 18:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108025, 4695, 1779, '<td valign="top">I loke the hole contrast thing.  Idunno if it''s too much but I like it.</td>', 'I loke the hole contrast thing.  Idunno if it''s too much but I like it.', '2002-08-19 19:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108026, 4695, 3111, '<td valign="top">Something disturbs me about this picture, but I get it.  I would have like to see some color in it, and I think the picture could do fine without the mouth (makes the lack of nose in this picture far too obvious)</td>', 'Something disturbs me about this picture, but I get it.  I would have like to see some color in it, and I think the picture could do fine without the mouth (makes the lack of nose in this picture far too obvious)', '2002-08-19 21:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
