(108112, 4698, 3087, '<td valign="top">Like colours, think background green really adds something. Feels unbalanced, too heavy to the left, perhaps because the pencil doesn''t touch the edge of the frame but the shavings do. I like the way that only a tiny bit of the text remains on the pencil, just enough to give an abstract pattern, nothing more.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Like colours, think background green really adds something. Feels unbalanced, too heavy to the left, perhaps because the pencil doesn''t touch the edge of the frame but the shavings do. I like the way that only a tiny bit of the text remains on the pencil, just enough to give an abstract pattern, nothing more.6, Kavey', '2002-08-20 18:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
