(108140, 4699, 2295, '<td valign="top">Been there....  Very nice photo.  Focus is excellent.  Lighting is excellent.  Subject matter is great.  8</td>', 'Been there....  Very nice photo.  Focus is excellent.  Lighting is excellent.  Subject matter is great.  8', '2002-08-21 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108141, 4699, 3189, '<td valign="top">Good use of light.  Subject most can relate to.</td>', 'Good use of light.  Subject most can relate to.', '2002-08-21 17:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108142, 4699, 3080, '<td valign="top">So true, so true.  I could see this hanging in a classroom.  Lighting and angle are both very nice.  Definateley has originality.  I have to wonder though what you do for a living.  The tips of your fingers look like thay have worked very hard toward something. (I hope it wasn''t this test. LOL).  It adds a bit of mystery to this photo for me.  The dark area that  your hand makes is very dark, but I don''t think I would change it because you would have to change the positioning of your hand, and then it just wouldn''t be the same.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'So true, so true.  I could see this hanging in a classroom.  Lighting and angle are both very nice.  Definateley has originality.  I have to wonder though what you do for a living.  The tips of your fingers look like thay have worked very hard toward something. (I hope it wasn''t this test. LOL).  It adds a bit of mystery to this photo for me.  The dark area that  your hand makes is very dark, but I don''t think I would change it because you would have to change the positioning of your hand, and then it just wouldn''t be the same.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-22 12:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108143, 4699, 472, '<td valign="top">i hate that feeling! which u captured very well .. great shot.</td>', 'i hate that feeling! which u captured very well .. great shot.', '2002-08-22 12:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108144, 4699, 2235, '<td valign="top">You didn''t tell me the title when I first saw it or I forgot. Like the idea and the title. really makes the picture.</td>', 'You didn''t tell me the title when I first saw it or I forgot. Like the idea and the title. really makes the picture.', '2002-08-22 21:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108145, 4699, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really like the detail in the hand - Hey I can even see the grime under the nail ;)<br/>I also like that there is no desk showing - that it''s close enough in that the exam paper makes the whole of the background and yet it''s actually foreground at the same time! Also like the way the (2) on the pencil is so carefully positioned.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'I really like the detail in the hand - Hey I can even see the grime under the nail ;)I also like that there is no desk showing - that it''s close enough in that the exam paper makes the whole of the background and yet it''s actually foreground at the same time! Also like the way the (2) on the pencil is so carefully positioned.6, Kavey', '2002-08-23 07:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108146, 4699, 1209, '<td valign="top">Oh, yes!  This hits the nail right on the head! Makes me smile! Great picture.</td>', 'Oh, yes!  This hits the nail right on the head! Makes me smile! Great picture.', '2002-08-24 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108147, 4699, 1042, '<td valign="top">oh, the horrible memories this brings back. Nice unique idea. I like the story it evokes.</td>', 'oh, the horrible memories this brings back. Nice unique idea. I like the story it evokes.', '2002-08-25 11:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
