(108150, 4701, 1856, '<td valign="top">hmmm...i''m sure you already have about 6 comments telling you that the dof is kinda off here...focus on the back row as opposed to the front row...so i won''t comment on that :P For some reason I *think* i would prefer this taken head on...the composition just seems a little off to me with the angle and the tubes being cropped out unevenly.  Nice colors and focus on the pencil tips. Lisa</td>', 'hmmm...i''m sure you already have about 6 comments telling you that the dof is kinda off here...focus on the back row as opposed to the front row...so i won''t comment on that :P For some reason I *think* i would prefer this taken head on...the composition just seems a little off to me with the angle and the tubes being cropped out unevenly.  Nice colors and focus on the pencil tips. Lisa', '2002-08-19 11:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
