(108157, 4701, 2170, '<td valign="top">I would like to see this with the colors more vibrant and the background lighter -- playing with the levels in Photoshop (if you''ve got it) would help it out a lot.  Otherwise, maybe stronger lighting from above?  muckpond</td>', 'I would like to see this with the colors more vibrant and the background lighter -- playing with the levels in Photoshop (if you''ve got it) would help it out a lot.  Otherwise, maybe stronger lighting from above?  muckpond', '2002-08-20 17:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
