(108159, 4701, 3087, '<td valign="top">Colourful, sort of abstract-ish, pretty. Would like a whiter background, and a more even distance between the sets of two. The middle set feels like it should be over to the left a bit. This matters (for me) on this shot because it''s so highly graphical, like a repeating set.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Colourful, sort of abstract-ish, pretty. Would like a whiter background, and a more even distance between the sets of two. The middle set feels like it should be over to the left a bit. This matters (for me) on this shot because it''s so highly graphical, like a repeating set.6, Kavey', '2002-08-20 19:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108160, 4701, 2204, '<td valign="top">Nice color combinations.  A little soft on the focus and a darker background and more even crop would give this more visual appeal.</td>', 'Nice color combinations.  A little soft on the focus and a darker background and more even crop would give this more visual appeal.', '2002-08-21 02:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
