(108322, 4708, 3080, '<td valign="top">You got RIPPED OFF!!!  If only people would LOOK at the photos!!!  I am totally apaulled.  This is a great photo and should have done WAY better.  I hope you do know that it''s not your fault that this got a low score.  It''s the voters not taking the time to look at the darn photos.  You can tell the people who looked at it, and didn''t.  I say Congrats and you got a great score from me.  Keep up the good work.  Maybe everyone left their glasses home the day they voted.  Grrrrrr....I am very frusterated that this didn''t do better.  Please forgive me if I''m out of line.  Grrrrrr again.</td>', 'You got RIPPED OFF!!!  If only people would LOOK at the photos!!!  I am totally apaulled.  This is a great photo and should have done WAY better.  I hope you do know that it''s not your fault that this got a low score.  It''s the voters not taking the time to look at the darn photos.  You can tell the people who looked at it, and didn''t.  I say Congrats and you got a great score from me.  Keep up the good work.  Maybe everyone left their glasses home the day they voted.  Grrrrrr....I am very frusterated that this didn''t do better.  Please forgive me if I''m out of line.  Grrrrrr again.', '2002-08-26 02:24:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(108323, 4708, 2937, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a challenge!!! Thank you to all of you who were so positive. Even if I didn''t meet the challenge, there are so many of you who appreciated the pic anyway. Maybe I really was out of mind when I submitted this picture ;-). I even have some really high scores - and I achieved that I would be the taillight. Once again, thank you for your positive comments. <br/>Baldur<br/>Maybe I should be more provocative with my submission. Who ever got 50 comments on a very low rated picture? :-)</td>', 'Wow, what a challenge!!! Thank you to all of you who were so positive. Even if I didn''t meet the challenge, there are so many of you who appreciated the pic anyway. Maybe I really was out of mind when I submitted this picture ;-). I even have some really high scores - and I achieved that I would be the taillight. Once again, thank you for your positive comments. BaldurMaybe I should be more provocative with my submission. Who ever got 50 comments on a very low rated picture? :-)', '2002-08-27 12:59:00.000000', NULL, 0),
