(108336, 4709, 1826, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea. Makes me think of those old abandoned piers you see, with only the pilings left.</td>', 'Very creative idea. Makes me think of those old abandoned piers you see, with only the pilings left.', '2002-08-20 06:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108337, 4709, 3087, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what it is about this one which I like so much, especially where other shots of pencils stuck into the ground don''t appeal. Perhaps it''s the reflections, the light of the water as it slips over the rock they are on, and the wonderful line and colour of the water and waves. Only thing is that the horizon really should be vertical, but I imagine rotation is not allowed. Outside of the challenge, I bet you''ve already corrected it! One other thing, I''d prefer the pencils at the right weren''t cropped. Either included or not, but whole. Really nice shot.<br/>8, Kavey</td>', 'I don''t know what it is about this one which I like so much, especially where other shots of pencils stuck into the ground don''t appeal. Perhaps it''s the reflections, the light of the water as it slips over the rock they are on, and the wonderful line and colour of the water and waves. Only thing is that the horizon really should be vertical, but I imagine rotation is not allowed. Outside of the challenge, I bet you''ve already corrected it! One other thing, I''d prefer the pencils at the right weren''t cropped. Either included or not, but whole. Really nice shot.8, Kavey', '2002-08-20 07:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108338, 4709, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent idea :)  I am not able to draw the association with the title though... I would love to hear your idea behind that :)  When I saw this, I was thinking that 1944 would be a good title.  This reminds me of the barricades that were on the French beaches during the allied invasion of France during world war 2 :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'excellent idea :)  I am not able to draw the association with the title though... I would love to hear your idea behind that :)  When I saw this, I was thinking that 1944 would be a good title.  This reminds me of the barricades that were on the French beaches during the allied invasion of France during world war 2 :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-20 07:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
