(108345, 4709, 2023, '<td valign="top">Great idea!! I like the waves on top of the picture also.</td>', 'Great idea!! I like the waves on top of the picture also.', '2002-08-21 18:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108346, 4709, 2928, '<td valign="top">The idea of being invaded by pencils is amusing and you have captured a superb re-enactment involving a division of brave and battle hardened pencil warriors :o)  I really love the composition - specially the view out to sea with all the breaking waves.  It''s not cluttered and there was no need  so I''m really glad you didn''t  to throw tomato sauce all over the place to add effect.  Overall, this is a very surreal idea, but, none-the-less, a really goods one I hope I''ve interpreted this correctly  otherwise I''m going to look a chump (10)</td>', 'The idea of being invaded by pencils is amusing and you have captured a superb re-enactment involving a division of brave and battle hardened pencil warriors :o)  I really love the composition - specially the view out to sea with all the breaking waves.  It''s not cluttered and there was no need  so I''m really glad you didn''t  to throw tomato sauce all over the place to add effect.  Overall, this is a very surreal idea, but, none-the-less, a really goods one I hope I''ve interpreted this correctly  otherwise I''m going to look a chump (10)', '2002-08-22 13:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108347, 4709, 1856, '<td valign="top">lol...i love this for it''s sense of humor...great job!  Lisa</td>', 'lol...i love this for it''s sense of humor...great job!  Lisa', '2002-08-23 23:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108348, 4709, 2238, '<td valign="top">You must have got some very strange looks from passers by</td>', 'You must have got some very strange looks from passers by', '2002-08-24 18:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108349, 4709, 637, '<td valign="top">don''t get the connection to 1492 or columbus 4 sjgleah</td>', 'don''t get the connection to 1492 or columbus 4 sjgleah', '2002-08-24 19:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108350, 4709, 1128, '<td valign="top">Good, but where are the native pencils that were already there?   :)</td>', 'Good, but where are the native pencils that were already there?   :)', '2002-08-25 23:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108351, 4709, 3080, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title...but than again, I don''t really need to.  This looks interesting and kind of disturbing.  That dark goo looks like it''s getting ready to eat someone.  Lots of pencils.  Definately meets the challenge.  Angle and lighting are good.  Frame placement is also good.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t get the title...but than again, I don''t really need to.  This looks interesting and kind of disturbing.  That dark goo looks like it''s getting ready to eat someone.  Lots of pencils.  Definately meets the challenge.  Angle and lighting are good.  Frame placement is also good.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-26 00:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108352, 4709, 2472, '<td valign="top">Well, at least I had a lot of fun taking these pictures during my beach weekend... (I would like to share some of the out-takes from this challenge, it was probably my hardest yet to choose from one single photo). <br/><br/>There was nothing strange under the pencils, just plain sea water returning over a little ditch I carved in front of the pencils for that purpose. My idea was to get into focus the 3 background layers of waves, the moving water under the pencils, and the pencils, with as much detail as possible with my actual camera.<br/><br/>I was thinking of the landing from the 3 caravels from Columbuss journey, thus the little understood title.<br/><br/>jsabbarton''s interpretation was right on the money, and I believe jmsetzler''s was just as good; I was happy of the fact that you caught my idea.<br/><br/>Thanks to all for your time to comment on my effort.<br/></td>', 'Well, at least I had a lot of fun taking these pictures during my beach weekend... (I would like to share some of the out-takes from this challenge, it was probably my hardest yet to choose from one single photo). There was nothing strange under the pencils, just plain sea water returning over a little ditch I carved in front of the pencils for that purpose. My idea was to get into focus the 3 background layers of waves, the moving water under the pencils, and the pencils, with as much detail as possible with my actual camera.I was thinking of the landing from the 3 caravels from Columbuss journey, thus the little understood title.jsabbarton''s interpretation was right on the money, and I believe jmsetzler''s was just as good; I was happy of the fact that you caught my idea.Thanks to all for your time to comment on my effort.', '2002-08-26 01:49:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(108353, 4711, 3273, '<td valign="top">The top of the longest pencil seems slightly out of focus.  The blue background would have been better if it were smoother without a grain.  Nice idea.</td>', 'The top of the longest pencil seems slightly out of focus.  The blue background would have been better if it were smoother without a grain.  Nice idea.', '2002-08-19 05:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108354, 4711, 806, '<td valign="top">Good composition - leads my eye up the "steps" to the point of the sharpened pencil... which is then slightly out of focus. I''d like to see that in focus as the subject seems to be the tips of the pencils. I like the dof, don''t get me wrong. Everything in sharp focus would just be flat....just needs to have the attention shifted.</td>', 'Good composition - leads my eye up the "steps" to the point of the sharpened pencil... which is then slightly out of focus. I''d like to see that in focus as the subject seems to be the tips of the pencils. I like the dof, don''t get me wrong. Everything in sharp focus would just be flat....just needs to have the attention shifted.', '2002-08-19 10:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108355, 4711, 2223, '<td valign="top">this is very original! maybe the background could have been a different color because its kind of an eyesore for me, maybe a little saturation in the colors would brighten it.</td>', 'this is very original! maybe the background could have been a different color because its kind of an eyesore for me, maybe a little saturation in the colors would brighten it.', '2002-08-19 11:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108356, 4711, 2928, '<td valign="top">Clever idea.  Slightly sharper image would have help this a lot</td>', 'Clever idea.  Slightly sharper image would have help this a lot', '2002-08-19 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108357, 4711, 2343, '<td valign="top">It''s great except for the background and the lack of focus on the sharpest pencil.</td>', 'It''s great except for the background and the lack of focus on the sharpest pencil.', '2002-08-19 13:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108358, 4711, 2152, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but I think you could have done some things better.  A little more light on the pencils would help them stand out more.  Also, you might want to set them up a few feet in front of the background to give some depth.  The tip of the pencils at the far right and far left are out of focus.  This could use a little counter-clockwise rotation and you should save at the best quality that gives you a file less than 150k.  There are some jpeg artifacts.</td>', 'Nice idea, but I think you could have done some things better.  A little more light on the pencils would help them stand out more.  Also, you might want to set them up a few feet in front of the background to give some depth.  The tip of the pencils at the far right and far left are out of focus.  This could use a little counter-clockwise rotation and you should save at the best quality that gives you a file less than 150k.  There are some jpeg artifacts.', '2002-08-19 14:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108359, 4711, 1543, '<td valign="top">clever.</td>', 'clever.', '2002-08-19 18:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
