(108363, 4711, 3087, '<td valign="top">Like the textures and colours very much, though think the yellow would sing out more with a little more light on it. Would prefer if pencils were more accurately vertical.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'Like the textures and colours very much, though think the yellow would sing out more with a little more light on it. Would prefer if pencils were more accurately vertical.Kavey', '2002-08-20 18:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108364, 4711, 2000, '<td valign="top">This might work better with a smoother background.  The texture there sort of washes out the depth and detail of the pencil points.</td>', 'This might work better with a smoother background.  The texture there sort of washes out the depth and detail of the pencil points.', '2002-08-21 11:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108365, 4711, 875, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I like the sweep of the curve.  I think I would have focused on the tip of the final pencil and let the other ones blur a little instead of the reverse.<br/></td>', 'Nice idea.  I like the sweep of the curve.  I think I would have focused on the tip of the final pencil and let the other ones blur a little instead of the reverse.', '2002-08-21 16:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108366, 4711, 3080, '<td valign="top">You did a great job of lining up the edge of the pencils with the edge of the photo.  This idea is great and I love the background.  Now, I know this is getting picky, and it doesn''t affect my score in any way, but ther seems to be a blemish in the background on the left hand side just over half way up.  Like I said, doen''t affect my rating, just an observation.  The lighting is beautiful.  I love how the yellow pencils seem to stand out on the blue background.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'You did a great job of lining up the edge of the pencils with the edge of the photo.  This idea is great and I love the background.  Now, I know this is getting picky, and it doesn''t affect my score in any way, but ther seems to be a blemish in the background on the left hand side just over half way up.  Like I said, doen''t affect my rating, just an observation.  The lighting is beautiful.  I love how the yellow pencils seem to stand out on the blue background.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-23 15:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
