(108373, 4713, 2586, '<td valign="top">Good title (hope everybody gets it). The picture is silly and actually quite meaningless but fun. I find the tablecloth acting as the background a little too heavy and overwhelming. A black solid  background would have worked better I think. Also find the reflection of the pencil and tutu a bit too much. Did you consider cropping just below the point? Fun idea though.</td>', 'Good title (hope everybody gets it). The picture is silly and actually quite meaningless but fun. I find the tablecloth acting as the background a little too heavy and overwhelming. A black solid  background would have worked better I think. Also find the reflection of the pencil and tutu a bit too much. Did you consider cropping just below the point? Fun idea though.', '2002-08-19 02:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
