(108389, 4713, 2928, '<td valign="top">I hope everybody gets en pointe of the ballet connection  its funny, the idea of a pencil in a tutu is superb.  Wit aside, its one thing to have a good idea, another to make it a good shot You have excelled yourself in that area as well.  This is an easy 10, I cant fault the shot Good luck, I hope this does as well as your imagination deserves</td>', 'I hope everybody gets en pointe of the ballet connection  its funny, the idea of a pencil in a tutu is superb.  Wit aside, its one thing to have a good idea, another to make it a good shot You have excelled yourself in that area as well.  This is an easy 10, I cant fault the shot Good luck, I hope this does as well as your imagination deserves', '2002-08-20 15:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
