(108393, 4713, 3087, '<td valign="top">Cute! I love the reflection in the polished floor. I think this also benefits from the non centred composition. I don''t like the "stage curtain" texture (but please don''t think I am insulting your house interiors!). <br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'Cute! I love the reflection in the polished floor. I think this also benefits from the non centred composition. I don''t like the "stage curtain" texture (but please don''t think I am insulting your house interiors!). 5, Kavey', '2002-08-20 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
