(108401, 4713, 2158, '<td valign="top">Very nice, but I''d have cropped a bit closer to get rid of the white reflection at the bottom.</td>', 'Very nice, but I''d have cropped a bit closer to get rid of the white reflection at the bottom.', '2002-08-21 22:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108402, 4713, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  The photo is a little dark for my taste, but I know you did it to emphasize the light on the pencil''s tutu.  It has great effect, but I think it would have been more powerful if the light didn''t spill onto the curtain to the left of the pencil.  It looks great spilling onto the curtain behind the pencil, but for some reason, that other little spot of light is distracting.  I love how you tied the ribbon on to represent the pencils slippers.  Very creative. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very cute.  The photo is a little dark for my taste, but I know you did it to emphasize the light on the pencil''s tutu.  It has great effect, but I think it would have been more powerful if the light didn''t spill onto the curtain to the left of the pencil.  It looks great spilling onto the curtain behind the pencil, but for some reason, that other little spot of light is distracting.  I love how you tied the ribbon on to represent the pencils slippers.  Very creative. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-22 12:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
