(108498, 4724, 3080, '<td valign="top">Looks like the effect from shutter speed.  I read that this is the image that it produces when you change the shutter speed.  I could be wrong, but however it''s done, it''s a pretty neat effect.  If you had done it with the lead side of the pencil rather than the eraser side, it would match up better with your title.  the lighting is great and although the hands at the top are kind of strange looking, they are important to the photo.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like the effect from shutter speed.  I read that this is the image that it produces when you change the shutter speed.  I could be wrong, but however it''s done, it''s a pretty neat effect.  If you had done it with the lead side of the pencil rather than the eraser side, it would match up better with your title.  the lighting is great and although the hands at the top are kind of strange looking, they are important to the photo.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-22 11:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
