(108536, 4726, 3275, '<td valign="top">Excellent work!</td>', 'Excellent work!', '2002-08-25 19:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108537, 4726, 472, '<td valign="top">thanks for your comments... i had to crop the bottom thusly for a couple reasons. <br/><br/>a) the pencil was small in relation to the cup, and showing more cup would have unbalanced the pencil part<br/><br/>b) the cup was on something that i didnt want to show.<br/><br/>the white white background is the result of using a white sheet with a 500 W light behind it so that it glows.  there is a another light up and camera right providing the highlight on the pencil and cup :)</td>', 'thanks for your comments... i had to crop the bottom thusly for a couple reasons. a) the pencil was small in relation to the cup, and showing more cup would have unbalanced the pencil partb) the cup was on something that i didnt want to show.the white white background is the result of using a white sheet with a 500 W light behind it so that it glows.  there is a another light up and camera right providing the highlight on the pencil and cup :)', '2002-08-26 11:29:00.000000', NULL, 0),
