(108556, 4729, 2261, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo, great idea. Love the vivid green.</td>', 'Excellent photo, great idea. Love the vivid green.', '2002-08-19 15:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108557, 4729, 806, '<td valign="top">This is wacky! What made you think of this. All I can remember is my college modern art professor saying "and, *why* did you choose to make a giant sized tape dispenser?". My answer: "why not?". So, in the spirit of modern art and unique composition, I give you an 8 because the highlights on the right are a bit over exposed. - that fixed would make this a 9 in my mind. thanks for sharing!</td>', 'This is wacky! What made you think of this. All I can remember is my college modern art professor saying "and, *why* did you choose to make a giant sized tape dispenser?". My answer: "why not?". So, in the spirit of modern art and unique composition, I give you an 8 because the highlights on the right are a bit over exposed. - that fixed would make this a 9 in my mind. thanks for sharing!', '2002-08-19 17:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108558, 4729, 1779, '<td valign="top">the idea is great but I think the composition could''ve been so much better. why a transparent plate? good effort.</td>', 'the idea is great but I think the composition could''ve been so much better. why a transparent plate? good effort.', '2002-08-19 18:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
