(108597, 4729, 2000, '<td valign="top">I understand the need for fiber, but is that really necessary?  ;-)<br/>The lighting is pretty good, and most of the replections work well.  The shadow across the plate, however, is a bit distracting.</td>', 'I understand the need for fiber, but is that really necessary?  ;-)The lighting is pretty good, and most of the replections work well.  The shadow across the plate, however, is a bit distracting.', '2002-08-22 16:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
