(108630, 4730, 2257, '<td valign="top">Very creative.</td>', 'Very creative.', '2002-08-21 13:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108631, 4730, 3220, '<td valign="top">poor dremel... :(   i''m even sorrier for the pencil. 9!</td>', 'poor dremel... :(   i''m even sorrier for the pencil. 9!', '2002-08-21 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108632, 4730, 3087, '<td valign="top">Like the DOF and the way the cutting thingy comes out towards you like that. Reminds me of a childhood snake toy thing, and the composition and shapes and so on just appeal. I am not really sure why but I do like it. :)<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Like the DOF and the way the cutting thingy comes out towards you like that. Reminds me of a childhood snake toy thing, and the composition and shapes and so on just appeal. I am not really sure why but I do like it. :)6, Kavey', '2002-08-21 19:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108633, 4730, 2667, '<td valign="top">very interesting. it is a nice composition and it begs the question: why? but it does look neat.  (6)   ~mcmurma</td>', 'very interesting. it is a nice composition and it begs the question: why? but it does look neat.  (6)   ~mcmurma', '2002-08-23 01:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108634, 4730, 2152, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  A little more curve in the cut up pencil might be nice.  I''d also like to see just a bit more DOF so the eraser was in focus.</td>', 'Nice shot.  A little more curve in the cut up pencil might be nice.  I''d also like to see just a bit more DOF so the eraser was in focus.', '2002-08-23 18:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108635, 4730, 1808, '<td valign="top">Poor, poor pencil.</td>', 'Poor, poor pencil.', '2002-08-25 18:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108636, 4731, 3095, '<td valign="top">If only the colour would JUMP! Maybe a tighter crop... ? Opinions... opinions! ;)</td>', 'If only the colour would JUMP! Maybe a tighter crop... ? Opinions... opinions! ;)', '2002-08-19 02:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108637, 4731, 1826, '<td valign="top">This is cool. :)</td>', 'This is cool. :)', '2002-08-19 07:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108638, 4731, 2172, '<td valign="top">Great job.  How''d you get them to stay - I tried crazy glue and it wouldn''t stick! (only stuck to my arm lol)  Nice job here - I like the composition.  One small thing - I''m liking the white - seems a little on the grey/grainy side (but could be me).  Still, great work!.   8<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Great job.  How''d you get them to stay - I tried crazy glue and it wouldn''t stick! (only stuck to my arm lol)  Nice job here - I like the composition.  One small thing - I''m liking the white - seems a little on the grey/grainy side (but could be me).  Still, great work!.   8Ruthann', '2002-08-19 10:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108639, 4731, 2256, '<td valign="top">add this to the "how''d they do that" segment!</td>', 'add this to the "how''d they do that" segment!', '2002-08-19 11:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108640, 4731, 3280, '<td valign="top">I like it.  Perhaps a little more DOF so that the star was sharper as the focal point...</td>', 'I like it.  Perhaps a little more DOF so that the star was sharper as the focal point...', '2002-08-19 11:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108641, 4731, 2553, '<td valign="top">I love this simple, but very creative shot ! Your setup is wonderful, as is the composition.  Great work ! lhall-9</td>', 'I love this simple, but very creative shot ! Your setup is wonderful, as is the composition.  Great work ! lhall-9', '2002-08-19 11:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108642, 4731, 2170, '<td valign="top">Looks like a signpost!  LOL.  I love it.</td>', 'Looks like a signpost!  LOL.  I love it.', '2002-08-19 15:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108643, 4731, 1280, '<td valign="top">good use of shadows....simple, uncluttered background.  Nice...Grayce...aka...Gracious</td>', 'good use of shadows....simple, uncluttered background.  Nice...Grayce...aka...Gracious', '2002-08-19 19:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108644, 4731, 3080, '<td valign="top">The shadow in this is great.  The lighting is just perfect fot this.  I like the angle.   I wonder if it would look the same with bright colorful pencils?  colorful pencils might draw attention away from the star.  Very clever idea.  Great shot and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The shadow in this is great.  The lighting is just perfect fot this.  I like the angle.   I wonder if it would look the same with bright colorful pencils?  colorful pencils might draw attention away from the star.  Very clever idea.  Great shot and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-19 21:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108645, 4731, 472, '<td valign="top">beautiiful shadow</td>', 'beautiiful shadow', '2002-08-19 21:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108646, 4731, 3378, '<td valign="top">Great idea!</td>', 'Great idea!', '2002-08-19 23:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
