(108668, 4731, 2596, '<td valign="top">Thinks for the nice comments and I´m glad that I got number 32. So I´m still climping up towards the first place. I´m doing a lot better this week. Again Thanks everybody for liking my work</td>', 'Thinks for the nice comments and I´m glad that I got number 32. So I´m still climping up towards the first place. I´m doing a lot better this week. Again Thanks everybody for liking my work', '2002-08-26 08:48:00.000000', NULL, 0),
