(108671, 4732, 327, '<td valign="top">I would of like a smaller pencil, to see more of the angel on a dark background.<br/>Sorry but really feel that would of helped here. Still nice try. Score 6 ~Kee</td>', 'I would of like a smaller pencil, to see more of the angel on a dark background.Sorry but really feel that would of helped here. Still nice try. Score 6 ~Kee', '2002-08-19 19:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
