(108675, 4732, 2295, '<td valign="top">Well done.  Focus looks pretty good.  Lighting looks good.  Meets the challenge.</td>', 'Well done.  Focus looks pretty good.  Lighting looks good.  Meets the challenge.', '2002-08-21 12:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108676, 4732, 3087, '<td valign="top">I think this is lovely in layout and a feel-good photo. For me the shadow beneath the wing is too dark compared to the strong light coming from behind his head. <br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'I think this is lovely in layout and a feel-good photo. For me the shadow beneath the wing is too dark compared to the strong light coming from behind his head. 6, Kavey', '2002-08-21 20:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108677, 4732, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing5,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,<br/>Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing5,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool', '2002-08-22 10:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108678, 4732, 3080, '<td valign="top">That worked out perfectly, didn''t it?  I would like to see it with the little cherub moved down just a slight bit so as to not cut off the top of his head and wing.  The wing looks a bit dark, but since the other shadows are so mellow, I am led to believe that that is due to the actual color of the wing, and not a lighting effect.  Otherwise, great photo. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'That worked out perfectly, didn''t it?  I would like to see it with the little cherub moved down just a slight bit so as to not cut off the top of his head and wing.  The wing looks a bit dark, but since the other shadows are so mellow, I am led to believe that that is due to the actual color of the wing, and not a lighting effect.  Otherwise, great photo. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-22 12:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108679, 4732, 2158, '<td valign="top">This photo isn''t as sharp as it should be.  Also I''d have preferred it if you''d used a pencil with a point.</td>', 'This photo isn''t as sharp as it should be.  Also I''d have preferred it if you''d used a pencil with a point.', '2002-08-23 21:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108680, 4733, 1827, '<td valign="top">A pencil''s undoing.  I like it.  I love the curves of the wood near the top.  My eye follows the curve around and then rides the lead right back up.  Nice.  8</td>', 'A pencil''s undoing.  I like it.  I love the curves of the wood near the top.  My eye follows the curve around and then rides the lead right back up.  Nice.  8', '2002-08-19 02:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
