(108682, 4733, 2722, '<td valign="top">Nice concept. This is really creative. Is it meant to be geyish in tone? I hope it does well. -7</td>', 'Nice concept. This is really creative. Is it meant to be geyish in tone? I hope it does well. -7', '2002-08-19 13:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
