(108719, 4735, 3080, '<td valign="top">Oh how I wish this were a bit more in focus, and a bit brighter.  I am afraid that people (as I almost did) will miss the desk.  I know, it''s a pretty obvious thing, but if you''re not looking for it, it could sneak out as a regular ol table.  Also, the pencil could have been moved down a tiny tiny bit so that we would be viewing the pencil lead with the book as a background, so it didnt get lost in the darkness.  I love the angle.  wouldn''t have changed that at all.  Great shot and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Oh how I wish this were a bit more in focus, and a bit brighter.  I am afraid that people (as I almost did) will miss the desk.  I know, it''s a pretty obvious thing, but if you''re not looking for it, it could sneak out as a regular ol table.  Also, the pencil could have been moved down a tiny tiny bit so that we would be viewing the pencil lead with the book as a background, so it didnt get lost in the darkness.  I love the angle.  wouldn''t have changed that at all.  Great shot and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-19 13:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
