(108755, 4737, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like your idea for this photo.  The angle is great, although I might have pulled it back a slight bit, maybe to get the D in dear all the way into the photo.  The Rings and the pencil are very clear, but the wording kind of gets lost to the left.  I don''t think it would need to be totally clear, but it seems like it''s almost been lost from the photo.  Maybe you meant to do it that way, I guess we can see the parts that are important in understanding what the photo is about. The rings are beautiful.  Very nice and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like your idea for this photo.  The angle is great, although I might have pulled it back a slight bit, maybe to get the D in dear all the way into the photo.  The Rings and the pencil are very clear, but the wording kind of gets lost to the left.  I don''t think it would need to be totally clear, but it seems like it''s almost been lost from the photo.  Maybe you meant to do it that way, I guess we can see the parts that are important in understanding what the photo is about. The rings are beautiful.  Very nice and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-21 11:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108756, 4737, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent black and white... I love the contrast and the shadows on the pencil.  The rings also add a really nice touch to this ''dear john'' letter.  The only thing I don''t like about this image is that the handwriting has not maintained an even level of darkness in the photo.. This is probably due to the post processing... good shot :) = 9 - jmsetzler</td>', 'excellent black and white... I love the contrast and the shadows on the pencil.  The rings also add a really nice touch to this ''dear john'' letter.  The only thing I don''t like about this image is that the handwriting has not maintained an even level of darkness in the photo.. This is probably due to the post processing... good shot :) = 9 - jmsetzler', '2002-08-21 12:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108757, 4737, 811, '<td valign="top">This picture has a bleak feel to it (assume it is purposeful) and I like teh detail shown on the pencil and rings.  Maybe a touch blown out on the left, but I''m not sure if that is detracting or not. karmat</td>', 'This picture has a bleak feel to it (assume it is purposeful) and I like teh detail shown on the pencil and rings.  Maybe a touch blown out on the left, but I''m not sure if that is detracting or not. karmat', '2002-08-21 15:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
