(108759, 4737, 1759, '<td valign="top">Very good storytelling! The arrangement works well; it is balanced, clean, and sharp. The one nitpick is that the text seems to have gotten somewhat washed out by the lighting. Might have worked better with multiple lights or a bit more diffusion on the key light.</td>', 'Very good storytelling! The arrangement works well; it is balanced, clean, and sharp. The one nitpick is that the text seems to have gotten somewhat washed out by the lighting. Might have worked better with multiple lights or a bit more diffusion on the key light.', '2002-08-21 22:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
