(108766, 4737, 1042, '<td valign="top">I really like to see a good setup...this tells so much of a story and I love it. The letter....the wedding set....the nervously chewn pencil. I love the contrasts and the detail...great job. 9</td>', 'I really like to see a good setup...this tells so much of a story and I love it. The letter....the wedding set....the nervously chewn pencil. I love the contrasts and the detail...great job. 9', '2002-08-25 11:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108767, 4737, 2223, '<td valign="top">Composition is good, this photograph is telling me that it is a letter to dear john, focusing on the pencil.<br/>Background: the words on the left side are a bit washed out and not uniform with the rest. The left side of the pencil is also washed out a bit.<br/>Technical: the focus is mainly on the pencil, where it should be, as the point of interest. The 2 rings are also clearly in focus and adds to the overall feel of the photograph.<br/>Good use of B&amp;W, maybe needs more contrast.<br/>Overall, a vey well taken emotional photo.<br/></td>', 'Composition is good, this photograph is telling me that it is a letter to dear john, focusing on the pencil.Background: the words on the left side are a bit washed out and not uniform with the rest. The left side of the pencil is also washed out a bit.Technical: the focus is mainly on the pencil, where it should be, as the point of interest. The 2 rings are also clearly in focus and adds to the overall feel of the photograph.Good use of B&W, maybe needs more contrast.Overall, a vey well taken emotional photo.', '2002-11-24 19:23:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(108768, 4740, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is adorable.  The message is really clear.  Even without the title it is great.  Focus is a bit soft on the pencil seeds, but that does''t take anything away from the photo.  Lighting is great, angle is good.  Maybe could have tried it with the sign a little more vertical.  Overall great shot.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'This is adorable.  The message is really clear.  Even without the title it is great.  Focus is a bit soft on the pencil seeds, but that does''t take anything away from the photo.  Lighting is great, angle is good.  Maybe could have tried it with the sign a little more vertical.  Overall great shot.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-19 12:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108769, 4740, 2170, '<td valign="top">By far the best of the garden-variety (ha ha) pencil shots.</td>', 'By far the best of the garden-variety (ha ha) pencil shots.', '2002-08-19 15:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
