(108793, 4742, 3044, '<td valign="top">i like this idea. i would probably have used a different color pencil. one that doesnt blend in with the colors of the dragon. maybe find a pencil that is the same color as the eyes. the shot is a little to straight on for me. i would like to see it with a different background. maybe a similar color to the eyes with a narrow dof. nice effort.</td>', 'i like this idea. i would probably have used a different color pencil. one that doesnt blend in with the colors of the dragon. maybe find a pencil that is the same color as the eyes. the shot is a little to straight on for me. i would like to see it with a different background. maybe a similar color to the eyes with a narrow dof. nice effort.', '2002-08-21 15:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
