(108796, 4742, 3080, '<td valign="top">this is a scary lookin fella.  Is he really a pencil holder?  this is great use of a pencil for a photo and I like the originality.  great background and lighting.  focus and frame placement are also very good.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'this is a scary lookin fella.  Is he really a pencil holder?  this is great use of a pencil for a photo and I like the originality.  great background and lighting.  focus and frame placement are also very good.  good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-26 00:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108797, 4743, 1827, '<td valign="top">Black and white might have worked nicely if the photo had some real lights and darks, but everything being equal, you ended up with a very gray photo.  Also, I would like the point to have been in focus, but then perhaps it wouldn''t have had the illusion of depth that it currently does.  5</td>', 'Black and white might have worked nicely if the photo had some real lights and darks, but everything being equal, you ended up with a very gray photo.  Also, I would like the point to have been in focus, but then perhaps it wouldn''t have had the illusion of depth that it currently does.  5', '2002-08-19 03:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108798, 4743, 772, '<td valign="top">This photo needs some contrast... there is not enough tone variation here... the point of the pencil being out of focus doesn''t work well for me either.  Maybe if the lighting was stronger, the extra contrast would be here... - jmsetzler</td>', 'This photo needs some contrast... there is not enough tone variation here... the point of the pencil being out of focus doesn''t work well for me either.  Maybe if the lighting was stronger, the extra contrast would be here... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-19 07:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
