(108817, 4743, 2867, '<td valign="top">I''d rather see the tip of the pencil in focus and the back out of focus. I put this in photoshop and i like it much better with more contrast and brightness.</td>', 'I''d rather see the tip of the pencil in focus and the back out of focus. I put this in photoshop and i like it much better with more contrast and brightness.', '2002-08-22 15:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
