(108969, 4751, 811, '<td valign="top">At first, i though the brown (floor?) at the top was distracting, but as i take a second glance, i think it helps compliment the angle of teh pencil, etc.  Good focus and lighting. karmat</td>', 'At first, i though the brown (floor?) at the top was distracting, but as i take a second glance, i think it helps compliment the angle of teh pencil, etc.  Good focus and lighting. karmat', '2002-08-21 16:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108970, 4751, 3080, '<td valign="top">I have to wonder if the eyes light up when  you stick the pencil in his mouth.  is this an actual pencil sharpener, or just a clever place to stick a pencil.  The lighting and the angle are both good, however I think the wooden strip at the top of the photo is a little distracting from the photo.  Overall great idea.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I have to wonder if the eyes light up when  you stick the pencil in his mouth.  is this an actual pencil sharpener, or just a clever place to stick a pencil.  The lighting and the angle are both good, however I think the wooden strip at the top of the photo is a little distracting from the photo.  Overall great idea.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-22 11:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108971, 4751, 2427, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure who this hurts more...<br/>Anyway, looks like a cool sharpener.</td>', 'I''m not sure who this hurts more...Anyway, looks like a cool sharpener.', '2002-08-24 23:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
