(108993, 4752, 2204, '<td valign="top">At first glance I wasn''t impressed.  However, upon a closer look I see the merits and creativity of this photo.  How in the world did you get this pencil to look the color of raw meat.  Good DOF and lighting.  Impressive and creative. =6 syamjonimi ;''-D<br/>Second review = 8</td>', 'At first glance I wasn''t impressed.  However, upon a closer look I see the merits and creativity of this photo.  How in the world did you get this pencil to look the color of raw meat.  Good DOF and lighting.  Impressive and creative. =6 syamjonimi ;''-DSecond review = 8', '2002-08-21 02:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108994, 4752, 2997, '<td valign="top">This macro shot is wonderful and unique in this challenge.</td>', 'This macro shot is wonderful and unique in this challenge.', '2002-08-21 03:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108995, 4752, 3031, '<td valign="top">Very creative! Great idea. Could have used some real green like leaves to make it even more look like a flower?</td>', 'Very creative! Great idea. Could have used some real green like leaves to make it even more look like a flower?', '2002-08-21 04:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108996, 4752, 2437, '<td valign="top">creative<br/>colors are not so good</td>', 'creativecolors are not so good', '2002-08-21 08:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(108997, 4752, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice and creative idea!  Looks like it could be a black eyed susan.  :)  The angle is great and it is framed very nicely.  Lighting is good.  Not too bright and not too dark.  Great idea and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice and creative idea!  Looks like it could be a black eyed susan.  :)  The angle is great and it is framed very nicely.  Lighting is good.  Not too bright and not too dark.  Great idea and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-21 12:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
