(108999, 4752, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the depth of field this is using, and I like the detail that is visible.  Good job. karmat</td>', 'I like the depth of field this is using, and I like the detail that is visible.  Good job. karmat', '2002-08-21 15:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
