(109006, 4752, 1796, '<td valign="top">great idea! I think I would have liked a little more DOF and the colors seem a bit off, but I might be wrong on that. Something other than grey as the background color might have brought the flower out even more. 7 beegee</td>', 'great idea! I think I would have liked a little more DOF and the colors seem a bit off, but I might be wrong on that. Something other than grey as the background color might have brought the flower out even more. 7 beegee', '2002-08-22 23:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109007, 4752, 259, '<td valign="top">one of the ugliest flowers i have seen, but nice idea, and i dont think that a pencil flower would ever look good.</td>', 'one of the ugliest flowers i have seen, but nice idea, and i dont think that a pencil flower would ever look good.', '2002-08-23 03:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109008, 4752, 3294, '<td valign="top">Very interesting!  I really like the golden tips on the leafs!.</td>', 'Very interesting!  I really like the golden tips on the leafs!.', '2002-08-23 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109009, 4752, 1019, '<td valign="top">Very clever--reminds me of a radish rose--andrewm</td>', 'Very clever--reminds me of a radish rose--andrewm', '2002-08-23 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109010, 4752, 142, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the background as grey but it is a little lighter than other backgrounds.  It doesn''t matter anyway in my opinion because I think the lighter color blends in and enhances the out of focus details and helps to draw the eye to the pencil point.  This is a great macro and very imaginative.  Good luck! shortredneck</td>', 'I don''t see the background as grey but it is a little lighter than other backgrounds.  It doesn''t matter anyway in my opinion because I think the lighter color blends in and enhances the out of focus details and helps to draw the eye to the pencil point.  This is a great macro and very imaginative.  Good luck! shortredneck', '2002-08-24 11:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109011, 4752, 2009, '<td valign="top">How very clever.</td>', 'How very clever.', '2002-08-24 20:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109012, 4752, 2427, '<td valign="top">Good one!</td>', 'Good one!', '2002-08-24 23:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109013, 4752, 1808, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, but kind of a scary looking result.</td>', 'Nice concept, but kind of a scary looking result.', '2002-08-25 18:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109014, 4752, 3504, '<td valign="top">this is so cool! I had a hard time seeing the pencil.<br/>good work, on the photo and the flower!</td>', 'this is so cool! I had a hard time seeing the pencil.good work, on the photo and the flower!', '2002-08-25 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
