(109019, 4753, 1543, '<td valign="top">like the tiitle.</td>', 'like the tiitle.', '2002-08-19 18:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109020, 4753, 2586, '<td valign="top">I just knew that someone would submit a pencil on fire. The effect of the pencils en masse is very nice. So, is the burning pencil. Overall though when I look at this I find the image rather contrived and say "So what?". What''s the photographer trying to convey other than presenting me with some cool effects. 5 Journey</td>', 'I just knew that someone would submit a pencil on fire. The effect of the pencils en masse is very nice. So, is the burning pencil. Overall though when I look at this I find the image rather contrived and say "So what?". What''s the photographer trying to convey other than presenting me with some cool effects. 5 Journey', '2002-08-20 00:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109021, 4753, 2204, '<td valign="top">Smashing Hot idea....now what you going to do with all those pencils?????  The best part is the pencil point in the flame. =8 syamjonimi</td>', 'Smashing Hot idea....now what you going to do with all those pencils?????  The best part is the pencil point in the flame. =8 syamjonimi', '2002-08-20 02:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109022, 4753, 1280, '<td valign="top">Strong image, good dof, good coloring.</td>', 'Strong image, good dof, good coloring.', '2002-08-20 10:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109023, 4753, 2881, '<td valign="top">I love it when a picture evokes some emotional response from me... and my favorite is humour.  Thanks for making me laugh. Not only is it imaginative and innovative... it''s a good picture too. LOVE the title!</td>', 'I love it when a picture evokes some emotional response from me... and my favorite is humour.  Thanks for making me laugh. Not only is it imaginative and innovative... it''s a good picture too. LOVE the title!', '2002-08-20 12:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109024, 4753, 2172, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!  I like the composition and the angle.  Excellent shot - you can clearly see the pencil tip throught the flame.  (If I had to mention anything at all, would be the {dare I say} slight glare in the front.)  I still enjoyed this very much.  Great work  10<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Very nicely done!  I like the composition and the angle.  Excellent shot - you can clearly see the pencil tip throught the flame.  (If I had to mention anything at all, would be the {dare I say} slight glare in the front.)  I still enjoyed this very much.  Great work  10Ruthann', '2002-08-20 15:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109025, 4753, 875, '<td valign="top">Great idea, nice framing, and good color.  I''ll even forgive you for the pun.  ;-)<br/></td>', 'Great idea, nice framing, and good color.  I''ll even forgive you for the pun.  ;-)', '2002-08-20 16:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109026, 4753, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours, form and idea, not 100% sure about the cropping.  (Just my tastes).<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Lovely colours, form and idea, not 100% sure about the cropping.  (Just my tastes).6, Kavey', '2002-08-20 18:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109027, 4753, 2752, '<td valign="top">Great set up and composition..</td>', 'Great set up and composition..', '2002-08-20 20:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109028, 4753, 3162, '<td valign="top">I like this as a photo. Looks like a lot of effort. I rating based on my beleif that this is a product of the camera and your imagination. Not Pshop''d.</td>', 'I like this as a photo. Looks like a lot of effort. I rating based on my beleif that this is a product of the camera and your imagination. Not Pshop''d.', '2002-08-21 12:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
