(109039, 4754, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,<br/>Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool', '2002-08-20 20:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109040, 4754, 2466, '<td valign="top">wonderful macro, rich colors and great angles.  The shot''s a good solid photo, stock photo-ish, and nicely done.</td>', 'wonderful macro, rich colors and great angles.  The shot''s a good solid photo, stock photo-ish, and nicely done.', '2002-08-21 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109041, 4754, 3080, '<td valign="top">Clever photo.  I like how you turned the calculator upside down for the shot and how you incooperated the pencil.  I also love the paper in the background, it adds a great touch.  Lighting, angle and focus are good.  I like the soft focus on the paper.  However, I''m having trouble with the title. (just trying to clarify, titles don''t affect my rating)  I wasn''t sure what a stylus was, so I looked it up.  The definition is a "pointed tool used for writing on wax or carving stencils."  the other definition is "needle like device used to cut records and also to produce sound from those records".  So I am afraid I don''t understand the title, but like I said, it doesn''t affect my rating.  The photo its self is great and that''s really what matters.  Good job and good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Clever photo.  I like how you turned the calculator upside down for the shot and how you incooperated the pencil.  I also love the paper in the background, it adds a great touch.  Lighting, angle and focus are good.  I like the soft focus on the paper.  However, I''m having trouble with the title. (just trying to clarify, titles don''t affect my rating)  I wasn''t sure what a stylus was, so I looked it up.  The definition is a "pointed tool used for writing on wax or carving stencils."  the other definition is "needle like device used to cut records and also to produce sound from those records".  So I am afraid I don''t understand the title, but like I said, it doesn''t affect my rating.  The photo its self is great and that''s really what matters.  Good job and good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-21 12:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
