(109046, 4755, 3080, '<td valign="top">FERULE : A rod or stick used for punishing children.<br/>FERRULE: A metal ring or cap strengthening the end of a stick or tube.<br/><br/>Which one were you refering to??  LMAO.  Guess it could be either one.  We got a really good laugh out of this, seeing as that my mom is a teacher.  Pencils do in a way punish children, and this is definately a metal ring or cap.<br/>No pun intended.  Or was it??  Great photo.  A bit dark, but probably nessasary to keep from having a really distracting bright spot.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'FERULE : A rod or stick used for punishing children.FERRULE: A metal ring or cap strengthening the end of a stick or tube.Which one were you refering to??  LMAO.  Guess it could be either one.  We got a really good laugh out of this, seeing as that my mom is a teacher.  Pencils do in a way punish children, and this is definately a metal ring or cap.No pun intended.  Or was it??  Great photo.  A bit dark, but probably nessasary to keep from having a really distracting bright spot.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-19 04:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
