(109055, 4755, 1041, '<td valign="top">i''m sorry, this photo, while meeting the challenge, doesn''t excite me very much.  i think you probably went for those muted, similar colors (no bright yellow or red) deliberately, but personally, i feel they are missing, and the background has a color that''s too similar.  picture also doesn''t seem quite sharp. -- gr8photos (3)</td>', 'i''m sorry, this photo, while meeting the challenge, doesn''t excite me very much.  i think you probably went for those muted, similar colors (no bright yellow or red) deliberately, but personally, i feel they are missing, and the background has a color that''s too similar.  picture also doesn''t seem quite sharp. -- gr8photos (3)', '2002-08-20 12:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
