(109057, 4755, 2170, '<td valign="top">I really like this idea and it''s a great macro shot with good shadows and not a lot of glare (glare on the ferrules was the biggest problem in my photo!).<br/><br/>This would be better, I think, if the colors were more pronounced so that it''s not so washed out.  Or grayscaled?  That might make for an interesting shot as well.  muckpond</td>', 'I really like this idea and it''s a great macro shot with good shadows and not a lot of glare (glare on the ferrules was the biggest problem in my photo!).This would be better, I think, if the colors were more pronounced so that it''s not so washed out.  Or grayscaled?  That might make for an interesting shot as well.  muckpond', '2002-08-20 17:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109058, 4755, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice macro view, but I don''t care for the lighting tint here... If your camera has white balance capabilities, you may want to investiage them.  The white balance would allow this shot to ''glow'' very nicely in the indoor lighting :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a nice macro view, but I don''t care for the lighting tint here... If your camera has white balance capabilities, you may want to investiage them.  The white balance would allow this shot to ''glow'' very nicely in the indoor lighting :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-21 12:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
