(109116, 4760, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great title!  Looks like the cat already did some drawing, you missed it!  (joke)  Very nice pic of the cat, challenge met.  You''re probably going to hate this, but my suggestion:  work the cat for a different expression.  All of my cats are very expressive, esp. with proper motivation.  They hate my camera!  I might not be able to talk to animals, but I can "read" them.  This one is mildly annoyed.  Go for fully annoyed, or confused (cats are soo easy to confuse...) or whatever.  <br/>Nice work!  8 (formally 7) Swash</td>', 'Great title!  Looks like the cat already did some drawing, you missed it!  (joke)  Very nice pic of the cat, challenge met.  You''re probably going to hate this, but my suggestion:  work the cat for a different expression.  All of my cats are very expressive, esp. with proper motivation.  They hate my camera!  I might not be able to talk to animals, but I can "read" them.  This one is mildly annoyed.  Go for fully annoyed, or confused (cats are soo easy to confuse...) or whatever.  Nice work!  8 (formally 7) Swash', '2002-08-21 19:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109117, 4760, 1280, '<td valign="top">From my perspective:<br/>Meets challenge:Yes<br/>Technical:Good, except the cat''s eyes are too dark<br/>Appeal/Artistic:good<br/>Composition:good<br/>Originality:ok<br/>Comments:Good luck in the challenge.<br/></td>', 'From my perspective:Meets challenge:YesTechnical:Good, except the cat''s eyes are too darkAppeal/Artistic:goodComposition:goodOriginality:okComments:Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-21 21:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
