(109120, 4760, 2909, '<td valign="top">nice shot of your cat,    too bad you couldn''t get it to cooperate   .If  the cat  moving toward the pencil  I would have scored you higher</td>', 'nice shot of your cat,    too bad you couldn''t get it to cooperate   .If  the cat  moving toward the pencil  I would have scored you higher', '2002-08-25 16:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109121, 4760, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like the angle this is taken at and the lighting is great.  very nice "non-candid" background.  I like that.  would love to have seen a drawing of a mouse between 2 pieces of bread though. LOL.  The focus and frame placement is great.  I don''t know anything about cats, or their anatomy, but his "arm pit" is really dark in the photo, making him look like he''s been shot.  I know (or assume) he hasn''t, but where the shadow is, like that, makes it look a bit odd.  Otherwise, great photo and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the angle this is taken at and the lighting is great.  very nice "non-candid" background.  I like that.  would love to have seen a drawing of a mouse between 2 pieces of bread though. LOL.  The focus and frame placement is great.  I don''t know anything about cats, or their anatomy, but his "arm pit" is really dark in the photo, making him look like he''s been shot.  I know (or assume) he hasn''t, but where the shadow is, like that, makes it look a bit odd.  Otherwise, great photo and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-26 00:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109122, 4761, 2204, '<td valign="top">This family couldn''t afford a station wagon?  Colorful and creative but focus seem off and some of the pendils are quite blurry.  =6 syamjonimi</td>', 'This family couldn''t afford a station wagon?  Colorful and creative but focus seem off and some of the pendils are quite blurry.  =6 syamjonimi', '2002-08-19 02:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109123, 4761, 1827, '<td valign="top">Cleverly titled.</td>', 'Cleverly titled.', '2002-08-19 02:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109124, 4761, 2586, '<td valign="top">Well done! This is well thought out and put together. Presume the background is a picture or postcard and the foreground is perhaps a piece of wood. Original and good sense of humor. Those pencils DO feel like a family! :) Journey</td>', 'Well done! This is well thought out and put together. Presume the background is a picture or postcard and the foreground is perhaps a piece of wood. Original and good sense of humor. Those pencils DO feel like a family! :) Journey', '2002-08-19 02:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109125, 4761, 2928, '<td valign="top">Inanimate objects taking a ride in a vehicle that will never move un-pushed is fairly amusing; implying they also breed is funny Over all, it''s a great shot born of a great idea; they really do look (one has to use ones imagination here) as though they are enjoying the ride, and they are  a family :o)  (8)</td>', 'Inanimate objects taking a ride in a vehicle that will never move un-pushed is fairly amusing; implying they also breed is funny Over all, it''s a great shot born of a great idea; they really do look (one has to use ones imagination here) as though they are enjoying the ride, and they are  a family :o)  (8)', '2002-08-19 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
