(109146, 4762, 2586, '<td valign="top">This image reflects a nice sensitivity and invokes a nice mood. Unfortunately, it does not "grab" me. Having meaningful text would have helped. Am bothered that the first thing (i.e. the foreground) is the shadow of the pencil. The light in the background right corner doesn''t quite work either. There is a softness and graininess to the overall image but that may be a reflection of the quality of your camera.  Journey</td>', 'This image reflects a nice sensitivity and invokes a nice mood. Unfortunately, it does not "grab" me. Having meaningful text would have helped. Am bothered that the first thing (i.e. the foreground) is the shadow of the pencil. The light in the background right corner doesn''t quite work either. There is a softness and graininess to the overall image but that may be a reflection of the quality of your camera.  Journey', '2002-08-19 02:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109147, 4762, 3280, '<td valign="top">This is one of those that I keep coming back to.  Good use of light and focus. Nice job.</td>', 'This is one of those that I keep coming back to.  Good use of light and focus. Nice job.', '2002-08-19 10:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
