(109153, 4762, 573, '<td valign="top">I like how your lightinh picks up the texture of the paper and adds character to the photo.   The shadow of the pincil also works well.  I just can''t say there is any thing I like about the pencil itself.</td>', 'I like how your lightinh picks up the texture of the paper and adds character to the photo.   The shadow of the pincil also works well.  I just can''t say there is any thing I like about the pencil itself.', '2002-08-20 17:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
