(109157, 4762, 1204, '<td valign="top">Nice - but could be better.  The shadow in bottom right corner is disturbing and the background is a bit to active.  The paper is grainy, perhaps a softer light would have worked better.  I like the black pencil - a yellow one would have been terrible... as in many other photos this time.  7.</td>', 'Nice - but could be better.  The shadow in bottom right corner is disturbing and the background is a bit to active.  The paper is grainy, perhaps a softer light would have worked better.  I like the black pencil - a yellow one would have been terrible... as in many other photos this time.  7.', '2002-08-22 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
