(109161, 4762, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and shadows you used here.  The angle makes for some very nice shadow pattern. Focus is great and I like how it fills the frame.  nice job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the lighting and shadows you used here.  The angle makes for some very nice shadow pattern. Focus is great and I like how it fills the frame.  nice job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-25 22:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
