(109163, 4763, 2815, '<td valign="top">I think it would help if you had wiped off the container.  It makes it a little out of focus.  (6)</td>', 'I think it would help if you had wiped off the container.  It makes it a little out of focus.  (6)', '2002-08-19 15:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
