(109165, 4763, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting, though the soaked pencil tip just seems so dark I can''t focus on anything else, I keep being pulled to that. (Maybe that''s the whole point!)<br/>Kavey</td>', 'Interesting, though the soaked pencil tip just seems so dark I can''t focus on anything else, I keep being pulled to that. (Maybe that''s the whole point!)Kavey', '2002-08-20 11:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109166, 4763, 3162, '<td valign="top">Decent shot. A little shallow. No pun intended.</td>', 'Decent shot. A little shallow. No pun intended.', '2002-08-21 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109167, 4763, 3080, '<td valign="top">Love the reflection of the pencil in the water.  Makes it look kind of like a star.  I think the water drops on the outside (or inside) of the container kind of take away from the over all look of the photo.  There is a glare in the top right, but you did an excelent job keeping non wanted reflection and glare off the container.  Really neat effect. Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Love the reflection of the pencil in the water.  Makes it look kind of like a star.  I think the water drops on the outside (or inside) of the container kind of take away from the over all look of the photo.  There is a glare in the top right, but you did an excelent job keeping non wanted reflection and glare off the container.  Really neat effect. Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-21 14:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109168, 4763, 1041, '<td valign="top">cool idea.  that''s just one pencil, isn''t it?  while i like the idea, there are a few things about the implementation i don''t like.  the waterdrops on the inside/outside are distracting, some of the background (especiall the bright spot in the top right) is also.  if you retry this, try wiping the drops off and position the vase onto a large white cardboard sheet (from your local arts store) so that the background and the underneath is nice and simple and doesn''t distract. -- gr8photos (4)</td>', 'cool idea.  that''s just one pencil, isn''t it?  while i like the idea, there are a few things about the implementation i don''t like.  the waterdrops on the inside/outside are distracting, some of the background (especiall the bright spot in the top right) is also.  if you retry this, try wiping the drops off and position the vase onto a large white cardboard sheet (from your local arts store) so that the background and the underneath is nice and simple and doesn''t distract. -- gr8photos (4)', '2002-08-21 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
