(109193, 4766, 2373, '<td valign="top">good picture. the light seems to be shining a little to much on the pencil. Maybe ajusting the intensity of your flashor the angle would help./</td>', 'good picture. the light seems to be shining a little to much on the pencil. Maybe ajusting the intensity of your flashor the angle would help./', '2002-08-19 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
