(109199, 4766, 2279, '<td valign="top">Very nice uh...pencil.. :) 7.</td>', 'Very nice uh...pencil.. :) 7.', '2002-08-20 01:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109200, 4766, 2881, '<td valign="top">Ok, this is obviously a guy picture! Love the detail on the jeans, belt, etc... this one could have been used for the Texture challenge...lol.  Pencil should have been a "Dixon Ticonderoga" though...</td>', 'Ok, this is obviously a guy picture! Love the detail on the jeans, belt, etc... this one could have been used for the Texture challenge...lol.  Pencil should have been a "Dixon Ticonderoga" though...', '2002-08-20 10:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109201, 4766, 2427, '<td valign="top">Good composition, color and clarity</td>', 'Good composition, color and clarity', '2002-08-20 12:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109202, 4766, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, lots of vibrant colours and shapes. I don''t know that the viewpoint is very flattering to the subject, but I doubt flattery was the intention. The arms seem to be a little lost - coming in from strange angles. Perhaps one could have touched the left hip and been more connected to the foreground?<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'Interesting shot, lots of vibrant colours and shapes. I don''t know that the viewpoint is very flattering to the subject, but I doubt flattery was the intention. The arms seem to be a little lost - coming in from strange angles. Perhaps one could have touched the left hip and been more connected to the foreground?5, Kavey', '2002-08-20 13:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109203, 4766, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing4,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,<br/>Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing4,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool', '2002-08-20 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109204, 4766, 2311, '<td valign="top">your ideas are great, your work, even better...</td>', 'your ideas are great, your work, even better...', '2002-08-20 22:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109205, 4766, 3162, '<td valign="top">Nice use of props. Very 90''s</td>', 'Nice use of props. Very 90''s', '2002-08-21 11:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109206, 4766, 2928, '<td valign="top">Nice.... Pencil.....</td>', 'Nice.... Pencil.....', '2002-08-21 13:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109207, 4766, 3189, '<td valign="top">Unique and clever.  Overall, eye catching, but try more dramatic lighting.</td>', 'Unique and clever.  Overall, eye catching, but try more dramatic lighting.', '2002-08-21 17:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109208, 4766, 3080, '<td valign="top">Oh gosh, please don''t take this the wrong way.  The angle is good.  It just kind of makes the model look like she has a really big butt.  I know she doesn''t cause she has such a slim waste, but the perspective makes it seem that way.  I think that a more straight on shot of the back might have been a bit more flattering.  Unless, of course, you were going for this look, then I''ll leave it alone.  It kind of looks like you are taking a photo of a pencil, but trying to show off the tattoo.  You could reverse it, you could take a photo of the tattoo at a more direct angle, and have the pencil still in the pocket be visible, but kind of in the background.  I like the tattoo, it gives the photo originality.  Might have looked more natural if the model was wearing a half shirt, instead of scrunching up a full shirt.  The lighting is beautiful, and the red belt gives this photo zing.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Oh gosh, please don''t take this the wrong way.  The angle is good.  It just kind of makes the model look like she has a really big butt.  I know she doesn''t cause she has such a slim waste, but the perspective makes it seem that way.  I think that a more straight on shot of the back might have been a bit more flattering.  Unless, of course, you were going for this look, then I''ll leave it alone.  It kind of looks like you are taking a photo of a pencil, but trying to show off the tattoo.  You could reverse it, you could take a photo of the tattoo at a more direct angle, and have the pencil still in the pocket be visible, but kind of in the background.  I like the tattoo, it gives the photo originality.  Might have looked more natural if the model was wearing a half shirt, instead of scrunching up a full shirt.  The lighting is beautiful, and the red belt gives this photo zing.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-21 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109209, 4766, 441, '<td valign="top">lovely exposure, quality shot 8</td>', 'lovely exposure, quality shot 8', '2002-08-22 17:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109210, 4766, 616, '<td valign="top">God I love this shot.</td>', 'God I love this shot.', '2002-08-22 18:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109211, 4766, 1808, '<td valign="top">Good eye movement with this - skin, tatoo, pencil...</td>', 'Good eye movement with this - skin, tatoo, pencil...', '2002-08-25 18:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109212, 4767, 1827, '<td valign="top">It''s obvious the blur is intentional.  What it intends to do is not quite clear to me.  Excuse the pun.  I''m afraid I can''t muster more than a 3.</td>', 'It''s obvious the blur is intentional.  What it intends to do is not quite clear to me.  Excuse the pun.  I''m afraid I can''t muster more than a 3.', '2002-08-19 03:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109213, 4767, 2596, '<td valign="top">reminds me of the "toast" picture from  -arnit-  you get a low one from me just for that but nice picture thou!!!!</td>', 'reminds me of the "toast" picture from  -arnit-  you get a low one from me just for that but nice picture thou!!!!', '2002-08-19 06:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109214, 4767, 1041, '<td valign="top">i have to admit, if this wasn''t an entry for the pencil challenge, it would''ve taken me a while to figure out that i was looking at pencils.  what''s the white thing in the middle?  i like the background color, and the grayish pencils against that, but was there a way to stop the motion a little more to make it not quite as abstract (of course, that''s probably exactly what you are trying to achieve ... don''t you just hate it when people don''t appreciate what you worked hard for?).  but, the truth is, deliberately abstract or not, to me, the photo isn''t that appealing, sorry. -- gr8photos (3)</td>', 'i have to admit, if this wasn''t an entry for the pencil challenge, it would''ve taken me a while to figure out that i was looking at pencils.  what''s the white thing in the middle?  i like the background color, and the grayish pencils against that, but was there a way to stop the motion a little more to make it not quite as abstract (of course, that''s probably exactly what you are trying to achieve ... don''t you just hate it when people don''t appreciate what you worked hard for?).  but, the truth is, deliberately abstract or not, to me, the photo isn''t that appealing, sorry. -- gr8photos (3)', '2002-08-19 13:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109215, 4767, 1882, '<td valign="top">bizarre</td>', 'bizarre', '2002-08-19 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109216, 4767, 2295, '<td valign="top">I know that you were going for a special effect on this one.  It just looks out of focus to me.</td>', 'I know that you were going for a special effect on this one.  It just looks out of focus to me.', '2002-08-19 14:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109217, 4767, 2815, '<td valign="top">I think this could be a really neat shot, but it is just too out of focus to be able to decide if it looks good.</td>', 'I think this could be a really neat shot, but it is just too out of focus to be able to decide if it looks good.', '2002-08-19 18:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109218, 4767, 2279, '<td valign="top">This ones just a little too blurry for me. For this to work for me it needs at least one thing in focus. 3.</td>', 'This ones just a little too blurry for me. For this to work for me it needs at least one thing in focus. 3.', '2002-08-20 01:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109219, 4767, 3087, '<td valign="top">I do like some blurry movement shots, but this one is so blurry I wouldn''t have a clue what was in it if I didn''t know. It''s just not grabbing me. That said, I do like the white circle that''s captured so well in the centre.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'I do like some blurry movement shots, but this one is so blurry I wouldn''t have a clue what was in it if I didn''t know. It''s just not grabbing me. That said, I do like the white circle that''s captured so well in the centre.Kavey', '2002-08-20 07:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109220, 4767, 835, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of abstract but I really don''t like the white dot/reflection in the middle of the picture.  I do like the silver on blue.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of abstract but I really don''t like the white dot/reflection in the middle of the picture.  I do like the silver on blue.', '2002-08-20 09:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109221, 4767, 2754, '<td valign="top">Too blurry...I really can''t even tell what I''m looking at here.</td>', 'Too blurry...I really can''t even tell what I''m looking at here.', '2002-08-20 15:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109222, 4767, 3127, '<td valign="top">Too much blur. You can''t even tell what it''s a photo of.</td>', 'Too much blur. You can''t even tell what it''s a photo of.', '2002-08-20 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109223, 4767, 2204, '<td valign="top">The colors are pretty but, I just can''t get past all the blur....sorry :''-( syamjonimi</td>', 'The colors are pretty but, I just can''t get past all the blur....sorry :''-( syamjonimi', '2002-08-21 02:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109224, 4767, 772, '<td valign="top">The motion blur is good, but the image doesn''t ''speak'' to me.  I can''t really verbalize why this photo doesn''t grab me... - jmsetzler</td>', 'The motion blur is good, but the image doesn''t ''speak'' to me.  I can''t really verbalize why this photo doesn''t grab me... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-21 15:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109225, 4767, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  Love the action of this shot, just wish I could see it.  I think I see four elements in this photo.  Three seem to be mech. pencils, what is the fourth item?  I think it has a white cap.  IMO, too much blurrrr.  Suggestion:  use a more textured background and move the camera with the dropped items.  That would blur the background for your sense of motion, while attempting to preserve your subject''s viewability.  But if blur is what you want, you got it!  7 Swash</td>', 'Great idea!  Love the action of this shot, just wish I could see it.  I think I see four elements in this photo.  Three seem to be mech. pencils, what is the fourth item?  I think it has a white cap.  IMO, too much blurrrr.  Suggestion:  use a more textured background and move the camera with the dropped items.  That would blur the background for your sense of motion, while attempting to preserve your subject''s viewability.  But if blur is what you want, you got it!  7 Swash', '2002-08-21 19:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109226, 4767, 2752, '<td valign="top">the three pencils(pens) look like they could be falling but the center "dot" appears to be rising.</td>', 'the three pencils(pens) look like they could be falling but the center "dot" appears to be rising.', '2002-08-22 00:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109227, 4767, 3448, '<td valign="top">This would be much more interesting if SOMETHING was in focus!</td>', 'This would be much more interesting if SOMETHING was in focus!', '2002-08-22 15:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109228, 4767, 1019, '<td valign="top">Good design and interesting movement   andrewm</td>', 'Good design and interesting movement   andrewm', '2002-08-22 16:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
