(109252, 4768, 1280, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge Theme:Yes<br/>Technical :fair...lighting is good, but focus is very shallow.<br/>Composition:good<br/>Creativity:good idea!<br/>Remarks:I think I''d like this more if the whole were in focus but I still like it.  Good choice for black and white too.<br/>Grayce...aka...Gracious</td>', 'Meets Challenge Theme:YesTechnical :fair...lighting is good, but focus is very shallow.Composition:goodCreativity:good idea!Remarks:I think I''d like this more if the whole were in focus but I still like it.  Good choice for black and white too.Grayce...aka...Gracious', '2002-08-19 19:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
