(109258, 4768, 875, '<td valign="top">I love the idea.  Good use of black and white.  Nice framing and focus.  The grain in the photo adds a nice touch.</td>', 'I love the idea.  Good use of black and white.  Nice framing and focus.  The grain in the photo adds a nice touch.', '2002-08-20 16:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
