(109260, 4768, 2170, '<td valign="top">Great shot....excellent focus and DOF.  This is a really nice (and different!) take on the pencil challenge:  simple, and (hopefully) just about everyone who was ever in elementrary school will know what it is.  Don''t you remember the way the pencil sharpener smelled when you took it off to empty it?  Love that....   muckpond</td>', 'Great shot....excellent focus and DOF.  This is a really nice (and different!) take on the pencil challenge:  simple, and (hopefully) just about everyone who was ever in elementrary school will know what it is.  Don''t you remember the way the pencil sharpener smelled when you took it off to empty it?  Love that....   muckpond', '2002-08-20 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109261, 4768, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a neat interpretation of the challenge.. ;)  I understand your intention completely witht this shot, but i fear that you have left yourself open for a lot of ''does not meet the challenge'' comments :(  I did the same thing last week with my ''Needful Things'' photo.  I left the voter an opportunity to see an abstract view of the challenge.  I did not do well... :(  I like your idea and I understand your meaning here :)  good shot... = 8 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a neat interpretation of the challenge.. ;)  I understand your intention completely witht this shot, but i fear that you have left yourself open for a lot of ''does not meet the challenge'' comments :(  I did the same thing last week with my ''Needful Things'' photo.  I left the voter an opportunity to see an abstract view of the challenge.  I did not do well... :(  I like your idea and I understand your meaning here :)  good shot... = 8 - jmsetzler', '2002-08-20 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
