(109301, 4769, 2221, '<td valign="top">I like this photo! Very nice colours. Good composition (diagonal lines). I know it''s stupid but somehow it looks a bit "hazy". As of the lightness was punched up a tad too much. A bit more contrast would be better for my taste. Anyway, still a very good photo.<br/>-stephan</td>', 'I like this photo! Very nice colours. Good composition (diagonal lines). I know it''s stupid but somehow it looks a bit "hazy". As of the lightness was punched up a tad too much. A bit more contrast would be better for my taste. Anyway, still a very good photo.-stephan', '2002-08-25 19:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
