(109307, 4770, 3087, '<td valign="top">I am not keen on composition or cropping here - tip of pencil being missing, doesn''t seem like a deliberate crop in that respect. Subject matter also not appealing to me. I do think that you''ve done a great job of getting the detail of the fur to come out so clearly. My scores are affected by the fact that pet photos don''t generally appeal to me very often. Sorry!<br/>Kavey</td>', 'I am not keen on composition or cropping here - tip of pencil being missing, doesn''t seem like a deliberate crop in that respect. Subject matter also not appealing to me. I do think that you''ve done a great job of getting the detail of the fur to come out so clearly. My scores are affected by the fact that pet photos don''t generally appeal to me very often. Sorry!Kavey', '2002-08-20 07:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
