(109319, 4770, 2427, '<td valign="top">How did you manage that one?!!</td>', 'How did you manage that one?!!', '2002-08-25 21:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109320, 4771, 2172, '<td valign="top">Great work, I like the angle.  The black is very black - nice.  I like how the pencil almost seems to bend in the middle (could be me staring at the screen for too long. lol)  I also like the composition, with the shavings off to the side.  Great work  9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Great work, I like the angle.  The black is very black - nice.  I like how the pencil almost seems to bend in the middle (could be me staring at the screen for too long. lol)  I also like the composition, with the shavings off to the side.  Great work  9Ruthann', '2002-08-19 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109321, 4771, 3087, '<td valign="top">Like the ingredients but not the composition. The rich black background makes your photo look more professional. I want tips!<br/>Kavey</td>', 'Like the ingredients but not the composition. The rich black background makes your photo look more professional. I want tips!Kavey', '2002-08-20 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109322, 4771, 3080, '<td valign="top">Angle is perfect on this.  I like how you have this set up.  Lighting is great, no distracting shadows, or reflections. The mid section of the pencil is a tad bright, but it doesn''t take away from the photo.   I like how the pencil sharpener has kind of a rainbow-ish oily look.  Makes it kind of prism like.  The shavings add a nice touch as well.  Nice job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Angle is perfect on this.  I like how you have this set up.  Lighting is great, no distracting shadows, or reflections. The mid section of the pencil is a tad bright, but it doesn''t take away from the photo.   I like how the pencil sharpener has kind of a rainbow-ish oily look.  Makes it kind of prism like.  The shavings add a nice touch as well.  Nice job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-21 01:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109323, 4771, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background8,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing9,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,<br/>Total Averaged Rating9.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background8,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing9,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,Total Averaged Rating9.   Autool', '2002-08-21 23:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109324, 4771, 737, '<td valign="top">Composition - quite good<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  high<br/>Other suggestions  none<br/><br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Composition - quite goodTechnical Aspects - quite goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality  highOther suggestions  noneJim msp', '2002-08-22 00:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109325, 4771, 2649, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2002-08-22 18:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109326, 4771, 1792, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but composition seems a little awkward.  Everything seems weighted to the left lower corner.  By moving the pencil and sharpener up and to the right a little instead of dividing the diagonal of the picture from corner to corner might be effective.</td>', 'Nice idea, but composition seems a little awkward.  Everything seems weighted to the left lower corner.  By moving the pencil and sharpener up and to the right a little instead of dividing the diagonal of the picture from corner to corner might be effective.', '2002-08-25 03:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109327, 4771, 2586, '<td valign="top">This picture is very sharp, except for the pencil shavings. Don''t care all that much for the composition. The pencil is the exact diagonal of the picture frame and effectively divides the picture in half.  Colors are a little weak as well, e.g. the green of the sharpener doesn''t complement any colors. 5 Journey</td>', 'This picture is very sharp, except for the pencil shavings. Don''t care all that much for the composition. The pencil is the exact diagonal of the picture frame and effectively divides the picture in half.  Colors are a little weak as well, e.g. the green of the sharpener doesn''t complement any colors. 5 Journey', '2002-08-25 20:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109328, 4773, 2586, '<td valign="top">The idea is great but the execution leaves to be desired. Since this is a shot where all the details are paramount you should have controlled that environment more: get rid of the clutter, such as those chairs. The way you cropped at the right, i.e. left eye, does not look pretty. Nor does the body in the glass, is that yours or someone else''s. I realize this is a very tough shot but you should have worked more on it to overcome some of those flaws. Perhaps cropping out at the bridge to eliminate the awkward other eye and whatever else can be see there would have helped a lot. Do keep trying things like this though. 5 Journey</td>', 'The idea is great but the execution leaves to be desired. Since this is a shot where all the details are paramount you should have controlled that environment more: get rid of the clutter, such as those chairs. The way you cropped at the right, i.e. left eye, does not look pretty. Nor does the body in the glass, is that yours or someone else''s. I realize this is a very tough shot but you should have worked more on it to overcome some of those flaws. Perhaps cropping out at the bridge to eliminate the awkward other eye and whatever else can be see there would have helped a lot. Do keep trying things like this though. 5 Journey', '2002-08-19 02:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109329, 4773, 674, '<td valign="top">Technique excellent.</td>', 'Technique excellent.', '2002-08-19 02:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
