(109342, 4773, 1280, '<td valign="top">From my perspective:<br/>Meets challenge:Yes, with ease.<br/>Technical:good exposure, fine focus, actually the focus is very fine, considering the face and reflection are both clearly focused...good job!<br/>Appeal/Artistic:Very good<br/>Composition:The only thing I''d eliminate here is the flesh and chair reflections that really don''t add to, or support the subject. <br/>Originality:Very good.<br/>Comments:Overall you did a fine job here. One of my favorites.Good luck in the challenge.<br/></td>', 'From my perspective:Meets challenge:Yes, with ease.Technical:good exposure, fine focus, actually the focus is very fine, considering the face and reflection are both clearly focused...good job!Appeal/Artistic:Very goodComposition:The only thing I''d eliminate here is the flesh and chair reflections that really don''t add to, or support the subject. Originality:Very good.Comments:Overall you did a fine job here. One of my favorites.Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-21 21:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
