(109365, 4775, 2667, '<td valign="top">this is one of those images that made this challenge fun... very creative and very well done.   ~mcmurma<br/>Aesthetics....7<br/>Meets Challenge...9<br/>Overall....8</td>', 'this is one of those images that made this challenge fun... very creative and very well done.   ~mcmurmaAesthetics....7Meets Challenge...9Overall....8', '2002-08-21 13:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109366, 4775, 3080, '<td valign="top">Great angle.  At first, I thought the pencil was a bit dark, but then I was thinking.  It just got jabbed through a tomoto.  Why would it be all bright and shiny.  Placement is very visually powerful.  A little puzzled by the horizontal flow of juice.  The background fits this very nicely.  I think the light glare adds to the photo in this case.    Very powerful shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Great angle.  At first, I thought the pencil was a bit dark, but then I was thinking.  It just got jabbed through a tomoto.  Why would it be all bright and shiny.  Placement is very visually powerful.  A little puzzled by the horizontal flow of juice.  The background fits this very nicely.  I think the light glare adds to the photo in this case.    Very powerful shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-21 14:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109367, 4775, 1330, '<td valign="top">This is just a little soft of focus on the right side of the tomato but I like it that way.  Don''t know of anything that I would really try and change, really good shot. 9</td>', 'This is just a little soft of focus on the right side of the tomato but I like it that way.  Don''t know of anything that I would really try and change, really good shot. 9', '2002-08-21 14:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
