(109374, 4775, 82, '<td valign="top">I love the various textures, from wet to dry, smooth to mottled, black to colorful.  Very nice framing, too.  Only thing I''d suggest (and it''s not allowed for the contest) is to adjust the background so that it is almost pure white).</td>', 'I love the various textures, from wet to dry, smooth to mottled, black to colorful.  Very nice framing, too.  Only thing I''d suggest (and it''s not allowed for the contest) is to adjust the background so that it is almost pure white).', '2002-08-22 11:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
