(109381, 4775, 2352, '<td valign="top">This makes me laugh as I was thinking about doing something like this but couldn`t figure how to slam a pencil into a wood plank at 90 miles per hour like the old `Bic` commercials.  (If your not 40 years old or so, never mind...)<br/>I like this!  Is that a tomato?</td>', 'This makes me laugh as I was thinking about doing something like this but couldn`t figure how to slam a pencil into a wood plank at 90 miles per hour like the old `Bic` commercials.  (If your not 40 years old or so, never mind...)I like this!  Is that a tomato?', '2002-08-23 22:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109382, 4775, 2172, '<td valign="top">Really cool - sooo different and interesting  (Running out of steam for commenting - so being brief)  Composition, subject, lighting, idea, color, background - all great for this image - I see a lot of thought, time, effort and skill went into this image   Awesome  9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Really cool - sooo different and interesting  (Running out of steam for commenting - so being brief)  Composition, subject, lighting, idea, color, background - all great for this image - I see a lot of thought, time, effort and skill went into this image   Awesome  9Ruthann', '2002-08-23 23:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
