(109384, 4775, 1, '<td valign="top">Great composure and idea.  My guess is that it''s a tomato.</td>', 'Great composure and idea.  My guess is that it''s a tomato.', '2002-08-24 19:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109385, 4775, 2818, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very striking picture.  I love the colors.  I think this is a great photo.</td>', 'I think this is a very striking picture.  I love the colors.  I think this is a great photo.', '2002-08-25 05:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109386, 4775, 2204, '<td valign="top">Seems this photo could almost be called "Birth" or "Vicious Intruder."  I personally prefer something without the challenge topic in the title.  This is a very colorful photo.  How you came up with this idea just stumps me totally. (Not that I think it''s a bad idea, just the opposite.)  The two things that are distracting me are - The softened edges of the red tomato and the blown highlight on the tomato .  To me, soft edge needs to be crisp and sharp and softening the lighting glare on the tomato would make it lok rounder and fuller and more luscious.</td>', 'Seems this photo could almost be called "Birth" or "Vicious Intruder."  I personally prefer something without the challenge topic in the title.  This is a very colorful photo.  How you came up with this idea just stumps me totally. (Not that I think it''s a bad idea, just the opposite.)  The two things that are distracting me are - The softened edges of the red tomato and the blown highlight on the tomato .  To me, soft edge needs to be crisp and sharp and softening the lighting glare on the tomato would make it lok rounder and fuller and more luscious.', '2002-08-25 09:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109387, 4775, 1808, '<td valign="top">Ouch.</td>', 'Ouch.', '2002-08-25 18:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109388, 4775, 1128, '<td valign="top">A super macro... It seems like I could reach right into my screen and touch it!</td>', 'A super macro... It seems like I could reach right into my screen and touch it!', '2002-08-25 23:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109389, 4775, 2815, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for the great comments.  I am so pumped to barely make it into the Top 10.  This is only the 2nd time I have submitted anything!!  After not submitting anything for the New Challenge I knew that I had to come up with something for this Pencil Challenge. It couldn''t be easier all we had to do was get a shot with a pencil in it.  I came up with this idea one day while trying to think completly outside of the box.   We have a pretty extensive garden and an over abundance of ripe tomatos.  I tried sever differant angles, but found this one worked the best.  I would push the pencil in and out of the tomato.  With that kind of action the tomatoe finally started to ooze our some juices.  This is exactly what I was looking for!.  I finally had to resort to squeezing the thing to get the shot that I wanted.  Thank you all for the votes and the great comments.  I am still learning and hope to make the Top 10 again someday.  NormW</td>', 'Thanks everyone for the great comments.  I am so pumped to barely make it into the Top 10.  This is only the 2nd time I have submitted anything!!  After not submitting anything for the New Challenge I knew that I had to come up with something for this Pencil Challenge. It couldn''t be easier all we had to do was get a shot with a pencil in it.  I came up with this idea one day while trying to think completly outside of the box.   We have a pretty extensive garden and an over abundance of ripe tomatos.  I tried sever differant angles, but found this one worked the best.  I would push the pencil in and out of the tomato.  With that kind of action the tomatoe finally started to ooze our some juices.  This is exactly what I was looking for!.  I finally had to resort to squeezing the thing to get the shot that I wanted.  Thank you all for the votes and the great comments.  I am still learning and hope to make the Top 10 again someday.  NormW', '2002-08-26 01:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(109390, 4775, 2279, '<td valign="top">Good job.  Glad you made it into the top 10. One of my favorites for the week.</td>', 'Good job.  Glad you made it into the top 10. One of my favorites for the week.', '2002-08-26 01:31:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(109391, 4776, 3127, '<td valign="top">Very original! The depth in this photo is great!</td>', 'Very original! The depth in this photo is great!', '2002-08-19 09:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109392, 4776, 1779, '<td valign="top">like the idea. I just wish there was something more interesting to see at the top...</td>', 'like the idea. I just wish there was something more interesting to see at the top...', '2002-08-19 11:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109393, 4776, 2722, '<td valign="top">It could be my laptop, but the words seem washed out by the sun. Maybe the graphite is reflecting too much. Would have liked to read the words written in.</td>', 'It could be my laptop, but the words seem washed out by the sun. Maybe the graphite is reflecting too much. Would have liked to read the words written in.', '2002-08-19 13:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109394, 4776, 2353, '<td valign="top">Good composition and original idea. I think that the shallow DOF works well bringing the eye down to the subject.  This picture also just has a great "feel" to me...I can''t explain it, I just like it.  Good job! - 8 Kat</td>', 'Good composition and original idea. I think that the shallow DOF works well bringing the eye down to the subject.  This picture also just has a great "feel" to me...I can''t explain it, I just like it.  Good job! - 8 Kat', '2002-08-19 13:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109395, 4776, 3320, '<td valign="top">Good creativity and good composition although the picture does not look ''nice'' to me.  Still a 6</td>', 'Good creativity and good composition although the picture does not look ''nice'' to me.  Still a 6', '2002-08-19 13:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109396, 4776, 2586, '<td valign="top">Nice image; original and sets a nice mood. The title suits well, too. I like the fact that the foreground is sharp and focuses my attention on the subject and with detail of beach objects. Then in the background is the blurred beach scene. 6 Journey</td>', 'Nice image; original and sets a nice mood. The title suits well, too. I like the fact that the foreground is sharp and focuses my attention on the subject and with detail of beach objects. Then in the background is the blurred beach scene. 6 Journey', '2002-08-19 14:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109397, 4776, 2261, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition.</td>', 'Excellent composition.', '2002-08-19 15:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109398, 4776, 2466, '<td valign="top">great crossword set up.  be proud!</td>', 'great crossword set up.  be proud!', '2002-08-19 15:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109399, 4776, 2869, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful and relaxing photo</td>', 'what a beautiful and relaxing photo', '2002-08-19 18:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109400, 4776, 2123, '<td valign="top">You guys have to stop with the beach photos, I''m getting so homesick!  I like the DOF on this shot and the kids in the background. 8</td>', 'You guys have to stop with the beach photos, I''m getting so homesick!  I like the DOF on this shot and the kids in the background. 8', '2002-08-19 19:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109401, 4776, 327, '<td valign="top">Fun shot done well. Score 7 ~Kee</td>', 'Fun shot done well. Score 7 ~Kee', '2002-08-19 19:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109402, 4776, 1255, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I wish there was a little less sky and a little more clarity on the crossword puzzle though.</td>', 'Great shot.  I wish there was a little less sky and a little more clarity on the crossword puzzle though.', '2002-08-19 22:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109403, 4776, 2928, '<td valign="top">Great shot...</td>', 'Great shot...', '2002-08-20 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109404, 4776, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really like this, but finally realised after noticing I was tilting my head slightly that the water needs to be horizontal as it''s the true horizon. It looks as though you''ve set horizon for a line between the line of the water and the line of the beach?<br/>Really like the low low viewpoint you''ve taken to photograph this. <br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'I really like this, but finally realised after noticing I was tilting my head slightly that the water needs to be horizontal as it''s the true horizon. It looks as though you''ve set horizon for a line between the line of the water and the line of the beach?Really like the low low viewpoint you''ve taken to photograph this. 6, Kavey', '2002-08-20 18:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109405, 4776, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,<br/>Total Averaged Rating8.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,Total Averaged Rating8.   Autool', '2002-08-20 20:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109406, 4776, 3162, '<td valign="top">Thinking outside the box. Nice shot and created in the camera not the computer.</td>', 'Thinking outside the box. Nice shot and created in the camera not the computer.', '2002-08-21 11:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109407, 4776, 2204, '<td valign="top">I can''t find 17 across..... when I count it out 17 begins in the middle of a word, so, at best it would have to be 17 down.  This is a pleasant concept for the pencil challenge.  The picture has a nice warm comfortable feeling.  I think I would score it higher if it was cropped closer to the sea shells and leave the horizon and people out.  The background get so out of focus that it draws my eye up instead of keeping it focused on the challenge topic.</td>', 'I can''t find 17 across..... when I count it out 17 begins in the middle of a word, so, at best it would have to be 17 down.  This is a pleasant concept for the pencil challenge.  The picture has a nice warm comfortable feeling.  I think I would score it higher if it was cropped closer to the sea shells and leave the horizon and people out.  The background get so out of focus that it draws my eye up instead of keeping it focused on the challenge topic.', '2002-08-21 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109408, 4776, 2867, '<td valign="top">very nice.  i like how the puzzle has only some done.  The sky is just breathtaking and the seashells definetly add to this pic.  its a nice clear pic and the colors are great!</td>', 'very nice.  i like how the puzzle has only some done.  The sky is just breathtaking and the seashells definetly add to this pic.  its a nice clear pic and the colors are great!', '2002-08-22 17:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109409, 4776, 715, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the contrast between the beach-scenary and the paper/pencil make this an interesting photo.</td>', 'I like the composition and the contrast between the beach-scenary and the paper/pencil make this an interesting photo.', '2002-08-22 17:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109410, 4776, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent shot... the peoplein the background really add a nice element to this... good work :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is an excellent shot... the peoplein the background really add a nice element to this... good work :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-23 13:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109411, 4776, 3080, '<td valign="top">I liked all the crossword photos this week.  They remind me of my grandpa who carried one with him everywhere.  This is a lovely background, and great addition of the sea shells to the foreground.  Looked like a very nice day.  Is that the ocean?  Being from Michigan, I''ve seen my fair share of water and beaches.  I''ve never seen the ocean though.  Lighting, angle and focus are great.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I liked all the crossword photos this week.  They remind me of my grandpa who carried one with him everywhere.  This is a lovely background, and great addition of the sea shells to the foreground.  Looked like a very nice day.  Is that the ocean?  Being from Michigan, I''ve seen my fair share of water and beaches.  I''ve never seen the ocean though.  Lighting, angle and focus are great.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-23 18:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109412, 4776, 1808, '<td valign="top">But there is no 17 across on that puzzle... Nice composition.</td>', 'But there is no 17 across on that puzzle... Nice composition.', '2002-08-25 18:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109413, 4777, 1827, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I like the innuendo.  7</td>', 'Nice.  I like the innuendo.  7', '2002-08-19 03:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109414, 4777, 1658, '<td valign="top">I like the composition on this shot.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I like the composition on this shot.  Nicely done.', '2002-08-19 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109415, 4777, 327, '<td valign="top">This is well done, bravo! Score7~Kee</td>', 'This is well done, bravo! Score7~Kee', '2002-08-19 15:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109416, 4777, 3031, '<td valign="top">As do I.... :-) Like the idea. Nice composition.</td>', 'As do I.... :-) Like the idea. Nice composition.', '2002-08-19 17:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109417, 4777, 1779, '<td valign="top">nice composition and true statement : )</td>', 'nice composition and true statement : )', '2002-08-19 18:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109418, 4777, 3213, '<td valign="top">Composition:10, Lighting:10, Creative idea:10. <br/>Nice composition, I like the light on the palm''s left corner, and I also think a pencil will always be needed :)</td>', 'Composition:10, Lighting:10, Creative idea:10. Nice composition, I like the light on the palm''s left corner, and I also think a pencil will always be needed :)', '2002-08-19 20:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109419, 4777, 2586, '<td valign="top">I admire the clarityof this image. The pencil is placed in a very realistic context (I say this because I just saw a number of images that left me wondering So what?). I find the overall composition a little weak: fine on the note pad and pencil but then the Palm and keyboard got tucked in there as well just because you wanted them for logical purposes that makes it hard for my eye to wonder around here (although I see some nice negative space triangles). 6 Journey</td>', 'I admire the clarityof this image. The pencil is placed in a very realistic context (I say this because I just saw a number of images that left me wondering So what?). I find the overall composition a little weak: fine on the note pad and pencil but then the Palm and keyboard got tucked in there as well just because you wanted them for logical purposes that makes it hard for my eye to wonder around here (although I see some nice negative space triangles). 6 Journey', '2002-08-20 00:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109420, 4777, 145, '<td valign="top">nice composition</td>', 'nice composition', '2002-08-20 03:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109421, 4777, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background8,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,<br/>Total Averaged Rating8.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background8,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,Total Averaged Rating8.   Autool', '2002-08-20 10:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109422, 4777, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea but the resulting image doesn''t pack a punch with me... I''d almost be happier with just the pencil and the pad, it seems so real I want to reach out and touch it.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'Interesting idea but the resulting image doesn''t pack a punch with me... I''d almost be happier with just the pencil and the pad, it seems so real I want to reach out and touch it.Kavey', '2002-08-20 11:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109423, 4777, 3162, '<td valign="top">Good thought. Not strong visual though.</td>', 'Good thought. Not strong visual though.', '2002-08-21 11:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109424, 4777, 2798, '<td valign="top">Excellent arrangement and framing. Very well conceived and executed.</td>', 'Excellent arrangement and framing. Very well conceived and executed.', '2002-08-21 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109425, 4777, 3306, '<td valign="top">I know how you feel! great shot.</td>', 'I know how you feel! great shot.', '2002-08-21 21:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109426, 4777, 3080, '<td valign="top">Your product looks like the solar system.  That has no bearing on anything, I just thought I''d mention that. lol.  Lighting, angle and focus are great.  I like the idea behind your photo too.  With all this technology, we still hold onto the "primative" things.  Overall great photo.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Your product looks like the solar system.  That has no bearing on anything, I just thought I''d mention that. lol.  Lighting, angle and focus are great.  I like the idea behind your photo too.  With all this technology, we still hold onto the "primative" things.  Overall great photo.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-22 15:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109427, 4777, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot... It just emphasizes how modern technology can''t replace certain things :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is an interesting shot... It just emphasizes how modern technology can''t replace certain things :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-23 13:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109428, 4777, 173, '<td valign="top">Great composition and cropping, well done!</td>', 'Great composition and cropping, well done!', '2002-08-23 18:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109429, 4777, 3500, '<td valign="top">Well lit, nice focus, so-so idea.</td>', 'Well lit, nice focus, so-so idea.', '2002-08-24 17:24:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(109430, 4777, 1792, '<td valign="top">Well composed and thought out.  It might have been more effective if the pencil had been oriented a little less perpendicular to the edge.  The tablet sets up that perpendicular line and the pencil''s right end could come down a little.  Just a thought.</td>', 'Well composed and thought out.  It might have been more effective if the pencil had been oriented a little less perpendicular to the edge.  The tablet sets up that perpendicular line and the pencil''s right end could come down a little.  Just a thought.', '2002-08-25 02:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109431, 4777, 1808, '<td valign="top">Nicely staged. I don''t think A should have VPN access though....</td>', 'Nicely staged. I don''t think A should have VPN access though....', '2002-08-25 18:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109432, 4777, 1128, '<td valign="top">I totally connect with this photo emotionally!  Good, clear subjects and colors.  Well composed.</td>', 'I totally connect with this photo emotionally!  Good, clear subjects and colors.  Well composed.', '2002-08-25 23:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109433, 4777, 1779, '<td valign="top">Felicidades! Qué se siente estar dentro de los 100? : )<br/><br/>LM</td>', 'Felicidades! Qué se siente estar dentro de los 100? : )LM', '2002-08-26 11:36:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(109434, 4779, 806, '<td valign="top">It was probably hard to focus on the pencil - it being so slim in comparison to the tree. Does your camera have manual focus? Anyway... that''s my only nit pick on this photo. Lines are good. Meaning is well taken. Good detail in the bark. Colors and lighting are all good.</td>', 'It was probably hard to focus on the pencil - it being so slim in comparison to the tree. Does your camera have manual focus? Anyway... that''s my only nit pick on this photo. Lines are good. Meaning is well taken. Good detail in the bark. Colors and lighting are all good.', '2002-08-19 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109435, 4779, 2170, '<td valign="top">-1 for the pun!  LOL.</td>', '-1 for the pun!  LOL.', '2002-08-19 15:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109436, 4779, 1154, '<td valign="top">Luv the pic, Luv the title!</td>', 'Luv the pic, Luv the title!', '2002-08-19 16:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109437, 4779, 117, '<td valign="top">i had that shot and I was going to say something like don''t you remember me mom</td>', 'i had that shot and I was going to say something like don''t you remember me mom', '2002-08-19 17:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109438, 4779, 1779, '<td valign="top">if only it was a title conmpetition... : )</td>', 'if only it was a title conmpetition... : )', '2002-08-19 18:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109439, 4779, 3087, '<td valign="top">Like the close cropping and texture of the bark. <br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'Like the close cropping and texture of the bark. 5, Kavey', '2002-08-20 14:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109440, 4779, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing5,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,<br/>Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing5,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool', '2002-08-22 21:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109441, 4779, 2350, '<td valign="top">I really don''t know, but your photo very clever.</td>', 'I really don''t know, but your photo very clever.', '2002-08-23 15:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109442, 4779, 3080, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, yup.  Great lighting and focus.  excelent angle.  something I would hang in my living room? No.  But none the less very well executed.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Meets the challenge, yup.  Great lighting and focus.  excelent angle.  something I would hang in my living room? No.  But none the less very well executed.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-23 16:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109443, 4779, 2204, '<td valign="top">Good texture shot.  Works for pencil too but, could be better focus at the top part of the pencil.</td>', 'Good texture shot.  Works for pencil too but, could be better focus at the top part of the pencil.', '2002-08-24 22:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109446, 4781, 1880, '<td valign="top">The background does not lend enough contrast to this photo ... Other than that I find it to a well composed photo ... Good Luck ... RLS</td>', 'The background does not lend enough contrast to this photo ... Other than that I find it to a well composed photo ... Good Luck ... RLS', '2002-08-19 02:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109447, 4781, 1143, '<td valign="top">white balance seems a little off, but it''s a good macro</td>', 'white balance seems a little off, but it''s a good macro', '2002-08-19 02:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109448, 4781, 1827, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed shot; wish the lighting created a bit of a glare of the paint.  5</td>', 'Nicely framed shot; wish the lighting created a bit of a glare of the paint.  5', '2002-08-19 03:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109449, 4781, 1779, '<td valign="top">like the idea. try making them come out from the lower corner. see how different they look...</td>', 'like the idea. try making them come out from the lower corner. see how different they look...', '2002-08-19 11:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109450, 4781, 2983, '<td valign="top">Artistic composition, very nice</td>', 'Artistic composition, very nice', '2002-08-19 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109451, 4781, 2353, '<td valign="top">Wow...excellent focusing!  The only thing is that it looks like there is a little bit of a reflection off of the point of the center pencil which is a bit distracting.  Maybe play around with the order of the pencils as well..the yellow being in front along with the yellow background perhaps is not as visually stimulating as the red one being shown more for some contrast.  Good job and good luck in the contest! KrazyKat</td>', 'Wow...excellent focusing!  The only thing is that it looks like there is a little bit of a reflection off of the point of the center pencil which is a bit distracting.  Maybe play around with the order of the pencils as well..the yellow being in front along with the yellow background perhaps is not as visually stimulating as the red one being shown more for some contrast.  Good job and good luck in the contest! KrazyKat', '2002-08-19 14:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109452, 4781, 2204, '<td valign="top">I love the rich colors and complimentary DOF and background.<br/><br/>Aug 19, 9:45pm PST - upgraded from =8 to =9  syamjonimi</td>', 'I love the rich colors and complimentary DOF and background.Aug 19, 9:45pm PST - upgraded from =8 to =9  syamjonimi', '2002-08-19 14:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109453, 4781, 1454, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but to me, it would look better with brighter and more vivid colors.</td>', 'Great idea, but to me, it would look better with brighter and more vivid colors.', '2002-08-19 19:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109454, 4781, 2172, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  This image is so smooth - great choice of colors, lighting, composition.  10<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Excellent!  This image is so smooth - great choice of colors, lighting, composition.  10Ruthann', '2002-08-19 20:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109455, 4781, 2798, '<td valign="top">Lovely warm, neutral colours. Good focus and shallow DOF. Great lighting.</td>', 'Lovely warm, neutral colours. Good focus and shallow DOF. Great lighting.', '2002-08-20 08:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109456, 4781, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background10,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 8,<br/>Total Averaged Rating9.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background10,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 8,Total Averaged Rating9.   Autool', '2002-08-20 10:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109457, 4781, 1054, '<td valign="top">Freat photo, I love the composition.  I love photographs that look at objects from unconventional angles.</td>', 'Freat photo, I love the composition.  I love photographs that look at objects from unconventional angles.', '2002-08-20 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109458, 4781, 173, '<td valign="top">Good use of macro!</td>', 'Good use of macro!', '2002-08-20 16:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109459, 4781, 2170, '<td valign="top">I enjoy this shot but I think the background color is somewhat distracting.  Don''t get me wrong -- I''m a fan of backgrounds.  But the color of this one is just too similar to the yellow pencil...I think it detracts from the focus of the shot.  muckpond</td>', 'I enjoy this shot but I think the background color is somewhat distracting.  Don''t get me wrong -- I''m a fan of backgrounds.  But the color of this one is just too similar to the yellow pencil...I think it detracts from the focus of the shot.  muckpond', '2002-08-20 17:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109460, 4781, 3080, '<td valign="top">Simple but very nice.  The clarity is great on those tips.  I like how it fades away with the green one in the back.  Lighting is great and the colors are very nice.  I was kind of wondering though, why you used 2 primary colors and 1 secondary color?  yellow, red and blue would be the logical combination of colors, but maybe how you have it, it was a better visual combination.  I wasn''t saying it was a bad thing, just wondering if you did it that way on purpose or not.  Great photo and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Simple but very nice.  The clarity is great on those tips.  I like how it fades away with the green one in the back.  Lighting is great and the colors are very nice.  I was kind of wondering though, why you used 2 primary colors and 1 secondary color?  yellow, red and blue would be the logical combination of colors, but maybe how you have it, it was a better visual combination.  I wasn''t saying it was a bad thing, just wondering if you did it that way on purpose or not.  Great photo and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-21 18:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109461, 4781, 737, '<td valign="top">Composition - quite good<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  high<br/>Other suggestions  did you try a whiter background? Probably would have set pencils off better.<br/><br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Composition - quite goodTechnical Aspects - quite goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality  highOther suggestions  did you try a whiter background? Probably would have set pencils off better.Jim msp', '2002-08-22 00:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109462, 4781, 2667, '<td valign="top">nice shot. i like the warm orange tone of the photo. very sharp. (6) ~mcmurma</td>', 'nice shot. i like the warm orange tone of the photo. very sharp. (6) ~mcmurma', '2002-08-22 02:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109463, 4781, 82, '<td valign="top">I like the over-all orange.</td>', 'I like the over-all orange.', '2002-08-22 11:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109464, 4781, 2649, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  Composition is simple, but effective.  Color focus, exposuere, and etc. are great.</td>', 'Very nice photo.  Composition is simple, but effective.  Color focus, exposuere, and etc. are great.', '2002-08-22 18:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109465, 4781, 2553, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and I like the effect of the DOF.  Would have like to have seen  the colors of the pencils "pop" out from the background a little more - perhaps a tiny bit more light on them.  lhall</td>', 'Nice composition and I like the effect of the DOF.  Would have like to have seen  the colors of the pencils "pop" out from the background a little more - perhaps a tiny bit more light on them.  lhall', '2002-08-23 07:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109466, 4781, 3087, '<td valign="top">Simple and warm. Love the shadow shapes.<br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'Simple and warm. Love the shadow shapes.7, Kavey', '2002-08-23 08:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109467, 4781, 436, '<td valign="top">I like the variety of colors, the subdued background, the hint of shadow.  It''s sharp without being over done.  In short, striking and dynamic.  well done. 9</td>', 'I like the variety of colors, the subdued background, the hint of shadow.  It''s sharp without being over done.  In short, striking and dynamic.  well done. 9', '2002-08-23 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109468, 4781, 1792, '<td valign="top">Composition, sharpness are good.  It''s simple and direct.  The shadow is nice.  Maybe it''s just me, but there seems to be too much yellow.  A different color in the background would probably make it more appealing to me and make the subjects "jump" out a little more.  Not white---but something with less yellow.</td>', 'Composition, sharpness are good.  It''s simple and direct.  The shadow is nice.  Maybe it''s just me, but there seems to be too much yellow.  A different color in the background would probably make it more appealing to me and make the subjects "jump" out a little more.  Not white---but something with less yellow.', '2002-08-25 02:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109469, 4781, 1042, '<td valign="top">Very nice dof...I like the orange color but it tends to make the colors of the pencils flat somehow.</td>', 'Very nice dof...I like the orange color but it tends to make the colors of the pencils flat somehow.', '2002-08-25 11:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109470, 4781, 637, '<td valign="top">very well done... love the colors and the apparent suspension of the pencils... i''m so-so on the orange bkgd  6 sjgleah</td>', 'very well done... love the colors and the apparent suspension of the pencils... i''m so-so on the orange bkgd  6 sjgleah', '2002-08-25 11:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109471, 4781, 2221, '<td valign="top">Very good use of the narrow DOF to focus on the pencils. The shadows below the pencils are a bit distrating because it''s not visible if the belong to the pencils or something else.<br/>-stephan</td>', 'Very good use of the narrow DOF to focus on the pencils. The shadows below the pencils are a bit distrating because it''s not visible if the belong to the pencils or something else.-stephan', '2002-08-25 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109472, 4781, 1041, '<td valign="top">thank you all for your comments, as usual.  the three pencils are lying on the upper shelf of my desk at home, sticking over the side of the shelf, hence those shadows.  i liked the way the yellow pencil fades in with the background, but realize from the comments that people either love it or hate it.  oh well.  i have taken a couple of shots with a white background and having the pencils enter diagonally into the shot, but it just didn''t work as well for me.<br/><br/>it was pretty dark, so i hand-held a desklamp, that was all the light i could muster at that time of night.  hence also the reflection on the pencil tip (which i noticed only after uploading the pictures).<br/><br/>lastly, i included the yellow pencil (rather than going just with primary colors) because i still had this yellow pencil thing in my head from the initial challenge description, as well as because it did blend so much with the background ... i wanted it that way! ;)</td>', 'thank you all for your comments, as usual.  the three pencils are lying on the upper shelf of my desk at home, sticking over the side of the shelf, hence those shadows.  i liked the way the yellow pencil fades in with the background, but realize from the comments that people either love it or hate it.  oh well.  i have taken a couple of shots with a white background and having the pencils enter diagonally into the shot, but it just didn''t work as well for me.it was pretty dark, so i hand-held a desklamp, that was all the light i could muster at that time of night.  hence also the reflection on the pencil tip (which i noticed only after uploading the pictures).lastly, i included the yellow pencil (rather than going just with primary colors) because i still had this yellow pencil thing in my head from the initial challenge description, as well as because it did blend so much with the background ... i wanted it that way! ;)', '2002-08-26 10:36:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(109473, 4782, 3095, '<td valign="top">OK... I found it, now what?</td>', 'OK... I found it, now what?', '2002-08-19 01:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109474, 4782, 2140, '<td valign="top">i found it, now what?</td>', 'i found it, now what?', '2002-08-19 01:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
