(109477, 4782, 593, '<td valign="top">I love the Broncos!</td>', 'I love the Broncos!', '2002-08-19 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109478, 4782, 2204, '<td valign="top">This would have worked much better with a stark black, red, or white  background.  Pretty innovative though.  Good idea.</td>', 'This would have worked much better with a stark black, red, or white  background.  Pretty innovative though.  Good idea.', '2002-08-20 01:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109479, 4782, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is a graphical composition, the shape of the shirt is bold and so is the colour. I think the carpet beneath it detracts hugely from the shot in terms of colour and texture (though perhaps texture might be OK if the colour was different). Perhaps because of the pink carpet, it doesn''t appeal to me visually.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'This is a graphical composition, the shape of the shirt is bold and so is the colour. I think the carpet beneath it detracts hugely from the shot in terms of colour and texture (though perhaps texture might be OK if the colour was different). Perhaps because of the pink carpet, it doesn''t appeal to me visually.Kavey', '2002-08-20 07:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109480, 4782, 2337, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and I like the texture on the rug... However, the pencil looks like it was addedd to make the picture of the jersey fit the challenge... This isn''t so much a photo of a pencil with a jersey in it as it is a photo of a jersey with a pencil in it... I''m considering giving you a sympathy point since the Broncos looked so bad last night against the 49ers and this might be the highpoint of your season... PS ~ My wife (a Bronco fan) says the old uniform was much better...</td>', 'Nice lighting and I like the texture on the rug... However, the pencil looks like it was addedd to make the picture of the jersey fit the challenge... This isn''t so much a photo of a pencil with a jersey in it as it is a photo of a jersey with a pencil in it... I''m considering giving you a sympathy point since the Broncos looked so bad last night against the 49ers and this might be the highpoint of your season... PS ~ My wife (a Bronco fan) says the old uniform was much better...', '2002-08-20 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109481, 4782, 772, '<td valign="top">I see the pencil :)  The overall impact of this photo doesn''t really grab me.  It meets the challenge because the pencil is in the photo.  I believe that a more creative use of the pencil would work better :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'I see the pencil :)  The overall impact of this photo doesn''t really grab me.  It meets the challenge because the pencil is in the photo.  I believe that a more creative use of the pencil would work better :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-21 11:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109482, 4782, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,<br/>Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool', '2002-08-22 21:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109483, 4782, 2798, '<td valign="top">Lacking a little pazazz I think.</td>', 'Lacking a little pazazz I think.', '2002-08-23 09:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109484, 4782, 2937, '<td valign="top">Got it!! :-)</td>', 'Got it!! :-)', '2002-08-23 12:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109485, 4782, 2302, '<td valign="top">This picture is a little too flat for me and having the shirt centered in the middle of the picture doesn''t do much for me. I think it would have appealed more if the shirt was in a different position instead of flat on the carpet (maybe laying the grass with footballs around it?). I also would have liked a bigger challenge to find the pencil - perhaps if it was set along a seam of the shirt instead of across the collar.  Good lighting and focus and meets the challenge = 5</td>', 'This picture is a little too flat for me and having the shirt centered in the middle of the picture doesn''t do much for me. I think it would have appealed more if the shirt was in a different position instead of flat on the carpet (maybe laying the grass with footballs around it?). I also would have liked a bigger challenge to find the pencil - perhaps if it was set along a seam of the shirt instead of across the collar.  Good lighting and focus and meets the challenge = 5', '2002-08-23 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109486, 4782, 637, '<td valign="top">I''ll bet I know who took this.. I like the contrast between the jersey and the carpet; and i like the concept.  Bet you''re sad that Terrell is packing it in.  6 sjgleah</td>', 'I''ll bet I know who took this.. I like the contrast between the jersey and the carpet; and i like the concept.  Bet you''re sad that Terrell is packing it in.  6 sjgleah', '2002-08-24 19:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109487, 4782, 2427, '<td valign="top">Cute.</td>', 'Cute.', '2002-08-24 23:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109488, 4782, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been a bit more amusing if the pencil were actually hidden to be able to "find".  The lighting on this is great.  no distracting shadows or bright spots.  Did you do some post editing to color?  The orange/red on the sides looks a bit overdone.  That could have been an upload thing though.  The angle is good and the positioning is a bit too far to the left.    Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I think this would have been a bit more amusing if the pencil were actually hidden to be able to "find".  The lighting on this is great.  no distracting shadows or bright spots.  Did you do some post editing to color?  The orange/red on the sides looks a bit overdone.  That could have been an upload thing though.  The angle is good and the positioning is a bit too far to the left.    Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-25 12:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
