(109502, 4783, 3087, '<td valign="top">A little too monochrome but I love the shadow cast by the pencil and the angle of it. How did you get it to stay up?<br/>Kavey</td>', 'A little too monochrome but I love the shadow cast by the pencil and the angle of it. How did you get it to stay up?Kavey', '2002-08-20 11:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109503, 4783, 2000, '<td valign="top">The shading works pretty well here, though the picture overall is a bit dark.  Also, and I know this may not be pointed out much, you have too many sides of the pencil drawn - a six-sided pencil would only have 3 sides visible normally.  Good effort, though, and creative idea.</td>', 'The shading works pretty well here, though the picture overall is a bit dark.  Also, and I know this may not be pointed out much, you have too many sides of the pencil drawn - a six-sided pencil would only have 3 sides visible normally.  Good effort, though, and creative idea.', '2002-08-20 13:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109504, 4783, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a superb shot.  I cant work out how you got the pencil to look unsupported, and without affecting the shadow as well Wicked shot  has to score high, I was looking at it for ages (10)</td>', 'This is a superb shot.  I cant work out how you got the pencil to look unsupported, and without affecting the shadow as well Wicked shot  has to score high, I was looking at it for ages (10)', '2002-08-20 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109505, 4783, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like the angle this was done at and I like that the pencil is parallel to the bottom of the photo.  This is a really cool idea.  The lighting is great and there are no disturbing shadows or bright spots that take away from the photo.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the angle this was done at and I like that the pencil is parallel to the bottom of the photo.  This is a really cool idea.  The lighting is great and there are no disturbing shadows or bright spots that take away from the photo.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-20 15:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109506, 4783, 573, '<td valign="top">Neet idea having a pencil draw a pencil all by itself.  The overall look is greyish looking to me, in my opinion full color would have worked better to give the pencil some power.</td>', 'Neet idea having a pencil draw a pencil all by itself.  The overall look is greyish looking to me, in my opinion full color would have worked better to give the pencil some power.', '2002-08-20 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
