(109579, 4785, 3080, '<td valign="top">The clarity of this is very nice.  Great focus.  Lighting is perfect.  Originality and creativity both apply nicely here.  I like the placement within the frame.  I notice a few reflections in the very bottom of the glass, but they aren''t distracting at all.  Actually, they add a bit of color to the photo.  Also, the light glare on the top of the glass is used very nicely in this photo.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The clarity of this is very nice.  Great focus.  Lighting is perfect.  Originality and creativity both apply nicely here.  I like the placement within the frame.  I notice a few reflections in the very bottom of the glass, but they aren''t distracting at all.  Actually, they add a bit of color to the photo.  Also, the light glare on the top of the glass is used very nicely in this photo.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-23 19:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
