(109636, 4788, 2204, '<td valign="top">Very interesting....I would have completely overlooked the bark on the outside of the pencils without the title though.  I really like the artistic touch and the center focus.</td>', 'Very interesting....I would have completely overlooked the bark on the outside of the pencils without the title though.  I really like the artistic touch and the center focus.', '2002-08-19 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
