(109648, 4788, 3162, '<td valign="top">Nice use of Macro.</td>', 'Nice use of Macro.', '2002-08-21 11:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109649, 4788, 737, '<td valign="top">Composition - very good<br/>Technical Aspects - very good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  high<br/>Other suggestions  alignment of lines with points would have been great ( but tough)<br/><br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Composition - very goodTechnical Aspects - very goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality  highOther suggestions  alignment of lines with points would have been great ( but tough)Jim msp', '2002-08-21 23:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109650, 4788, 3080, '<td valign="top">Although I''ve seen pencils like this before.  I wonder if they are real pencils or made that way, as sticks sharpened and painted.  Either way, very nice effect.  Creative and original.  The lighting is good and the focus is nicely on the tips.  Only one thing particularily stands out to me in this photo.  The red, green and yellow lines all lead right up to the matching pencil, but the blue line misses the pencil completely.  Great idea and beautiful colors.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Although I''ve seen pencils like this before.  I wonder if they are real pencils or made that way, as sticks sharpened and painted.  Either way, very nice effect.  Creative and original.  The lighting is good and the focus is nicely on the tips.  Only one thing particularily stands out to me in this photo.  The red, green and yellow lines all lead right up to the matching pencil, but the blue line misses the pencil completely.  Great idea and beautiful colors.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-22 11:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109651, 4788, 2649, '<td valign="top">Great visual appeal,  focus,exposure, and lighting are excellent.  Very nice photo.</td>', 'Great visual appeal,  focus,exposure, and lighting are excellent.  Very nice photo.', '2002-08-22 18:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109652, 4788, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really like this and the DOF used. Only thing is that dark shadow at top left. I''d like to see the full width used by the pencils across the top. Would also like the lines of colour to come out at just the right place - like the green one. The blue one seems to come out from under the green pencil. Do love the colours and the textures on the pencil tips too.<br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'I really like this and the DOF used. Only thing is that dark shadow at top left. I''d like to see the full width used by the pencils across the top. Would also like the lines of colour to come out at just the right place - like the green one. The blue one seems to come out from under the green pencil. Do love the colours and the textures on the pencil tips too.7, Kavey', '2002-08-23 07:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109653, 4788, 2172, '<td valign="top">COOL  This is great. (I''m running out of steam for commenting - so being brief)  I like the composition and the entire idea; different; sot of a spotlight usage; texture of paper, detail - all great characteristics of this image.  Great Work 9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'COOL  This is great. (I''m running out of steam for commenting - so being brief)  I like the composition and the entire idea; different; sot of a spotlight usage; texture of paper, detail - all great characteristics of this image.  Great Work 9Ruthann', '2002-08-23 23:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109654, 4788, 133, '<td valign="top">Neat looking pencils!</td>', 'Neat looking pencils!', '2002-08-24 08:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109655, 4788, 3500, '<td valign="top">Nice use of colors.</td>', 'Nice use of colors.', '2002-08-24 17:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109656, 4788, 1, '<td valign="top">Great leading lines.  Perhaps a larger DOF could''ve been more effective?</td>', 'Great leading lines.  Perhaps a larger DOF could''ve been more effective?', '2002-08-24 19:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109657, 4788, 441, '<td valign="top">good work, interesting portrayal 8</td>', 'good work, interesting portrayal 8', '2002-08-25 19:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109658, 4788, 255, '<td valign="top">nice work. i like your DOF and minimal use of color. good job. 9</td>', 'nice work. i like your DOF and minimal use of color. good job. 9', '2002-08-25 19:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109659, 4788, 82, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, and nifty pencils.  I would have given higher marks if the lines drawn actually met the leads that drew them.  Green comes closest, then yellow ... but red''s line is far from the lead -- and blue''s is going to a different pencile altogether!</td>', 'Interesting idea, and nifty pencils.  I would have given higher marks if the lines drawn actually met the leads that drew them.  Green comes closest, then yellow ... but red''s line is far from the lead -- and blue''s is going to a different pencile altogether!', '2002-08-25 22:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109660, 4788, 1827, '<td valign="top">I liked this photo.  It was in my top 20 for the week.  I liked the way the focus softened on the edges.  I liked the slight angle of the pencils and the texture in their points.  The only thing that nagged at me was that the lines were not aligned to their respective leads.  Nit picky I know, but it made a difference to me.  Overall, 7.</td>', 'I liked this photo.  It was in my top 20 for the week.  I liked the way the focus softened on the edges.  I liked the slight angle of the pencils and the texture in their points.  The only thing that nagged at me was that the lines were not aligned to their respective leads.  Nit picky I know, but it made a difference to me.  Overall, 7.', '2002-08-25 22:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109661, 4788, 1847, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  Vibrant colors, and the texture on the bark is very interesting.</td>', 'Great photo.  Vibrant colors, and the texture on the bark is very interesting.', '2002-08-26 00:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109662, 4789, 2204, '<td valign="top">Interesting conception.With a different background I would have scored this higher.  The wood grain reminds me of school though....=7syamjonimi</td>', 'Interesting conception.With a different background I would have scored this higher.  The wood grain reminds me of school though....=7syamjonimi', '2002-08-19 02:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109663, 4789, 1779, '<td valign="top">nice composition and idea. don''t like the image quality so much, it looks like you used a flash wich made everything a bit plain...</td>', 'nice composition and idea. don''t like the image quality so much, it looks like you used a flash wich made everything a bit plain...', '2002-08-19 11:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
