(109687, 4791, 2323, '<td valign="top">What the...???  This is too funny!  I''m assuming that you put the pencil way up close to the camera... and used a pole for the shadow???  Or is that one really big pencil?   --8-- sohr</td>', 'What the...???  This is too funny!  I''m assuming that you put the pencil way up close to the camera... and used a pole for the shadow???  Or is that one really big pencil?   --8-- sohr', '2002-08-20 00:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109688, 4791, 2881, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to look at this one and try to figure it out.  EVERY detail is perfect... I want to know how you did it!</td>', 'I keep coming back to look at this one and try to figure it out.  EVERY detail is perfect... I want to know how you did it!', '2002-08-20 10:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109689, 4791, 3080, '<td valign="top">i''ll admit, I''m still trying to figure out if this is a really enormous pencil, or if it''s a really really detailed model car.  I''m guessing on the big bencil though.  But what do I know?  Everything is appealing to me on this.  The angle the photo was taken, the great idea, I like the lighting, the background with the beautiful tree is great and the reflection in the car is even growing on me.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'i''ll admit, I''m still trying to figure out if this is a really enormous pencil, or if it''s a really really detailed model car.  I''m guessing on the big bencil though.  But what do I know?  Everything is appealing to me on this.  The angle the photo was taken, the great idea, I like the lighting, the background with the beautiful tree is great and the reflection in the car is even growing on me.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-21 11:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
