(109758, 4793, 3080, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  They seem to be fighting.  I didn''t notice the pen in the thumbnail version of this photo.  Was this a shutter speed trick?  I wonder why it left the blue in the pen in only that one spot.  Oh well, it doesn''t matter, it''s still a cool photo.  I like the angle and the lighting is great.  Gets a little bright up towards the top, but I think that just draws your eyes back down to the subject, so it works.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Great idea.  They seem to be fighting.  I didn''t notice the pen in the thumbnail version of this photo.  Was this a shutter speed trick?  I wonder why it left the blue in the pen in only that one spot.  Oh well, it doesn''t matter, it''s still a cool photo.  I like the angle and the lighting is great.  Gets a little bright up towards the top, but I think that just draws your eyes back down to the subject, so it works.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-22 13:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
