(109843, 4796, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great shot, wonderful drawing, interesting coloration of the hand (waffling on like it/don''t like it).  I thought about doing something similar, but didn''t.  (I can''t figure out the words about giving credit to Esher, but something along that line might have been a nice thing to do.)  8 Swash</td>', 'Great shot, wonderful drawing, interesting coloration of the hand (waffling on like it/don''t like it).  I thought about doing something similar, but didn''t.  (I can''t figure out the words about giving credit to Esher, but something along that line might have been a nice thing to do.)  8 Swash', '2002-08-20 19:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
