(109865, 4797, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very creative shot;   the very subtle lighting of this shot takes away from the impact of it, for me.  I would love to see strong lighting on the subject against some kind of dark or brightly colored background.  lhall</td>', 'Very creative shot;   the very subtle lighting of this shot takes away from the impact of it, for me.  I would love to see strong lighting on the subject against some kind of dark or brightly colored background.  lhall', '2002-08-19 11:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109866, 4797, 2170, '<td valign="top">A darker background would have let you have more direct light on the fan (bring the whites up more) and would have made everything stand out in general.  Nice shot!</td>', 'A darker background would have let you have more direct light on the fan (bring the whites up more) and would have made everything stand out in general.  Nice shot!', '2002-08-19 15:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
