(109874, 4797, 1041, '<td valign="top">nice idea and shot, i can''t believe i am saying this, because i chose a certain color scheme for my shot and people are asking for more color, but ... i would love to see more color in this one.  maybe make the windmill part out of colored paper and lighten the background a little? -- gr8photos (5)</td>', 'nice idea and shot, i can''t believe i am saying this, because i chose a certain color scheme for my shot and people are asking for more color, but ... i would love to see more color in this one.  maybe make the windmill part out of colored paper and lighten the background a little? -- gr8photos (5)', '2002-08-23 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109875, 4797, 772, '<td valign="top">this is a good concept for this challenge... I like the use of the pencil :)  I think two elements could possibly improve this shot as well... 1 - a little more light on the pinwheel to offer some higher level of contrast against the background... 2 - possibly a darker background to make the pinwheel stand out more as well.... good shot :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'this is a good concept for this challenge... I like the use of the pencil :)  I think two elements could possibly improve this shot as well... 1 - a little more light on the pinwheel to offer some higher level of contrast against the background... 2 - possibly a darker background to make the pinwheel stand out more as well.... good shot :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-23 14:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109876, 4797, 1037, '<td valign="top">There''s a kind of softness and subtelty to this photo that I like.</td>', 'There''s a kind of softness and subtelty to this photo that I like.', '2002-08-23 14:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109877, 4797, 3080, '<td valign="top">You should enter this in the childhood challenge. I remember doing this in elementary school and then we went outside to see if they would blow in the wind.  I remember it being too windy and all the windmills kind of just folded in half.  Anyway...This is the only pencil windmill that I saw in this challenge, so I think you hit the mark with originality.  The focus and lighting are good and the angle is ok.  I might have either tried to get it exactly up and down, or more crooked.  how it stands, it kind of looks like you tried to get it straight, but couldn''t.  Nice job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'You should enter this in the childhood challenge. I remember doing this in elementary school and then we went outside to see if they would blow in the wind.  I remember it being too windy and all the windmills kind of just folded in half.  Anyway...This is the only pencil windmill that I saw in this challenge, so I think you hit the mark with originality.  The focus and lighting are good and the angle is ok.  I might have either tried to get it exactly up and down, or more crooked.  how it stands, it kind of looks like you tried to get it straight, but couldn''t.  Nice job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-24 01:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109878, 4798, 2223, '<td valign="top">i want to hang this on my wall!! great job!</td>', 'i want to hang this on my wall!! great job!', '2002-08-19 01:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109879, 4798, 2586, '<td valign="top">Good idea, original, and well executed. And you meet the challenge, too! lol.<br/>Journey</td>', 'Good idea, original, and well executed. And you meet the challenge, too! lol.Journey', '2002-08-19 02:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
