(109882, 4798, 806, '<td valign="top">Nice pattern and colors. A couple of the blue one''s erasers are out of line with the symmetry. Good idea. Looks like you had fun.</td>', 'Nice pattern and colors. A couple of the blue one''s erasers are out of line with the symmetry. Good idea. Looks like you had fun.', '2002-08-19 10:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
