(109953, 4801, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love the cross-hatching beneath the pieces of pencil. Is this hand drawn just where we see it, or is the whole paper gridlined and the contrast set up high to get rid of it? I like this a lot, but the layout of the pieces doesn''t quite gel for me.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Love the cross-hatching beneath the pieces of pencil. Is this hand drawn just where we see it, or is the whole paper gridlined and the contrast set up high to get rid of it? I like this a lot, but the layout of the pieces doesn''t quite gel for me.6, Kavey', '2002-08-20 18:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
