(109961, 4801, 1856, '<td valign="top">Pretty neat.  I love how the pencil shadows keep the pattern on the graph paper showing.  Maybe a little too blown out and harsh looking but i like this overall.  Lisa</td>', 'Pretty neat.  I love how the pencil shadows keep the pattern on the graph paper showing.  Maybe a little too blown out and harsh looking but i like this overall.  Lisa', '2002-08-23 23:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109962, 4801, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty neat idea, and really nice placement.  The focus is very nice, but the post editing is way too exaggerated, in my opinion.  The pencil parts  don''t look natural and the lack of background except where the shadows were suposed to be is kind of distracting.  I am sure  you did this on purpose though, so I will hold this a just my opinion and say that if you were going for this look, then you definately did your job.  Original and pretty creative.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'This is a pretty neat idea, and really nice placement.  The focus is very nice, but the post editing is way too exaggerated, in my opinion.  The pencil parts  don''t look natural and the lack of background except where the shadows were suposed to be is kind of distracting.  I am sure  you did this on purpose though, so I will hold this a just my opinion and say that if you were going for this look, then you definately did your job.  Original and pretty creative.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-24 01:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
