(109977, 4803, 82, '<td valign="top">I think it''s the color of the paper, but this image struck me as genitalia at first.</td>', 'I think it''s the color of the paper, but this image struck me as genitalia at first.', '2002-08-22 11:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109978, 4803, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, though find the shadow around the pencils just a little OTT. Love the texture of the scribble and the paper and the limited colours.<br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'I like this a lot, though find the shadow around the pencils just a little OTT. Love the texture of the scribble and the paper and the limited colours.7, Kavey', '2002-08-23 08:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109979, 4803, 1037, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a subtle relationship between these two. I like that a lot. I also really like the textures of the paper and charcoal, and the dark shadow. Very atmospheric.</td>', 'There seems to be a subtle relationship between these two. I like that a lot. I also really like the textures of the paper and charcoal, and the dark shadow. Very atmospheric.', '2002-08-23 14:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109980, 4803, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think the title gives this some kind of sexual reference.  Makes a person wonder if that was the intent.  This is a nice photo.  The lighting is ok, but I think that the dark shadow near the tips of the pencils is just a bit too dark.  it makes the red pencil almost look like it has no lead.  The angle is good and the surface makes for a good skin tone color.  Good job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I think the title gives this some kind of sexual reference.  Makes a person wonder if that was the intent.  This is a nice photo.  The lighting is ok, but I think that the dark shadow near the tips of the pencils is just a bit too dark.  it makes the red pencil almost look like it has no lead.  The angle is good and the surface makes for a good skin tone color.  Good job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-24 01:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109981, 4803, 1808, '<td valign="top">Nice smoke effect. Would have been even more if it was flipped up side down.</td>', 'Nice smoke effect. Would have been even more if it was flipped up side down.', '2002-08-25 18:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109982, 4804, 1827, '<td valign="top">I wanted to find this picture intersting, and it was close, but in the end I needed more that the one blue to break the redundancy of yellow.  Good attempt.</td>', 'I wanted to find this picture intersting, and it was close, but in the end I needed more that the one blue to break the redundancy of yellow.  Good attempt.', '2002-08-19 02:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109983, 4804, 2586, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but it gets a little boring if you look at it for a bit. Although there is that one blue pencil, the overall image lacks tension to sustain my interest. The focus is also very soft but that may reflect the quality of your camera. 5 Journey</td>', 'Nice idea but it gets a little boring if you look at it for a bit. Although there is that one blue pencil, the overall image lacks tension to sustain my interest. The focus is also very soft but that may reflect the quality of your camera. 5 Journey', '2002-08-19 15:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109984, 4804, 2170, '<td valign="top">The pattern in this shot is excellent.  I really wish the pencil that''s about halfway down did not stand out so much.  It''s a little distracting and takes away from the blue pencil.<br/><br/>Great concept...I love it!</td>', 'The pattern in this shot is excellent.  I really wish the pencil that''s about halfway down did not stand out so much.  It''s a little distracting and takes away from the blue pencil.Great concept...I love it!', '2002-08-19 15:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109985, 4804, 2815, '<td valign="top">Looks like wallpaper,  it is a great shot thoug (6)<br/></td>', 'Looks like wallpaper,  it is a great shot thoug (6)', '2002-08-19 16:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109986, 4804, 1360, '<td valign="top">I REALLY feel like this is a nitpicking comment... but that one pencil about halfway down needs to be rotated so the same edge as all the others is out.   It''s still a very visually striking image.  6 -lennier</td>', 'I REALLY feel like this is a nitpicking comment... but that one pencil about halfway down needs to be rotated so the same edge as all the others is out.   It''s still a very visually striking image.  6 -lennier', '2002-08-19 19:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109987, 4804, 1779, '<td valign="top">interesting pattern... It would''ve help if all the pencils were exactly the same way. There''s one in the middle thats a bit turned... also the fact that the blue one is round also distracts from the idea. Maybe could ''ve paint a pencil so you wouldn''t loose the same sahpe... MHO</td>', 'interesting pattern... It would''ve help if all the pencils were exactly the same way. There''s one in the middle thats a bit turned... also the fact that the blue one is round also distracts from the idea. Maybe could ''ve paint a pencil so you wouldn''t loose the same sahpe... MHO', '2002-08-19 19:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109988, 4804, 2798, '<td valign="top">Almost modern art. That one pencil that''s partly turned halfway down looks out of place to me. Im guessing it was deliberate but I dont think it adds much. Overall interest is lacking a little - maybe another sharpened pencil laid across the top at a diagonal would have helped.</td>', 'Almost modern art. That one pencil that''s partly turned halfway down looks out of place to me. Im guessing it was deliberate but I dont think it adds much. Overall interest is lacking a little - maybe another sharpened pencil laid across the top at a diagonal would have helped.', '2002-08-20 08:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109989, 4804, 2295, '<td valign="top">Well done.  Focus is good.  Lighting is good.  Meets the challenge.</td>', 'Well done.  Focus is good.  Lighting is good.  Meets the challenge.', '2002-08-21 12:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109990, 4804, 1280, '<td valign="top">From my perspective:<br/>Meets challenge:Yes<br/>Technical:fine<br/>Appeal/Artistic:ok<br/>Composition:ok<br/>Originality:ok<br/>Comments:Good luck in the challenge.<br/></td>', 'From my perspective:Meets challenge:YesTechnical:fineAppeal/Artistic:okComposition:okOriginality:okComments:Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-21 21:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109991, 4804, 3080, '<td valign="top">Great contrast between the blue pencil and the yellow ones.   The lighting is good.  I wouldn''t want the glare on the right side to be any brighter though.  The angle is great, but the framing is a slight bit off.  Being the type of photo it is, even the very small bit it is off, it is very noticable and would have to go perfectly straight across the top and bottom to not be distracting.  I like it, it has a very nice pattern to it.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Great contrast between the blue pencil and the yellow ones.   The lighting is good.  I wouldn''t want the glare on the right side to be any brighter though.  The angle is great, but the framing is a slight bit off.  Being the type of photo it is, even the very small bit it is off, it is very noticable and would have to go perfectly straight across the top and bottom to not be distracting.  I like it, it has a very nice pattern to it.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-22 13:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109992, 4804, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background4,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing5,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,<br/>Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background4,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing5,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool', '2002-08-22 20:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109993, 4804, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, and like that the blue is a third of way down. Would like it better if more accurately horizontal and if all pencils were at same angle. The one 8th up keeps destroying the repetitive pattern, for me.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Nice shot, and like that the blue is a third of way down. Would like it better if more accurately horizontal and if all pencils were at same angle. The one 8th up keeps destroying the repetitive pattern, for me.6, Kavey', '2002-08-23 07:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109994, 4804, 2221, '<td valign="top">Very good photo! Good composition, lighting and focus. Very creative!<br/>Only flaw I see is that there is a pencil right in the middle which is not like the other yellow ones (not not the blue one of course ;-)) It reflects the light differently and therefore sticks out one somehow destroys the uniformity of the yellow pencils.<br/>-stephan</td>', 'Very good photo! Good composition, lighting and focus. Very creative!Only flaw I see is that there is a pencil right in the middle which is not like the other yellow ones (not not the blue one of course ;-)) It reflects the light differently and therefore sticks out one somehow destroys the uniformity of the yellow pencils.-stephan', '2002-08-25 19:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109995, 4805, 3095, '<td valign="top">Hardly wait to hear how you pulled that one off!</td>', 'Hardly wait to hear how you pulled that one off!', '2002-08-19 02:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109996, 4805, 1827, '<td valign="top">What is all the dust?  It''s distracting.  If it was intentional, I missed it''s meaning.  5</td>', 'What is all the dust?  It''s distracting.  If it was intentional, I missed it''s meaning.  5', '2002-08-19 02:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109997, 4805, 2817, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but perhaps a little to dark.</td>', 'Interesting, but perhaps a little to dark.', '2002-08-19 10:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109998, 4805, 1779, '<td valign="top">You''re now entering, The Twilight Zone... cool!</td>', 'You''re now entering, The Twilight Zone... cool!', '2002-08-19 11:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(109999, 4805, 2343, '<td valign="top">Too dark</td>', 'Too dark', '2002-08-19 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110000, 4805, 573, '<td valign="top">A cool idea, but the execution of the picture IMO leaves some to be desired. The flecks of white, the rumpled black felt and the overall barkness leave me in the lurch.  The pencil itself looks like it might be under water, am I right?   I have the feeling that there is something here I am missing, maybe whin I revisit this image later in the week it may make more sence.</td>', 'A cool idea, but the execution of the picture IMO leaves some to be desired. The flecks of white, the rumpled black felt and the overall barkness leave me in the lurch.  The pencil itself looks like it might be under water, am I right?   I have the feeling that there is something here I am missing, maybe whin I revisit this image later in the week it may make more sence.', '2002-08-19 14:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110001, 4805, 2295, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I''m not sure how you did this pict.  It seems a bit dark.  The focus looks ok.</td>', 'Interesting.  I''m not sure how you did this pict.  It seems a bit dark.  The focus looks ok.', '2002-08-19 14:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110002, 4805, 2000, '<td valign="top">Very dark, and the pencil doesn''t really stand out.  The title comes too close to saving this, though it is a good idea.</td>', 'Very dark, and the pencil doesn''t really stand out.  The title comes too close to saving this, though it is a good idea.', '2002-08-19 18:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110003, 4805, 1360, '<td valign="top">What IS this?  I''m guessing it''s some kind of exposure shot, judging by the stuck pixels.  I''m thinking it could be lit better, but its a very interesting idea.  5 -lennier</td>', 'What IS this?  I''m guessing it''s some kind of exposure shot, judging by the stuck pixels.  I''m thinking it could be lit better, but its a very interesting idea.  5 -lennier', '2002-08-19 19:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110004, 4805, 3111, '<td valign="top">If this isn''t a novelty pencil, I would like to know how you got it to bend like this.  Good "stellar" quality to it, would have liked to see a title go with that.</td>', 'If this isn''t a novelty pencil, I would like to know how you got it to bend like this.  Good "stellar" quality to it, would have liked to see a title go with that.', '2002-08-19 21:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110005, 4805, 472, '<td valign="top">too dark .. ur camera is struggling as is evidenced by all the ccd noise.. needs more light :)</td>', 'too dark .. ur camera is struggling as is evidenced by all the ccd noise.. needs more light :)', '2002-08-19 21:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110006, 4805, 2353, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell what the speckles are...is it pixilazation?  Also, your pencil seems to be lost in the depths of the background...</td>', 'I can''t tell what the speckles are...is it pixilazation?  Also, your pencil seems to be lost in the depths of the background...', '2002-08-19 22:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110007, 4805, 3239, '<td valign="top">The idea is good, but it takes work to determine the subject is a pencil at all.  I would suggest brightening the image a bit so that the subject is not mostly obscured.</td>', 'The idea is good, but it takes work to determine the subject is a pencil at all.  I would suggest brightening the image a bit so that the subject is not mostly obscured.', '2002-08-19 23:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110008, 4805, 656, '<td valign="top">too dark I think, hard to tell what''s going on</td>', 'too dark I think, hard to tell what''s going on', '2002-08-19 23:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110009, 4805, 2, '<td valign="top">This is so dark and grainy, I''m having real trouble even figuring out what I''m looking at.  Was there an effect used to create the bending of the pencil that necessitated this dark image?</td>', 'This is so dark and grainy, I''m having real trouble even figuring out what I''m looking at.  Was there an effect used to create the bending of the pencil that necessitated this dark image?', '2002-08-20 01:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110010, 4805, 2798, '<td valign="top">Clever shot but Im not clear why it''s lost in this mirky underwater kind of scene. Atmospheric but Im left wondering why.</td>', 'Clever shot but Im not clear why it''s lost in this mirky underwater kind of scene. Atmospheric but Im left wondering why.', '2002-08-20 08:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110011, 4805, 835, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I have to give this picture a 1 because of all the speckles throughout the picture.  I don''t like the shadow that is cast over the middle of pencil and the ends of the pencil seem out of focus.  I do like the idea of a bent pencil and am curious to know how you did it.</td>', 'Sorry, but I have to give this picture a 1 because of all the speckles throughout the picture.  I don''t like the shadow that is cast over the middle of pencil and the ends of the pencil seem out of focus.  I do like the idea of a bent pencil and am curious to know how you did it.', '2002-08-20 09:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110012, 4805, 1041, '<td valign="top">ok, so you got me stumped as to how you did this.  some kind of distortion through glass?  i''m curious to find out on monday.  iin the mean time, i think if you had the pencil/circle more dominant in the photo, that would be nice, for my personal taste, there''s too much background. -- gr8photos (4)</td>', 'ok, so you got me stumped as to how you did this.  some kind of distortion through glass?  i''m curious to find out on monday.  iin the mean time, i think if you had the pencil/circle more dominant in the photo, that would be nice, for my personal taste, there''s too much background. -- gr8photos (4)', '2002-08-20 16:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110013, 4805, 2754, '<td valign="top">Dust on the lens?  I don''t know enough to offer specifics, but I''d like to see the background darker, the subject brighter, and the white flecks gone.  I''m sure someone else can give you the technical details :)</td>', 'Dust on the lens?  I don''t know enough to offer specifics, but I''d like to see the background darker, the subject brighter, and the white flecks gone.  I''m sure someone else can give you the technical details :)', '2002-08-20 16:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110014, 4805, 772, '<td valign="top">This is some intersting sort of pencil :)  I''m not sure I understand the ''specks'' in the image...  - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is some intersting sort of pencil :)  I''m not sure I understand the ''specks'' in the image...  - jmsetzler', '2002-08-20 18:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110015, 4805, 3087, '<td valign="top">Woo! Spooky space pencil. I like this but I don''t know why, so my comment is probably useless, I do apologise. I''ll come back to it if I can offer anything constructive, other than the fact that I like it!<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Woo! Spooky space pencil. I like this but I don''t know why, so my comment is probably useless, I do apologise. I''ll come back to it if I can offer anything constructive, other than the fact that I like it!6, Kavey', '2002-08-20 18:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110016, 4805, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,<br/>Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool', '2002-08-20 20:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110017, 4805, 3198, '<td valign="top">a lot of speckles and low-light distortion. looks kind of outterspace :)</td>', 'a lot of speckles and low-light distortion. looks kind of outterspace :)', '2002-08-21 06:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110018, 4805, 715, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea and I wonder what I''m exactly looking at :) <br/>I think the photo is too dark though. Maybe it would look better if the pencil filled more of the photo.</td>', 'Very creative idea and I wonder what I''m exactly looking at :) I think the photo is too dark though. Maybe it would look better if the pencil filled more of the photo.', '2002-08-21 15:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110019, 4805, 2928, '<td valign="top">Great picture; unusual and interesting...</td>', 'Great picture; unusual and interesting...', '2002-08-21 17:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110020, 4805, 82, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the opening of Fellowship of the Rings, just as Gollum reaches for the ring underwater.</td>', 'Reminds me of the opening of Fellowship of the Rings, just as Gollum reaches for the ring underwater.', '2002-08-22 11:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110021, 4805, 3448, '<td valign="top">That''s a pencil?</td>', 'That''s a pencil?', '2002-08-22 15:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110022, 4805, 2352, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see better lighting on this very interesting subject...</td>', 'I would have liked to see better lighting on this very interesting subject...', '2002-08-22 23:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110023, 4805, 2700, '<td valign="top">interesting, if it was better executed. ie no "wrinkels" from the old navy fleece, and no "specs" whatever those colored dots are all over, I would have given you a 10...</td>', 'interesting, if it was better executed. ie no "wrinkels" from the old navy fleece, and no "specs" whatever those colored dots are all over, I would have given you a 10...', '2002-08-23 00:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110024, 4805, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very interesting... kind of dark and moody and surreal. It doesn''t altogether work for me, but I appreciate that you were trying something very cool in this photo.</td>', 'Very interesting... kind of dark and moody and surreal. It doesn''t altogether work for me, but I appreciate that you were trying something very cool in this photo.', '2002-08-23 15:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110025, 4805, 436, '<td valign="top">what an interesting technique.  There seems to be a lots of white dust in the picture, whether noise or reflections from the curved surface used to reflect the pencil I don''t know.  I wish the whole image were brighter.  Very clever approach and a nice eye</td>', 'what an interesting technique.  There seems to be a lots of white dust in the picture, whether noise or reflections from the curved surface used to reflect the pencil I don''t know.  I wish the whole image were brighter.  Very clever approach and a nice eye', '2002-08-23 15:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110026, 4805, 2807, '<td valign="top">Looks like a print from a very dirty negative.</td>', 'Looks like a print from a very dirty negative.', '2002-08-24 20:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110027, 4805, 554, '<td valign="top">gotta hear how you did this one---neat stuff</td>', 'gotta hear how you did this one---neat stuff', '2002-08-24 22:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110028, 4805, 1042, '<td valign="top">I''m thinking this is supposed to remind us of a comet in the starry sky...but that''s just my interpretation....comet has a "tail"....get it?  and the purple looking blanket thing behind it almost makes it look like a galaxy....I''m not completely sure where you were going with this or even if I''m on target with my interpretation. But that is what I see...the white specks look like stars to me. Although on my screen I think maybe I see too much into the blackness...I see something holding this up...like a stem of something in the center of the bottom. And the line of the blanket directly above the pencil is somewhat distracting...good effort though and unusual...so I''m giving it a 6.</td>', 'I''m thinking this is supposed to remind us of a comet in the starry sky...but that''s just my interpretation....comet has a "tail"....get it?  and the purple looking blanket thing behind it almost makes it look like a galaxy....I''m not completely sure where you were going with this or even if I''m on target with my interpretation. But that is what I see...the white specks look like stars to me. Although on my screen I think maybe I see too much into the blackness...I see something holding this up...like a stem of something in the center of the bottom. And the line of the blanket directly above the pencil is somewhat distracting...good effort though and unusual...so I''m giving it a 6.', '2002-08-25 10:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110029, 4805, 1808, '<td valign="top">Rubber pencil? Hard to see what this is.</td>', 'Rubber pencil? Hard to see what this is.', '2002-08-25 18:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110030, 4805, 3080, '<td valign="top">I used to have a round pencil.  didn''t work for crap. lol.  the lighting is a bit dim here.  looks like you may have done it on purpose though.  what are all the white speks?  I''m not sure exactly what the background is.  looks kind of like a fuzzy sweater with a pocket on the front.  placement and angle are great.  good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I used to have a round pencil.  didn''t work for crap. lol.  the lighting is a bit dim here.  looks like you may have done it on purpose though.  what are all the white speks?  I''m not sure exactly what the background is.  looks kind of like a fuzzy sweater with a pocket on the front.  placement and angle are great.  good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-26 00:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110031, 4805, 2932, '<td valign="top">A detailed description of how I made this is available at <a href="//www.geocities.com/owennnnn/makingof/chaisingitstail" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.geocities.com/owennnnn/makingof/chaisingitstail</a></td>', 'A detailed description of how I made this is available at //www.geocities.com/owennnnn/makingof/chaisingitstail', '2002-08-26 01:11:00.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(110032, 4805, 1845, '<td valign="top">.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-10-10 12:44:10.</i></td>', '.', '2002-08-26 02:02:00.000000', '2003-10-10 13:44:10.000000', 0),
(110033, 4805, 2323, '<td valign="top">I have to confess... I scored this relatively low... but had I known what this really was I would''ve given you a ten for the effort!</td>', 'I have to confess... I scored this relatively low... but had I known what this really was I would''ve given you a ten for the effort!', '2002-08-26 10:38:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(110034, 4806, 2932, '<td valign="top">I hear ya''!</td>', 'I hear ya''!', '2002-08-19 02:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110035, 4806, 806, '<td valign="top">How true! Mine was HGTV and decorating the house, and gardening.... <br/>I now have unfinished projects (curtains, blinds, etc) and weeds in the garden... (Hey! they''re green though!).<br/>Unique and refreshing idea here. Incorporates the pencil without making it the main subject. Good work!</td>', 'How true! Mine was HGTV and decorating the house, and gardening.... I now have unfinished projects (curtains, blinds, etc) and weeds in the garden... (Hey! they''re green though!).Unique and refreshing idea here. Incorporates the pencil without making it the main subject. Good work!', '2002-08-19 11:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110036, 4806, 3280, '<td valign="top">Although the pencil stands out nicely, it seems a little too busy.</td>', 'Although the pencil stands out nicely, it seems a little too busy.', '2002-08-19 11:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110037, 4806, 889, '<td valign="top">the yellow one kills it for me. its too stark.</td>', 'the yellow one kills it for me. its too stark.', '2002-08-19 13:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110038, 4806, 1280, '<td valign="top">Meets Challenge Theme:yes<br/>Technical :good dof<br/>Composition:too busy for my taste<br/>Creativity:fair<br/>Remarks:I''d try a few different arrangements...maybe you did, I just am not crazy about this arrangement.<br/>Grayce...aka...Gracious</td>', 'Meets Challenge Theme:yesTechnical :good dofComposition:too busy for my tasteCreativity:fairRemarks:I''d try a few different arrangements...maybe you did, I just am not crazy about this arrangement.Grayce...aka...Gracious', '2002-08-19 20:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110039, 4806, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love the older flat wooden pencil - it''s colours and form blend well with the other subject matter. I find the yellow pencil a little out of place. I look forward to seeing your outtakes, if you are one who shares them, to see if you have other compositions and arrangements of the items.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'I love the older flat wooden pencil - it''s colours and form blend well with the other subject matter. I find the yellow pencil a little out of place. I look forward to seeing your outtakes, if you are one who shares them, to see if you have other compositions and arrangements of the items.Kavey', '2002-08-20 07:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110040, 4806, 2123, '<td valign="top">I think your lighting might have been a touch harsh, but I love the tones and textures here.</td>', 'I think your lighting might have been a touch harsh, but I love the tones and textures here.', '2002-08-20 15:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110041, 4806, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing5,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,<br/>Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing5,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool', '2002-08-20 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110042, 4806, 3080, '<td valign="top">Great photo, the lighting is nice, and although there are many items in the photo, it doesn''t look cluttered, they are very nicely placed.  The yellow pencil seems a bit out of place, but I think you did that just in case someone didn''t think the carpenters pencil was enough to "meet the challenge".  If this were my photo, I''d take the yellow one out (not needing it to "meet the challenge") retake the photo and hang it in your shop.  It looks like it would have personal meaning to you, and is pretty cool to look at.  It makes me wonder what you used to make with all this.  Birdhouses comes to mind.  Don''t know why.  Anyway, great photo and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Great photo, the lighting is nice, and although there are many items in the photo, it doesn''t look cluttered, they are very nicely placed.  The yellow pencil seems a bit out of place, but I think you did that just in case someone didn''t think the carpenters pencil was enough to "meet the challenge".  If this were my photo, I''d take the yellow one out (not needing it to "meet the challenge") retake the photo and hang it in your shop.  It looks like it would have personal meaning to you, and is pretty cool to look at.  It makes me wonder what you used to make with all this.  Birdhouses comes to mind.  Don''t know why.  Anyway, great photo and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-21 01:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110043, 4806, 2909, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the symbolism.</td>', 'I don''t understand the symbolism.', '2002-08-21 12:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110044, 4806, 2928, '<td valign="top">It''s a great picture technically.  However, I think it looks a little busy which gives it an artificial, set up look.  Perhaps a few less tools would have helped.  Sorry to be negative</td>', 'It''s a great picture technically.  However, I think it looks a little busy which gives it an artificial, set up look.  Perhaps a few less tools would have helped.  Sorry to be negative', '2002-08-21 17:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
