(1368308, 4800, 25355, '<td valign="top">"Chisai tsuchi kuchi"? The two characters go together to make the word "shokichi", which means ''little luck''. I guess these pencils are used in some fortune telling way. There would also be "chukichi" and "daikichi", medium and lots of luck (fortune). Interesting that someone thought it was a DH symbol...</td>', '"Chisai tsuchi kuchi"? The two characters go together to make the word "shokichi", which means ''little luck''. I guess these pencils are used in some fortune telling way. There would also be "chukichi" and "daikichi", medium and lots of luck (fortune). Interesting that someone thought it was a DH symbol...', '2005-05-06 22:19:27.000000', NULL, 0),
